application.errors.custordervalidation.LEADTIME_WEB_ORDER_WEEKEND:
[de][CMA 18.11.15: German translation (2.6.1.2)]Information: Aufträge für das Wochenende können leider nicht Online angelegt werden. Bitte kontaktieren Sie das service Center zur Klärung Ihrer Anfrage. Vielen Dank!
[en][EVM 11.09.15: English translation (2.5.x)]Information: Orders for the weekend can not be placed by web. Please contact your local support responsible to check your request. Thank you.
[fr][ARE 11.09.15: French translation (2.5.x)]Informations: les commandes pour le weekend ne peuvent être saisies par Internet. Veuillez contacter votre centre logistique afin de vérifier votre requête. Merci
[it][MAL 11.09.15: Italian translation (2.5.x)]Informazione: gli ordini per il weekend non possono essere inseriti via web. Si prega di contattare il vostro responsabile dell'assistenza per verificare le vostre richieste. Grazie.
[es][JUR 11.09.15: Spanish translation (2.5.x)]Atención: No pueden realizarse pedidos para el fin de semana vía web. Por favor, contacte con atención al cliente para verificar su petición. Gracias.
[cs][MNO 11.09.15: Czech translation (2.5.x)]Informace: Objednávky na víkend nelze zadat do aplikace. Prosím, kontaktujte CRH pro zadání Vašeho požadavku. Děkujeme.
[sk][PPR 11.09.15: Slovak translation (2.5.x)]Informácia: Objednávky na víkend nemôžu byť zadané cez web. Prosím kontaktujte CRH za účelom upresnenia Vašej žiadosti. Ďakujem.
[hu][VHE 11.09.15: Hungarian translation (2.5.x)]Információ: A megrendelés létrehozása hétvégére nem lehetséges. Kérjük lépjen kapcsolatba a fuvarszervező kollégánkkal hétvégi megrendelésével kapcsolatban. Köszönjük!
[ro][VUN 11.09.15: Romanian translation (2.5.x)]Informare: Comenzile cu livrare in weekend nu pot fi plasate prin Web. Va rugam sa contactati Dispeceratul local pentru a va prelua comanda. Va multumim!
[bg][RTO 13.08.12: Bulgarian translation (2.0.10.0)]Информация: не е възможно да правите поръчки за уикенда през интернет. Моля свържете се с Холсим, за да проверите заявката си. Благодарим Ви!
[hr][DBE 13.08.12: Croatian translation (2.0.10.0)]Informacije: Narudžbe za vikend ne mogu biti smještene na webu.Molimo kontaktirajte Holcim za Vaš zahtjev. Hvala Vam.
[sr][EVM 13.08.12: Remains in English (2.0.10.0)]Information: Orders for the weekend can not be placed by web. Please contact Holcim to check your request. Thank you.
[ru][EDU 13.08.12: Russian translation (2.0.10.0)]Информация: заказы на выходные дни не могут быть созданы онлайн. Пожалуйста, свяжитесь с "Холсим" для проверки запроса. Спасибо.
[pl][EVM 13.08.12: Remains in English (2.0.10.0)]Information: Orders for the weekend can not be placed by web. Please contact Holcim to check your request. Thank you.
[az][FKA 11.09.15: Azeri translation (2.5.x)]Informasiya: həftə sonu üçün sifarişlər veb sayt vasitəsilə verilə bilməz. Sorğunuzu yoxlamaq üçün zavoda müraciət edin. Təşəkkür edirik.
[tr][EVM 13.08.12: Remains in English (2.0.10.0)]Information: Orders for the weekend can not be placed by web. Please contact Holcim to check your request. Thank you.
[nl][EVM 11.09.15: Remains in English (2.5.x)]Information: Orders for the weekend can not be placed by web. Please contact your local support responsible to check your request. Thank you.
