application.help.text.external:
[de][CMA 13.08.12: German translation (2.0.10.0)]Bei Problemen oder Fragen zu LOGON kontaktieren Sie bitte Ihre üblichen Kontaktpersonen (Auftragsannahme, Logistik, etc.).
[en][EVM 11.09.15: English translation (2.5.x)]For any help with LOGON please phone your regular local support contact (order taking, logistics).
[fr][MLA 13.08.12: French translation (2.0.10.0)]Pour demander de l'aide lors d'un problème avec LOGON, veuillez contacter votre personne de contact (helpdesk).
[it][MAL 11.09.15: Italian translation (2.5.x)]Per qualsiasi supporto per LOGON si prega di contattare l'assistenza locale (order taking, logistica).
[es][JUR 11.09.15: Spanish translation (2.5.x)]Para asistencia sobre LOGON llame a su contacto local (Toma de Pedidos, logística).
[cs][MNO 11.09.15: Czech translation (2.5.x)]Pro pomoc s aplikací LOGON volejte Vaší kontaktní osobu z CRH (příjem objednávek, logistika).
[sk][PPR 11.09.15: Slovak translation (2.5.x)]Pre pomoc s odhlásením volajte Vašu kontaktnú osobu v CRH (príjem objednávok, logistika)
[hu][VHE 11.09.15: Hungarian translation (2.5.x)]Ha szüksége lenne segítségre a LOGON-nal kapcsolatban, kérem lépjen telefonos kapcsolatba a helyi kapcsolattartójával (fuvarszervező, logisztika).
[ro][VUN 13.08.12: Romanian translation (2.0.10.0)]Pentru orice ajutor LOGON va rugam sunati la numarul de telefon cunoscut (dispcerat preluare comenzi)
[bg][RTO 13.08.12: Bulgarian translation (2.0.10.0)]За помощ свързана с LOGON моля свържете се с служител на Холсим (приемане на поръчки, логистика)
[hr][DBE 11.09.15: Croatian translation (2.5.x)]Za bilo kakvu pomoć sa LOGON molimo nazvati svoj redoviti lokalni Holcim kontakt (uzimanje narudžbi, logistika).
[sr][EVM 13.08.12: Remains in English (2.0.10.0)]For any help with LOGON please phone your regular local Holcim contact (order taking, logistics).
[ru][IGO 11.09.15: Russian translation (2.5.x)]Для любой помощи с LOGON, пожалуйста, позвоните вашему контактному лицу (лицу, принимающему заказы; логистам)
[pl][EVM 13.08.12: Remains in English (2.0.10.0)]For any help with LOGON please phone your regular local Holcim contact (order taking, logistics).
[az][FKA 11.09.15: Azeri translation (2.5.x)]Qeydiyyatdan keçməklə əlaqədar (LOGON) yardım almaq üçün, zavodun məhsul şəxsin əlaqə nömrələrinə müraciət edin (sifarişlərin qəbulu, logistika).
[tr][EVM 13.08.12: Remains in English (2.0.10.0)]For any help with LOGON please phone your regular local Holcim contact (order taking, logistics).
[nl][EVM 11.09.15: Remains in English (2.5.x)]For any help with LOGON please phone your regular local support contact (order taking, logistics).
application.help.text.internal:
[de][EVM 02.07.12: German translation]Bei Problemen oder Fragen zu LOGON folgen Sie bitte den üblichen Support-Prozessen (Key-User, IT Helpdesk).
[en][JJI 03.05.12: English translation]For any help with LOGON please follow the standard support process (key users, IT helpdesk).
[fr][LPR 02.07.12: French translation]Pour obtenir de l'aide dans LOGON veuillez suivre le processus  standard (helpdesk) .
[it][EVM 15.06.12: Italian translation]Per qualsiasi aiuto con LOGON si prega di seguire il processo standard di supporto (key users, IT helpdesk).
[es][EVM 21.11.12: Spanish translation (2.1.0.5)]Para asistencia sobre LOGON siga el protocolo estándar de soporte (Key Users,  departamento técnico IT).
[cs][MNO 30.04.13: Czech translation (2.1.5.0)]Pro pomoc s LOGONem postupujte dle běžných procesů podpory (klíčový uživatel, IT Helpdesk).
[sk][PPR 01.05.13: Slovak translation (2.1.5.0)]Pre pomoc s odhlásením postupujte podľa bežných podporných postupov (key-user, IT helpdesk)
[hu][LKO 14.05.13: Hungarian translations (2.1.5.0)]LOGON-nal kapcsolatos segítségért kérem kövesse az alap támogató folyamatot (key users, IT)
[ro][CLU 29.04.13: Romanian translation (2.1.5.0)]Pentru orice ajutor LOGON va rugam sa urmati procesul standard de suport (utilizatori cheie, IT, helpdesk)
[bg][IDO 09.05.13: Bulgarian translation (2.1.5.0)]За помощ свързана с LOGON моля следвайте стандартния процес по поддръжка (ключов потребител, ИТ хелпдеск)
[hr][DBE 28.11.13: Croatian translation (2.2.0.8)]Za bilo kakvu pomoć sa LOGON slijedite standardni postupak podrške (ključni korisnici, IT helpdesk).
[sr][EVM 09.11.13: Remains in English]For any help with LOGON please follow the standard support process (key users, IT helpdesk).
[ru][EDU 02.09.14: Russian translation (2.2.7.0)]Для любой помощи с LOGON, пожалуйста, следуйте стандартному процессу поддержки (свяжитесь с ключевыми пользователями, IT-службой технической поддержки).
