application.ext.login.pwd.locked.self:
[de][NHI 15.08.12: German translation (2.0.1.0)]Ihr externes Login Passwort ist gesperrt, sie müssen es erst entsperren lassen.
[en][AdN 05.07.12: English translation (2.0.1.0)]Your external login password is locked, you have to unlock it first.
[fr][LPR 22.08.12: French translation (2.0.1.0)]Votre mot de passe de connexion externe est verrouillé, veuillez d'abord le déverrouiller
[it][MAL 13.08.12: Italian translation (2.0.1.0)]Tua password di accesso esterna bloccata
[es][EVM 21.11.12: Spanish translation (2.1.0.5)]Su contraseña de inicio de sesión externo esta bloqueada. Debe desbloquearse primero.
[cs][MNO 30.04.13: Czech translation (2.1.5.0)]Vaše externí přihlašovací heslo je uzamčeno, musí být nejdříve odemčeno.
[sk][PPR 01.05.13: Slovak translation (2.1.5.0)]Vaše heslo externého prihlásenia je zablokované, musíte ho najprv odblokovať.
[hu][LKO 14.05.13: Hungarian translations (2.1.5.0)]A jelszeva blokkolva van, először fel kell oldani.
[ro][CLU 29.04.13: Romanian translation (2.1.5.0)]Parola de conectare externa blocata, trebuie deblocata
[bg][IDO 09.05.13: Bulgarian translation (2.1.5.0)]Вашата външна парола е заключена, моля първо я отключете
[hr][DBE 28.11.13: Croatian translation (2.2.0.8)]Vaša vanjska lozinka je zaključan, morate ju prvo otključati .
[sr][EVM 09.11.13: Remains in English]Your external login password is locked, you have to unlock it first.
[ru][EDU 02.09.14: Russian translation (2.2.7.0)]Ваш внешний вход заблокирован, Вам необходимо разблокировать вход.
[pl][EVM 28.11.13: Remains in English]Your external login password is locked, you have to unlock it first.
[az][FKA 04.06.14: Azeri translation (2.2.7.0)]Sizin xarici loginin parolu kilidlənib, əvvəlcə onun kilidini açın.
[tr][EVM 01.10.13: Remains in English (2.2.7.0)]Your external login password is locked, you have to unlock it first.
[nl][ARE 11.09.15: Dutch translation (2.5.x)]Uw externe login wachtwoord is vergrendeld , eerst wachtwoord ongrendelen
application.ext.login.pwd.locked.admin:
[de][NHI 15.08.12: German translation (2.0.1.0)]Das externe Login Passwort des Benutzers ist gesperrt. Informieren sie den Benutzer manuell über sein neues Passwort wenn sie es entsperrt haben.
[en][AdN 05.07.12: English translation (2.0.1.0)]The external login password of the user is locked, you have to inform the user manually about the new password when unlocking.
[fr][LPR 22.08.12: French translation (2.0.1.0)]Le mot de passe de connexion externe de cet utilisateur est verrouillé, veuillez informer l'utilisateur manuellement du nouveau mot de passe lors du déverrouillage.
[it][MAL 13.08.12: Italian translation (2.0.1.0)]la password di accesso esterno dell'utente è bloccata, è necessario informare l'utente riguardo la nuova password per lo sblocco
[es][EVM 21.11.12: Spanish translation (2.1.0.5)]La contraseña de inicio de sesión externo del usuario está bloqueada, deberá informar al usuario a cerca de la nueva contraseña tras desbloquearla.
[cs][MNO 30.04.13: Czech translation (2.1.5.0)]Heslo externího uživatele je zablokováno, informujte uživatele manuálně o novém heslo, až bude odblokované.
[sk][PPR 01.05.13: Slovak translation (2.1.5.0)]Heslo externého prihlásenia užívateľa je zablokované, informujte užívateľa manuálne o novom hesle keď bude odblokované.
[hu][LKO 14.05.13: Hungarian translations (2.1.5.0)]A felhasználó jelszava blokkolva lett, kérem az új jelszóról informálja a felhasználót.
[ro][CLU 29.04.13: Romanian translation (2.1.5.0)]Parola de conectare externa a utilizatorului este blocata, trebuie sa informezi utilizatorul despre noua parola dupa deblocare.
[bg][IDO 09.05.13: Bulgarian translation (2.1.5.0)]Потребителската външна парола е заключена. Трябва да информирата потребителя писмено, когато я отключите.
[hr][DBE 28.11.13: Croatian translation (2.2.0.8)]Vanjska lozinka korisnika je zaključana, morate obavijestiti korisnika ručno o novoj lozinci prilikom otključavanja.
[sr][EVM 09.11.13: Remains in English]The external login password of the user is locked, you have to inform the user manually about the new password when unlocking.
[ru][EDU 02.09.14: Russian translation (2.2.7.0)]Внешний пароль для входа пользователя заблокирован, вы должны сообщить пользователю вручную о новом пароле при разблокировке.
[pl][EVM 28.11.13: Remains in English]The external login password of the user is locked, you have to inform the user manually about the new password when unlocking.
[az][FKA 04.06.14: Azeri translation (2.2.7.0)]İstifadəçinin xarici logininin parolu kilidlənib, kilid açılarkən yeni parol barədə istifadəçiyə məlumat verməlisiniz.
[tr][EVM 01.10.13: Remains in English (2.2.7.0)]The external login password of the user is locked, you have to inform the user manually about the new password when unlocking.
[nl][ARE 11.09.15: Dutch translation (2.5.x)]De externe login wachtwoord van de gebruiker is vergrendeld, u moet de gebruiker handmatig informeren over het nieuw wachtwoord
