auftragbearbeitung.messagebox.confirm.alreadyloaded:
[de][EVM 02.07.12: German translation]Der zugewiesene LKW hat noch den Status geladen. Soll der Status auf leer gesetzt werden?
[en][JJI 03.05.12: English translation]The assigned truck has got the status loaded. Do you want to update the status to empty?
[fr][JJF 04.05.12: French translation]Le camion choisi a toujours les données chargées. Voulez-vous resaisir les données?
[it][MAL 25.09.12: Italian translation]Il camion ha ancora lo stato "caricato", si vuole sostituire lo stato con "vuoto"?
[es][EVM 21.11.12: Spanish translation (2.1.0.5)]El camión asignado consta con estado "cargado". Quiere cambiar el estado a "vacío"?
[cs][MNO 30.04.13: Czech translation (2.1.5.0)]Zvolené vozidlo má status Naloženo. Chcete opravdu změnit status na Prázdné?
[sk][PPR 01.05.13: Slovak translation (2.1.5.0)]Priradené vozidlo má status naložené. Zmeniť status na prázdne?
[hu][LKO 14.05.13: Hungarian translations (2.1.5.0)]A kiválasztott jármű státusza, megtöltve. Szeretné üresre módosítani?
[ro][CLU 29.04.13: Romanian translation (2.1.5.0)]Camionul desemnat are statutul "incarcat". Doriti sa schimbati statutul la "gol"?
[bg][IDO 09.05.13: Bulgarian translation (2.1.5.0)]Избраният камион е със статус натоварен. Искате ли да промените статуса на празен?
[hr][DBE 11.12.13: Croatian translation]Dodijeljeni kamion ima status utovaren. Želite li ažurirati status u novi?
[sr][EVM 09.11.13: Remains in English]The assigned truck has got the status loaded. Do you want to update the status to empty?
[ru][EDU 02.09.14: Russian translation (2.2.7.0)]Назначенный грузовик получил статус загружен. Вы хотите обновить статус?
[pl][EVM 28.11.13: Remains in English]The assigned truck has got the status loaded. Do you want to update the status to empty?
[az][FKA 04.06.14: Azeri translation (2.2.7.0)]Təyin edilmiş yük maşını yüklənilmiş statusuna malikdir. Bu status boş statusuna dəyişdirilsin?
[tr][EVM 01.10.13: Remains in English (2.2.7.0)]The assigned truck has got the status loaded. Do you want to update the status to empty?
[nl][EVM 11.09.15: Remains in English (2.5.x)]The assigned truck has got the status loaded. Do you want to update the status to empty?
