[de][CMA 11.09.15: German translation (2.5.x)]Bitte allgemenine Fitertext Kriterien eingeben. Andere Suchkriterien werden ignoriert.
[en][AdN 06.07.15: English translation (2.2.4.2)]Enter general filter text criteria. If filled all other search criteria is ignored.
[fr][ARE 11.09.15: French translation (2.5.x)]Entrez un filtre texte général. Si ce champs est rempli, tout les autres critères de recherche seront ignorés.
[it][MAL 11.09.15: Italian translation (2.5.x)]Inserire i criteri di filtro di testo generali. Se immessi tutti gli altri criteri sono ignorati
[es][JUR 11.09.15: Spanish translation (2.5.x)]Enter general filter text criteria. If filled all other search criteria is ignored. (es)
[cs][EVM 11.09.15: Remains in English (2.5.x)]Enter general filter text criteria. If filled all other search criteria is ignored.
[sk][PPR 11.09.15: Slovak translation (2.5.x)]Zadajte všeobecný text kritériám filtra. Ak sa naplnili všetky ostatné kritériá vyhľadávania je ignorovaná.
[hu][VHE 11.09.15: Hungarian translation (2.5.x)]Adja meg az általános szűrési feltételt. Ha megadja, akkor a többi keresési feltételt a rendszer figyelmen kívül hagyja.
[ro][VUN 11.09.15: Romanian translation (2.5.x)]Introduceti criteriul general de filtrare. In cazul in care acesta este introdus, celelalte criterii vor fi ignorate.
[bg][RTO 11.09.15: Bulgarian translation (2.5.x)]Въведете филтър за търсене по основен критерий. Ако е попълнен - всички други критерии се игнорират
[hr][DBE 11.09.15: Croatian translation (2.5.x)]Unesite opće kriteije za filtriranje. Ako su uneseni kriteriji zanemareni
[sr][EVM 11.09.15: Remains in English (2.5.x)]Enter general filter text criteria. If filled all other search criteria is ignored.
[ru][IGO 11.09.15: Russian translation (2.5.x)]Применить общий критерий фильтра текста. При применении, все другие критерии поиска игнорируются
[pl][EVM 11.09.15: Remains in English (2.5.x)]Enter general filter text criteria. If filled all other search criteria is ignored.
