auftragbearbeitung.texte.ordernofilter.mouseover:
[de][CMA 11.09.15: German translation (2.5.x)]Bitte hier Auftragsnummer Suchkriterien eingeben. Andere Suchkriterien werden ignoriert um zu garantieren, das der Auftrag
[en][AdN 06.07.15: English translation (2.2.4.2)]Add here order number search criteria. If filled all other search criteria is ignored to guarantee that the order is found amongst the loadable/loaded orders.
[fr][ARE 11.09.15: French translation (2.5.x)]Ajoutez ici le numéro de la commande recherchée. Si ce champs est rempli, tout les autres critéres de recherche seront ignorés
[it][MAL 11.09.15: Italian translation (2.5.x)]Inserire qui criteri di ricerca del numero ordine. Se immesso tutti gli altri criteri di ricerca verrano ignorati per garantire che l'ordine trovato sia tra gli ordini caricabili/caricati.
[es][JUR 11.09.15: Spanish translation (2.5.x)]Add here order number search criteria. If filled all other search criteria is ignored to guarantee that the order is found amongst the loadable/loaded orders. (es)
[cs][EVM 11.09.15: Remains in English (2.5.x)]Add here order number search criteria. If filled all other search criteria is ignored to guarantee that the order is found amongst the loadable/loaded orders.
[sk][PPR 11.09.15: Slovak translation (2.5.x)]Do kritéria zadajte čísla objednávok. Ak sa naplnili všetky ostatné kritériá vyhľadávania je ignorovaná, aby bolo zaručené, že objednávka sa nachádza medzi ložiteľnými objednávkami.
[hu][VHE 11.09.15: Hungarian translation (2.5.x)]Írja be a keresendő megrendelési számot. Ha megadja a megrendelési számot, akkor az összes többi szűrési beállítást figyelmen kívül hagyja a rendszer, hogy a megrendelést megtalálja a megtölthető, vagy megtöltött megrendelések között.
[ro][VUN 11.09.15: Romanian translation (2.5.x)]Introduceti aici numar comenzii. In cazul in care acesta este introdus, celelalte criterii vor fi ignorate pentru a garanta identificarea comenzii printre comenzile de incarcat/incarcate.
[bg][RTO 11.09.15: Bulgarian translation (2.5.x)]Въведете тук критерий за търсене на поръчка. Ако е попълнено всички други критерии са игнорирани за да се гарантирара че поръчката се търси по натоварени поръчки.
[hr][DBE 11.09.15: Croatian translation (2.5.x)]Unesi broj naloga kao kriterij za pretraživanje. Ukoliko unesen svi ostali kriteriji za pretraživanje biti će ignorirani.
[sr][EVM 11.09.15: Remains in English (2.5.x)]Add here order number search criteria. If filled all other search criteria is ignored to guarantee that the order is found amongst the loadable/loaded orders.
[ru][IGO 11.09.15: Russian translation (2.5.x)]Добавить здесь критерий поиска номера заказа. При применении, все другие критерии поиска игнорируются для обеспечения нахождения заказа среди загружаемых/загруженных
[pl][EVM 11.09.15: Remains in English (2.5.x)]Add here order number search criteria. If filled all other search criteria is ignored to guarantee that the order is found amongst the loadable/loaded orders.
[az][FKA 11.09.15: Azerbaijani translation (2.5.x)]Burada sıra axtarış meyarlara əlavə edin.Burada sıra axtarış meyarlara əlavə edin. Əgər bütün digər axtarış meyarları iqnordadisa sifariş yüklemeli / yüklənmiş sifarişlər arasında tapilar
[tr][EVM 11.09.15: Remains in English (2.5.x)]Add here order number search criteria. If filled all other search criteria is ignored to guarantee that the order is found amongst the loadable/loaded orders.
[nl][EVM 11.09.15: Remains in English (2.5.x)]Add here order number search criteria. If filled all other search criteria is ignored to guarantee that the order is found amongst the loadable/loaded orders.
