bestellung.error.cloneerror:
[de][JTI 05.07.12: German translation]Das Material ist nicht mehr für den zu klonenden Auftrag verfügbar, bzw. ist der Cotract nicht mehr gültig.
[en][JJI 03.05.12: English translation (2.0.0.8)]The material is not anymore available in contract of the clonable order, or the contract is not valid anymore.
[fr][LPR 02.07.12: French translation]Le matériel n'est plus disponible dans l'ordre, ou le contrat n'est plus disponible.
[it][EVM 07.06.12: Italian translation]Il materiale non è più disponibile nel contratto dell'ordine duplicabile, o il caontratto non è più valido.
[es][EVM 21.11.12: Spanish translation (2.1.0.5)]El material ya no está disponible en el contrato, o el contrato ya no es válido.
[cs][MNO 30.04.13: Czech translation (2.1.5.0)]Materiál není již dostupný v kontraktu kopírované objednávky nebo není kontrakt platný.
[sk][PPR 01.05.13: Slovak translation (2.1.5.0)]materiál už nie je dostupný v klónovanej objednávke, alebo vypršala platnosť zmluvy
[hu][LKO 14.05.13: Hungarian translations (2.1.5.0)]Az anyag nem elérhető a kontrakton, vagy a kontrakt nem érvényes.
[ro][CLU 29.04.13: Romanian translation (2.1.5.0)]Materialul nu este disponibil in contract, sau contractul nu este valid
[bg][IDO 09.05.13: Bulgarian translation (2.1.5.0)]Материала не е наличен в договора от копираната поръчка, или договора не е валиден вече.
[hr][DBE 11.12.13: Croatian translation]Materijal nije više dostupan u ugovoru narudžbe ili ugovor više nije važeći.
[sr][EVM 09.11.13: Remains in English]The material is not anymore available in contract of the clonable order, or the contract is not valid anymore.
[ru][EDU 02.09.14: Russian translation (2.2.7.0)]Материала больше нет в наличии в контракте, выбранном в заказе, или контракт неактуален.
[pl][EVM 28.11.13: Remains in English]The material is not anymore available in contract of the clonable order, or the contract is not valid anymore.
[az][FKA 04.06.14: Azeri translation (2.2.7.0)]Material artıq müqavilədə mövcud deyil, ya da müqavilə artıq etibarlı deyil.
[tr][EVM 01.10.13: Remains in English (2.2.7.0)]The material is not anymore available in contract of the clonable order, or the contract is not valid anymore.
[nl][EVM 11.09.15: Remains in English (2.5.x)]The material is not anymore available in contract of the clonable order, or the contract is not valid anymore.
bestellung.error.alreadyselected:
[de][EVM 02.07.12: German translation]Das gewählte Material existiert bereits als Auftragsposition. Bitte direkt Auftragsposition anpassen.
[en][JJI 03.05.12: English translation]The selected material is already added to the order. Please adjust the ordered quantity in case you want to order more!
[fr][LPR 02.07.12: French translation]Le matériel selectionné existe déjà dans la  commande. Veuillez ajuster la quantité si vous souhaitez en commander plus.
[it][EVM 25.05.12: Italian translation]L'articolo è gia presente nell'ordine, correggi la quantità se ne vuoi di più.
[es][EVM 21.11.12: Spanish translation (2.1.0.5)]El material seleccionado ya ha sido añadido al pedido. Por favor ajuste la cantidad si lo que quiere es pedir más.
[cs][MNO 30.04.13: Czech translation (2.1.5.0)]Vybraný materiál je již přidán k objednávce. Prosím upravte objednané množství, pokud chcete objednat více!
[sk][PPR 01.05.13: Slovak translation (2.1.5.0)]Vybraný materiál už je priradený k objednávke. Prosím upravte objednané množstvo v prípade ak chcete objednať viac!
[hu][LKO 14.05.13: Hungarian translations (2.1.5.0)]A kiválasztott anyag már hozzá lett adva a megrendeléshez. Kérem, növelje a megrendelt mennyiséget, ha többet szeretne rendelni.
[ro][CLU 29.04.13: Romanian translation (2.1.5.0)]Materialul selectat este deja adaugat in comanda. Va rugam sa reglati cantitatea din comanda in cazul in care doriti sa comandati mai mult.
[bg][IDO 09.05.13: Bulgarian translation (2.1.5.0)]Избраният материал вече е добавен в поръчката. Моля променете количеството на поръчката, в случай че искате да поръчате повече!
[hr][DBE 28.11.13: Croatian translation (2.2.0.8)]Odabrani materijal je već dodan u narudžbu. Molimo podesite naručenu količinu u slučaju da želite naručiti više!
[sr][EVM 09.11.13: Remains in English]The selected material is already added to the order. Please adjust the ordered quantity in case you want to order more!
[ru][EDU 02.09.14: Russian translation (2.2.7.0)]Выбранный материал уже добавлен в заказ. Пожалуйста, измените заказанное количество, в случае, если вы хотите заказать больше!
[pl][EVM 28.11.13: Remains in English]The selected material is already added to the order. Please adjust the ordered quantity in case you want to order more!
[az][FKA 04.06.14: Azeri translation (2.2.7.0)]Seçilmiş material artıq sifarişə əlavə edildi. Əgər daha çox sifariş etmək istəyirsinizsə, zəhmət olmasa, sifariş olunan miqdarda düzəliş edin!
[tr][EVM 01.10.13: Remains in English (2.2.7.0)]The selected material is already added to the order. Please adjust the ordered quantity in case you want to order more!
[nl][EVM 11.09.15: Remains in English (2.5.x)]The selected material is already added to the order. Please adjust the ordered quantity in case you want to order more!
bestellung.error.cannotaddmorebulk:
[de][NHI 05.07.12: German translation]Nicht möglich mehr als einen lose Artikel pro Bestellung hinzuzufügen!
[en][JJI 03.05.12: English translation (2.0.0.8)]Cannot add more than one bulk order item to the order!
[fr][LPR 02.07.12: French translation]Impossible d'ajouter plus d'un article en vrac à la commande!
[it][EVM 06.09.12: Italian translation]Non è possibile aggiungere più di un articolo tipo sfuso all'ordine!
[es][EVM 21.11.12: Spanish translation (2.1.0.5)]¡No se puede añadir más de un producto a granel al pedido!
[cs][MNO 30.04.13: Czech translation (2.1.5.0)]Není možné přidat více než jednu položku do volně ložené objednávky!
[sk][PPR 01.05.13: Slovak translation (2.1.5.0)]Nie je možné pridať viac ako jeden voľne ložený materiál k objednávke!
[hu][LKO 14.05.13: Hungarian translations (2.1.5.0)]Egynél több termék nem adható hozzá a rendeléshez.
[ro][CLU 29.04.13: Romanian translation (2.1.5.0)]Nu puteti adauga mai mult de un articol vrac in comanda
[bg][IDO 09.05.13: Bulgarian translation (2.1.5.0)]Не може да се добавя повече от един ред за насипен цимент в поръчката!
[hr][DBE 11.12.13: Croatian translation]Nije moguće dodati više od jedne stavke za rasuto u narudžbu!
[sr][EVM 09.11.13: Remains in English]Cannot add more than one bulk order item to the order!
[ru][EDU 02.09.14: Russian translation (2.2.7.0)]Не возможно добавить более одной позиции в заказ с навальным продуктом!
