bestellung.error.sapmaterialsarea:
[de][EVM 09.04.14: German translation (2.2.3.0)]Fehler bei der Anpassung des Materials. Das Material is durch den Vertrag definiert and nicht in der Sales Area vorhanden.
[en][EVM 09.04.14: English translation (2.2.2.0)]Error while resolving or removing materials. The material is defined by the contract but not linked to sales area.
[fr][EVM 09.04.14: French translation (2.2.3.0)]Erreur lors de l'importation ou de la modification du matériel. Le matériel est défini par le contrat mais pas lié à la zone de vente.
[it][EVM 09.04.14: Italian translation (2.2.3.0)]Errore durante la risoluzione o la rimozione dei materiali. Il materiale è definito dal contratto ma non legato alla Sales Area.
[es][EVM 09.04.14: Spanish translation (2.2.3.0)]Error al determinar o remover los materiales. El material se define por el contrato pero no está relacionado con el Área de Ventas.
[cs][EVM 09.04.14: Remains in English (2.2.3.0)]Error while resolving or removing materials. The material is defined by the contract but not linked to sales area.
[sk][EVM 09.04.14: Slovak translation (2.2.3.0)]Chyba z dôvodu zmeny alebo odobrania materiálu. Materiál je definovaný na kontrakte, ale nie je prepojený s predajnou oblasťou.
[hu][EVM 09.04.14: Hungarian translation (2.2.3.0)]Hiba amikor a termék kiadásánál. A termék szerepel ugyan a szerződésben, de nincsen értékesítési területhez kapcsolva.
[ro][EVM 09.04.14: Romanian translation (2.2.3.0)]Eroare cand rezolvi sau muti materialul. Materialul este definiti in contract, dar nu este asignat ariei de vanzari.
[bg][EVM 09.04.14: Bulgarian translation (2.2.3.0)]Грешка при разрешаване или премахване на материали. Материалът се определя от договора, но не е свързан с търговската област.
[hr][EVM 09.04.14: Croatian translation (2.2.3.0)]Greška prilikom pretvaranja ili uklanjanja materijala. Materijal je definiran ugovorom, ali nije vezan za prodajno mjesto.
[sr][EVM 09.04.14: Remains in English (2.2.3.0)]Error while resolving or removing materials. The material is defined by the contract but not linked to sales area.
[ru][EDU 02.09.14: Russian translation (2.2.7.0)]Ошибка при разрешении или удалении материалов. Материал определяется договором, но не связан с областью продаж.
[pl][EVM 09.04.14: Remains in English (2.2.3.0)]Error while resolving or removing materials. The material is defined by the contract but not linked to sales area.
[az][FKA 04.06.14: Azeri translation (2.2.7.0)]Materialların həllindəvə ya aradan qaldırılmasında səhv var. Bu materiallar müqavilə ilə müəyyən edilmişdir amma satış ərazisi ilə əlaqəli eyil.
[tr][EVM 01.10.13: Remains in English (2.2.7.0)]Error while resolving or removing materials. The material is defined by the contract but not linked to sales area.
[nl][EVM 11.09.15: Remains in English (2.5.x)]Error while resolving or removing materials. The material is defined by the contract but not linked to sales area.

