confirm.trim.textarealength:
[de][EVM 27.08.12: German translation]Der Inhalt von Feld "{0}" darf maximal {1} Zeichen lang sein. Speichern wird den Text kürzen. Fortfahren?
[en][JJI 27.08.12: English translation]Content of field "{0}" is too long (maximum {1}  characters allowed). Saving will trim the field. Do you want to continue?
[fr][JJF 27.08.12: French translation]Contenu du champ "{0}" est trop long (maximum {1} caractères autorisés). Enregistrer va racourcir le champ. Voulez-vous continuer?
[it][EVM 27.08.12: Italian translation]Il contenute del campo "{0}" puo' contenere al massimo 1 carattere, il testo verrà abbreviato, continuare?
[es][EVM 21.11.12: Spanish translation (2.1.0.5)]El contenido del campo "{0}" es demasiado largo (máximo {1} caracteres permitidos). Al guardar se eliminarán caracteres sobrantes. Está seguro de querer continuar?
[cs][MNO 30.04.13: Czech translation (2.1.5.0)]Obsah pole  "{0}" je příliš dlouhý (maximálně {1} je povoleno). Uložení zkráceného textu. Chcete pokračovat?
[sk][PPR 01.05.13: Slovak translation (2.1.5.0)]Obsah pola  "{0}" je príliš dlhý (maximálne {1} znakov povolených). Uloženie skráti text. Chcete pokračovať?
[hu][LKO 14.05.13: Hungarian translations (2.1.5.0)]A "{0}" mező tartalma túl hosszú (maximum {1} karakter megengedett). Mentéskor a mező a kívánt méretre fomrálódik. Szeretné folytatni?
[ro][CLU 29.04.13: Romanian translation (2.1.5.0)]Continutul campului "{0}" este prea lung (maxim {1} caractere sunt permise). Salvarea va elimina caracterele in plus. Doriti sa continuati?
[bg][IDO 09.05.13: Bulgarian translation (2.1.5.0)]Съдържанието на поле "{0}" е твърде дълго (максимален брой позволени символи {1}). Запазвнето ще съкрати текста. Искате ли да продължите?
[hr][DBE 28.11.13: Croatian translation (2.2.0.8)]Sadržaj polja "{0}" je predug (maksimalno {1} dozvoljeno znakova). Spremanje će smanjiti polje. Želite li nastaviti?
[sr][EVM 09.11.13: Remains in English]Content of field "{0}" is too long (maximum {1}  characters allowed). Saving will trim the field. Do you want to continue?
[ru][EDU 02.09.14: Russian translation (2.2.7.0)]Содержание поля "{0}" слишком длинное (допустимый максимум {1} символов). Сохранение обрежет поле. Хотите продолжить?
[pl][EVM 28.11.13: Remains in English]Content of field "{0}" is too long (maximum {1}  characters allowed). Saving will trim the field. Do you want to continue?
[az][FKA 04.06.14: Azeri translation (2.2.7.0)]{0} bəndi çox uzundur (maksimum {1} işarə ola bilər). Yaddaşda saxlasanız, həmin bənd yarıda kəsiləcək. Davam  etmək istəyirsinizmi?
[tr][EVM 01.10.13: Remains in English (2.2.7.0)]Content of field "{0}" is too long (maximum {1}  characters allowed). Saving will trim the field. Do you want to continue?
