dispo.texte.warning.changing.notauthorized.assignment:
[de][JTI 05.07.12: German translation]Sie sind gerade dabei einen Auftrag zu stornieren, welche einem Fahrzeug eines anderen Unternehmens zugeordnet ist. Bitte informieren Sie dieses Unternehmen wenn Sie fortfahren!
[en][JJI 03.05.12: English translation (2.0.0.8)]You are about to cancel an assignment which is assigned to the truck of another company. Please inform the company if you proceed!
[fr][LPR 02.07.12: French translation]Vous êtes sur le point d'annuler une attribution qui est assignée au camion d'un autre transporteur. Veuillez  l'informer.
[it][MAL 25.09.12: Italian translation]Sta per annullare un'assegnazione che viene assegnata al camion di un'altra società. PF informare la società se si procede!
[es][EVM 21.11.12: Spanish translation (2.1.0.5)]Está usted apunto de cancelar una asignación a un camión de otra compañía. ¡Por favor informe a la compañía en caso de querer continuar!
[cs][MNO 30.04.13: Czech translation (2.1.5.0)]Právě se chystáte smazat přiřazení k vozidlu jiné společnosti. Prosím informujte společnost, pokud budete pokračovat.
[sk][PPR 01.05.13: Slovak translation (2.1.5.0)]Práve idete vymazať priradenie ktoré je priradené na vozidle inej spoločnosti. Prosím informujte spoločnosť ak budete pokračovať!
[hu][LKO 14.05.13: Hungarian translations (2.1.5.0)]Egy olyan megbízást szeretne elküldeni, amiben a kamion egy másik céghez tartozik.Kérem informálja a céget, ha folytatja a megbízást.
[ro][CLU 29.04.13: Romanian translation (2.1.5.0)]Veti anula o repartizare care a fost facuta unui camion al altei companii. Va rugam, informati compania daca veti continua!
[bg][IDO 09.05.13: Bulgarian translation (2.1.5.0)]Ще прекратите назначение, което е към камион на друга фирма. Моля информирайте фирмата ако продължите!
[hr][DBE 01.12.13: Croatian translation]Upravo se spremate poništiti zadatak  koji je dodan kamionu druge kompanije.
[sr][EVM 09.11.13: Remains in English]You are about to cancel an assignment which is assigned to the truck of another company. Please inform the company if you proceed!
[ru][EDU 02.09.14: Russian translation (2.2.7.0)]Вы собираетесь отменить задание, которое назначено на грузовик другой компании. Пожалуйста, сообщите в компанию, если вы продолжите!
[pl][EVM 01.12.13: Remains in English]You are about to cancel an assignment which is assigned to the truck of another company. Please inform the company if you proceed!
[az][FKA 04.06.14: Azeri translation (2.2.7.0)]Siz başqa bir şirkətin yük maşınına təyin edilmiş tapşırığı ləğv etmək üzrəsiniz. Xahiş olunur,, həmin şirkətə məlumat verəsiniz!
[tr][EVM 01.10.13: Remains in English (2.2.7.0)]You are about to cancel an assignment which is assigned to the truck of another company. Please inform the company if you proceed!
[nl][EVM 11.09.15: Remains in English (2.5.x)]You are about to cancel an assignment which is assigned to the truck of another company. Please inform the company if you proceed!
dispo.texte.warning.releasing.notauthorized.assignment:
[de][NHI 15.08.12: German translation (2.0.1.0)]Sie sind dabei eine Zuteilung zu ändern, welche dem LKW eines anderen Unternehmens zugewiesen ist. Informieren Sie bitte das Unternehmen, wenn Sie fortfahren!
[en][AdN 05.07.12: English translation (2.0.1.0)]You are about to release an assignment which is assigned to the truck of another company. Please inform the company if you proceed!
[fr][LPR 22.08.12: French translation (2.0.1.0)]Vous êtes sur le point de transmettre une commande qui est transmise au camion d'un autre transporteur. Veuillez informer le transporteur si vous continuez.
[it][MAL 25.09.12: Italian translation (2.0.1.0)]Siete in procinto di rilasciare un incarico che viene assegnato ad un camion di un'altra società. Se si procede si prega di informare la società!
[es][EVM 21.11.12: Spanish translation (2.1.0.5)]Está a punto de ceder un pedido previamente asignado a otra compañía. Por favor informe a dicha compañía en case de hacerlo.
[cs][MNO 30.04.13: Czech translation (2.1.5.0)]Právě se chystáte smazat přiřazení k vozidlu jiné společnosti. Prosím informujte společnost, pokud budete pokračovat.
[sk][PPR 01.05.13: Slovak translation (2.1.5.0)]Práve uvoľňujete priradenie ktoré je priradené na vozidle inej spoločnosti. Prosím informujte spoločnosť ak budete pokračovať!
[hu][LKO 14.05.13: Hungarian translations (2.1.5.0)]Egy olyan megbízást szeretne elküldeni, amiben a kamion egy másik céghez tartozik.Kérem informálja a céget, ha folytatja a megbízást.
[ro][CLU 29.04.13: Romanian translation (2.1.5.0)]Veti lansa o repartizare care a fost facuta unui camion al altei companii. Va rugam, informati compania daca veti continua!
[bg][IDO 09.05.13: Bulgarian translation (2.1.5.0)]Ще освободите назначение, което е към камион на друга фирма. Моля информирайте фирмата ако продължите!
[hr][DBE 01.12.13: Croatian translation]Upravo se spremate otpustiti zadatak koji je dodan kamionu neke druge kompanije.
[sr][EVM 09.11.13: Remains in English]You are about to release an assignment which is assigned to the truck of another company. Please inform the company if you proceed!
[ru][EDU 02.09.14: Russian translation (2.2.7.0)]Вы собираетесь отменить задание, которое назначено на грузовик другой компании. Пожалуйста, сообщите в компанию, если вы продолжите!
[pl][EVM 01.12.13: Remains in English]You are about to release an assignment which is assigned to the truck of another company. Please inform the company if you proceed!
[az][FKA 04.06.14: Azeri translation (2.2.7.0)]Siz başqa bir şirkətin yük maşınına təyin edilmiş tapşırığı buraxmaq üzrəsiniz. Xahiş olunur,, həmin şirkətə məlumat verəsiniz!
[tr][EVM 01.10.13: Remains in English (2.2.7.0)]You are about to release an assignment which is assigned to the truck of another company. Please inform the company if you proceed!
[nl][EVM 11.09.15: Remains in English (2.5.x)]You are about to release an assignment which is assigned to the truck of another company. Please inform the company if you proceed!
