dispo.deallocation.confirm.single:
[de][JTI 08.01.15: German translation (2.3.0.x)]LKW ist bereits im Werk. Ausplanen erfordert manuelle Anpassung im Wiegesystem Schenck/FENICS/KD-Truck/HODIM. Sind Sie sicher, dass Sie den Auftrag {0} vom LKW {1} ausplanen möchten?
[en][AdN 08.01.15: English translation (2.3.0.x)]Truck is already at plant. De-allocation requires manual synchronization in Schenck/FENICS/KD-Truck/HODIM. Are you sure you want to de-allocate order {0} from the truck {1}
[fr][GBO 08.01.15: French translation (2.3.0.x)]Le véhicule est déjà présent sur site. Une désallocation nécessite une synchronisation manuelle avec Scheck/FENICS/KD-Truck/HODIM. Etes-vous certain de vouloir désallouer la commande {0} du véhicule {1}?
[it][MAL 08.01.15: Italian translation (2.3.0.x)]Il camion è già al plant. La deallocazione richiede la manuale sincronizzazione in Schenk/Fenics/KD-Camion/HODIM. Sei sicuro che vuoi deallocare l'ordine {0} dal camion {1}?
[es][EVM 08.01.15: Spanish translation (2.3.0.x)]El camión ya está dentro de la planta. La desasignación del pedido al camión requiere una sincronización manual en Schenck/FENICS/KD-Truck/HODIM. ¿Está seguro de que desea desasignar el pedido {0} del camión {1}?
[cs][EVM 29.08.14: Remains in English (2.2.7.0)]Are you sure you want to de-allocate order {0} from the truck {1}?
[sk][PPR 08.01.15: Slovak translation (2.3.0.x)]Vozidlo je v závode. Uvoľnenie objednávky je potrebné manuálne synchronizovať v Schenck/FENICS/KD-Truck/HODIM.. Ste si istý, že chcete uvoľniť objednávku {0} z vozidla {1}?
[hu][VHE 08.01.15: Hungarian translation (2.3.0.x)]A kamion a gyárban van. Megrendelés felszabadítását manuálisan kell szinkronizálni a Schenck/FENICS/KD-Truck/HODIM. Biztos, hogy felszabadítja a megrendelés {0} a kamionról {1}?
[ro][VUN 08.01.15: Romanian translation (2.3.0.x)]Camionul este deja in fabrica. Pentru o dealocare corecta, este nevoie de sincronizarea manuala in Schenck. Sunteti siguri ca doriti sa dealocati aceasta comanda {0} de pe camion {1}?
[bg][RTO 08.01.15: Bulgarian translation (2.3.0.x)]Камионът е на територията на завода. Де-алокирането изисква ръчно синхронизиране с Шенк. Сигурен ли сте че искате да де-алокирате поръчката {0} от камиона {1}
[hr][AST 08.01.15: Croatian translation (2.3.0.x)]Kamion je već u tvornici. Dealociranje zahtijeva manualnu sinkronizaciju u Schenck/FENICS/KD-Truck/HODIM. Jeste li sigurni da želite dealocirati Order {0} sa kamiona {1}
[sr][EVM 29.08.14: Remains in English (2.2.7.0)]Are you sure you want to de-allocate order {0} from the truck {1}?
[ru][EDU 08.01.15: Russian translation (2.3.0.x)]Машина уже на заводе. Отмена распределения требует ручной сихронизации с Schenck. Вы уверены, что хотите отменить распредение заказа {0} на машину {1}
[pl][EVM 29.08.14: Remains in English (2.2.7.0)]Are you sure you want to de-allocate order {0} from the truck {1}?
[az][FKA 08.01.15: Azeri translation (2.3.0.x)]Yük maşını artiq zavodadir.Təyinatın leğvi Schenklə əllə sinxronlaşma tələb edir.Siz əminsinizki sifarişi {0} bu maşinan {1} leğv etmək istəyirsiniz.
[tr][GKA 29.08.14: Turkish translation (2.2.7.0)]Siparişi yeniden {0}  kamyondan {1} yeniden Atamak istermisiniz .?
[nl][EVM 11.09.15: Remains in English (2.5.x)]Truck is already at plant. De-allocation requires manual synchronization in Schenck/FENICS/KD-Truck/HODIM. Are you sure you want to de-allocate order {0} from the truck {1}
