dispokarte.errors.invalid.parametered:
[de][EVM 02.07.12: German translation]Achtung: Einige gespeicherte Werte sind nicht mehr gültig. Bitte vor dem speichern alle Felder sorgfältig prüfen ({0})(Sales area: {1} SAP Material: {2} Contract: {3})
[en][JJI 03.05.12: English translation]Some stored values were no longer valid and have been reset. Please check all fields carefully before saving. ({0})(Sales area: {1} Sap Material: {2} Contract: {3})
[fr][LPR 02.07.12: French translation]Attention: Certains produits stockés ne sont plus valables. Veuillez contrôler les champs avant de confirmer ({0})(Région de Ventes:  {1} Matériel SAP: {2} Contract: {3})
[it][EVM 22.05.12: Italian translation]Alcuni valori memorizzati non sono più validi. PF controllare attentamente prima di salvare ({0})(Area di vendita: {1} Materiale SAP: {2} Contratto: {3})
[es][EVM 21.11.12: Spanish translation (2.1.0.5)]Algunos de los valores almacenados ya no eran válidos y han sido restablecidos. Por favor compruebe todos los campos cuidadosamente antes de guardar.  ({0})(Área de Ventas: {1} Material SAP:  {2} Contrato: {3})
[cs][MNO 30.04.13: Czech translation (2.1.5.0)]Některé uložené údaje už nejsou platné nebo byly smazány. Prosím zkontrolujte všechna pole před uložením. ({0})(Oblast prodeje: {1} Sap Materiál: {2} Kontrakt: {3})
[sk][PPR 01.05.13: Slovak translation (2.1.5.0)]Niektoré uložené údaje už nie sú platné a boli vymazané.  Prosím skontrolujte všetky polia pred uložením. ({0})(Oblasť predaja: {1} SAP materiál: {2} Kontrakt: {3})
[hu][LKO 14.05.13: Hungarian translations (2.1.5.0)]Néhány tárolt érték nem érvényes már és törölve lett. Kérem ellenőrizze az összes mezőt, mielőtt mentene. ({0}) (Értékesítési körzet: {1} SAP cikkszám: {2} Kontrakt: {3})
[ro][CLU 29.04.13: Romanian translation (2.1.5.0)]Unele valori stocate nu mai erau valide si au fost resetate. Va rugam, verificati toate campurile cu atentie inainte de salvare.  ({0})(Aria de Vanzari: {1}  Material SAP: {2} Contract: {3})
[bg][IDO 09.05.13: Bulgarian translation (2.1.5.0)]Някои запазени стойности не са валидни вече, и бяха изчистени. Моля проверете всички полета внимателно преди запазване. ({0})(Sales area: {1} Sap Material: {2} Contract: {3})
[hr][DBE 01.12.13: Croatian translation]Neki pohranjene vrijednosti  više ne vrijede te su ponovno postavljene.
[sr][EVM 09.11.13: Remains in English]Some stored values were no longer valid and have been reset. Please check all fields carefully before saving. ({0})(Sales area: {1} Sap Material: {2} Contract: {3})
[ru][EDU 02.09.14: Russian translation (2.2.7.0)]Некоторые сохраненные значения уже не действуют и были сброшены. Пожалуйста, тщательно проверьте все поля  перед сохранением. ({0})(Область продаж: {1} Sap материал: {2} Контракт: {3})
[pl][EVM 01.12.13: Remains in English]Some stored values were no longer valid and have been reset. Please check all fields carefully before saving. ({0})(Sales area: {1} Sap Material: {2} Contract: {3})
[az][FKA 04.06.14: Azeri translation (2.2.7.0)]Yaddaşda saxlanılan bəzi göstəricilər artıq etibarlı olmadığı üçün yenilənmişdir. Xahiş olunur,  yaddaşda saxlamazdan əvvəl bütün bəndləri diqqətlə yoxlayın. ({0})(Satış ərazisi: {1} Sap Material: {2} Müqavilə: {3})
[tr][EVM 01.10.13: Remains in English (2.2.7.0)]Some stored values were no longer valid and have been reset. Please check all fields carefully before saving. ({0})(Sales area: {1} Sap Material: {2} Contract: {3})
[nl][EVM 11.09.15: Remains in English (2.5.x)]Some stored values were no longer valid and have been reset. Please check all fields carefully before saving. ({0})(Sales area: {1} Sap Material: {2} Contract: {3})
