dispokarte.texte.loadorder.conf:
[de][CMA 18.11.15: German translation (2.6.1.2)]Bitte eine Bestätigung über die Auftragladung an den Kunden senden. Nur für die Lieferarten: Straße direkt, Pickup, Bahnwagen direkt, Kombi Bahn-Teil
[en][AdN 22.09.15: TODO    verify:     English translation (2.5.3)]Send confirmation of the loading of an order to the customer. Only for delivery types: Road Direct, Pickup, Rail Direct, Bimodal Road.
[fr][ESM 18.11.15: French translation (2.6.1.2)]Envois d'une confirmation de chargement au client. Uniquement disponnible pour les livraisons du type: Route directe, Enlèvement, Rail Direct, Bimodal partie route.
[it][MAL 18.11.15: Italian translation (2.6.1.2)]Invia la conferma del carico di un ordine al cliente. Solo per tipo consegna: Strada,Pickup,Ferrovia diretta,strada bimodale
[es][JMU 18.11.15: Spanish translation (2.6.1.2)]Enviar confirmación de la carga de un pedido al cliente. Sólo para los tipos de entrega: Camino, Pickup, Tren, Bimodal carretera.
[cs][CGG 20.11.15: Remains in English (2.6.1.2)]Send confirmation of the loading of an order to the customer. Only for delivery types: Road Direct, Pickup, Rail Direct, Bimodal Road.
[sk][MNO 18.11.15: Slovak translation (2.6.1.2)]Odoslať potvrdenie o nakládke objednávky. Len pre tie dopravy: Silničná priamá, Pickup, Železničná doprava
[hu][VHE 18.11.15: Hungarian translation (2.6.1.2)]Vasúti távolság
[ro][VUN 18.11.15: Romanian translation (2.6.1.2)]Trimitere catre client confirmare incarcare comanda. Valabil doar pentru tipurile: Rutier, Ridicare, Feroviar, Bimodal rutier.
[bg][RTO 18.11.15: Bulgarian translation (2.6.1.2)]Потвърждение на поръчка / ПТ - потвърждение на товарене / ЕБ - Експедиционна бележка
[hr][DBE 18.11.15: Croatian translation (2.6.1.2)]Poslati potvrdu ukrcaja narudžbe kupcu. Samo za sljedeće vrste: cestovni, željeznički te bimodalni cestovni.
[sr][AdN 22.09.15: TODO translate:     Serbian translation (2.5.3)]Send confirmation of the loading of an order to the customer. Only for delivery types: Road Direct, Pickup, Rail Direct, Bimodal Road.
[ru][IGO 18.11.15: Russian translation (2.6.1.2)]Послать подтверждение об отгрузке заказа клиентуr. Только для типов доставки: Доставка авто, Самовывоз, Доставка ЖД, Двухэтапная доставка авто
[pl][AdN 22.09.15: TODO translate:      Polish translation (2.5.3)]Send confirmation of the loading of an order to the customer. Only for delivery types: Road Direct, Pickup, Rail Direct, Bimodal Road.
[az][AdN 22.09.15: TODO translate: Azerbaijani translation (2.5.3)]Send confirmation of the loading of an order to the customer. Only for delivery types: Road Direct, Pickup, Rail Direct, Bimodal Road.
[tr][AdN 22.09.15: TODO translate:     Turkish translation (2.5.3)]Send confirmation of the loading of an order to the customer. Only for delivery types: Road Direct, Pickup, Rail Direct, Bimodal Road.
[nl][ARE 18.11.15: Dutch translation (2.6.1.2)]Stuur een laadbevestiging naar de klant. Enkel voor leveringstypes : road direct, pick up, rail direct, bimodal road
