[fr][JJF 04.05.12: French translation]Vous êtes en train de quitter une page qui a été modifiée. Voulez-vous transmettre vos changements?
[it][EVM 29.05.12: Italian translation]State per abbandonare una pagina con delle modifiche. Trasmettere i cambiamenti?
[es][EVM 21.11.12: Spanish translation (2.1.0.5)]Está a punto de abandonar una página que ha sido modificada. ¿Le gustaría guardar los cambios?
[cs][MNO 30.04.13: Czech translation (2.1.5.0)]Chcete opustit stránku na které byly provedeny změny, Chcete provést změny?
[sk][PPR 01.05.13: Slovak translation (2.1.5.0)]Chcete opustiť strany, na ktorej sa vykonala zmena. Chcete Vašu zmenu previesť?
[hu][LKO 14.05.13: Hungarian translations (2.1.5.0)]Az oldalon módósítások történtenk. Szeretné menteni a módosításokat?
[ro][CLU 29.04.13: Romanian translation (2.1.5.0)]Veti parasi o pagina care a fost schimbata. Doriti sa inregistrati schimbarile?
[bg][IDO 09.05.13: Bulgarian translation (2.1.5.0)]Ще напуснете страница, която беше променена. Искате ли да запазите промените?
[hr][DBE 28.11.13: Croatian translation (2.2.0.8)]Spremate se napustiti stranicu koja je izmjenjena. Želite li potvrditi promjene?
[sr][EVM 09.11.13: Remains in English]You are about to leave a page that has been changed. Would you like to submit your changes?
[ru][EDU 02.09.14: Russian translation (2.2.7.0)]Вы покидаете страницу, где произошли изменения. Хотите сохранить данные изменения?
[pl][EVM 28.11.13: Remains in English]You are about to leave a page that has been changed. Would you like to submit your changes?
[az][FKA 04.06.14: Azeri translation (2.2.7.0)]Siz dəyişiklik edilmiş səhifəni tərk etmək üzrəsiniz. Dəyişikliklərinizi daxil etmək istəyirsinizmi?
[tr][EVM 01.10.13: Remains in English (2.2.7.0)]You are about to leave a page that has been changed. Would you like to submit your changes?
[nl][EVM 11.09.15: Remains in English (2.5.x)]You are about to leave a page that has been changed. Would you like to submit your changes?
