fatalerror.devmodeonly:
[de][JTI 05.07.12: German translation]Diese Nachricht wird gezeigt, da DevMode aktiviert ist. Das wird *nicht* in der finalen Version von LOGON gezeigt.
[en][JJI 03.05.12: English translation]This message is shown because DevMode is enabled. This will *not* be shown in the final version of Logon.
[fr][JJF 04.05.12: French translation]Ce message a montré pourquoi DevMode n'est pas autorisé. Celui-ci n'apparaîtra pas dans la version finale de LOGON.
[it][EVM 29.05.12: Italian translation]Messaggio visibile perché DevMode attivato. Questo *non* sarà visibile nella versione finale di Logon.
[es][EVM 21.11.12: Spanish translation (2.1.0.5)]Este mensaje aparece porque DevMode está habilitado. No se mostrará en la versión definitiva.
[cs][MNO 30.04.13: Czech translation (2.1.5.0)]Tato zpráva byla zobrazená, protože DevMode je zapnutý. Toto nebude zobrazené ve finální verzi LOGONu
[sk][PPR 01.05.13: Slovak translation (2.1.5.0)]Táto správa bola zobrazená, nakoľko DevMode je aktivovaný. Toto *nebude* vo finálne verzii LOGONu zobrazené
[hu][LKO 14.05.13: Hungarian translations (2.1.5.0)]Ez az üzenet azért jelenik meg mert DevMode-ban van. Nem jeleniti meg a véglegs verzióját a Logonnak.
[ro][CLU 29.04.13: Romanian translation (2.1.5.0)]Acest mesaj apare pentru ca DevMode este dezactivat. Nu va aparea in versiunea finala a LOGON.
[bg][IDO 09.05.13: Bulgarian translation (2.1.5.0)]Това съобщение се покзва, защото е работите в DevMode. То няма да се показва във финалната версия на Logon.
[hr][DBE 28.11.13: Croatian translation (2.2.0.8)]Ova stranica je prikazana jer je DevMode omogućen. Ovo *neće* biti prikazano u finalnoj verziji Logona.
[sr][EVM 09.11.13: Remains in English]This message is shown because DevMode is enabled. This will *not* be shown in the final version of Logon.
[ru][EDU 02.09.14: Russian translation (2.2.7.0)]Это сообщение появляется, потому что включен DevMode. Это * не * показано в финальной версии Logon.
[pl][EVM 28.11.13: Remains in English]This message is shown because DevMode is enabled. This will *not* be shown in the final version of Logon.
[az][FKA 04.06.14: Azeri translation (2.2.7.0)]Bu mesaj ona görə göstərilir ki,  DevMode rejimi aktivdir. Bu, yekun logon (qeydiyyat) versiyasında göstərilməyəcək.
[tr][EVM 01.10.13: Remains in English (2.2.7.0)]This message is shown because DevMode is enabled. This will *not* be shown in the final version of Logon.
[nl][EVM 11.09.15: Remains in English (2.5.x)]This message is shown because DevMode is enabled. This will *not* be shown in the final version of Logon.
