materialenhancements.text.prio.flag:
[de][NHI 10.10.12: German translation (2.1.0.2)]Logo und Zertifizierungsdaten die hier gepflegt werden, haben Vorrang vor SAP Material Werk Norm Daten
[en][AdN 27.09.12: English translation (2.1.0.2)]Logo and Certification data maintained here has priority over SAP Mat Plant Norm data
[fr][LPR 17.10.12: French translation (2.1.0.2)]Le logo et les données de certification maintenus ici ont la priorité sur les données d'usine SAP (SAP Mat Plant Norm data).
[it][MAL 17.10.12: Italian translation (2.1.0.2)]Logo e dati di certificazione qui mantenuti hanno priorità sui dati normativi del materiale di SAP
[es][EVM 21.11.12: Spanish translation (2.1.0.5)]Datos de Logos y Certificación aquí guardados tienen prioridad sobre las Mat. Plant. Norms de SAP
[cs][MNO 30.04.13: Czech translation (2.1.5.0)]Loga a certifikáty udržované v LOGONu mají prioritu před mat. daty norem v SAPu
[sk][PPR 01.05.13: Slovak translation (2.1.5.0)]Logo a dáta certifikácie, ktoré sú tu zachované, majú prednosť pre SAP MatZávod Norm dátami
[hu][LKO 14.05.13: Hungarian translations (2.1.5.0)]A logó és a tanusítvány adatok elsőbbséget élveznek az SAP adatokkal szemben
[ro][CLU 29.04.13: Romanian translation (2.1.5.0)]Datele Logo si Certificare aici au prioritate peste datele normelor MatPlant in SAP
[bg][IDO 09.05.13: Bulgarian translation (2.1.5.0)]Лого и данните за сертификата поддържани тук имат приоритет пред датата на  SAP Mat Plant Norm
[hr][DBE 28.11.13: Croatian translation (2.2.0.8)]Podaci loga i certifikata održani ovdje imaju prioritet pred SAP MatPlant Norm dana
[sr][EVM 09.11.13: Remains in English]Logo and Certification data maintained here has priority over SAP Mat Plant Norm data
[ru][EDU 02.09.14: Russian translation (2.2.7.0)]Данные Логотипа и сертификации, поддерживаемые здесь, имеют приоритет над данными SAP Mat Plant Norm
[pl][EVM 28.11.13: Remains in English]Logo and Certification data maintained here has priority over SAP Mat Plant Norm data
[az][FKA 04.06.14: Azeri translation (2.2.7.0)]Burada yer alan loqotip və sertifikat məlumatları SAP Material Zavodu məlumatlarından daha vacibdir
[tr][EVM 01.10.13: Remains in English (2.2.7.0)]Logo and Certification data maintained here has priority over SAP Mat Plant Norm data
[nl][EVM 11.09.15: Remains in English (2.5.x)]Logo and Certification data maintained here has priority over SAP Mat Plant Norm data
