#####################################################
# OPTIMISTICLOCKERROR
#####################################################

optimisticlockerror.msg:
[de][EVM 02.07.12: German translation]Die Daten konnten nicht gespeichert werden, da diese von einem anderen Benutzer zur gleichen Zeit geändert worden sind. Bitte Änderung wiederholen.
[en][JJI 03.05.12: English translation]The application could not save the changed data because an other person changed the same data to the same time. Please load the new data and make your changes again.
[fr][JJF 04.05.12: French translation]L'application ne pourra pas enregistrer les données modifiées car une autre personne à changé les mêmes données au même moment. Veuillez enregistrer les nouvelles données et refaire vos modifications.
[it][EVM 30.05.12: Italian translation]I dati non possono essere salvati, essi sono stati modificati contemporaneamente da un altro operatore. Per favore ripetere le modifiche.
[es][EVM 21.11.12: Spanish translation (2.1.0.5)]La aplicación no pudo guardar los datos cambiados porque otra persona cambió los mismos datos al mismo tiempo. Por favor cargue los nuevos datos y haga sus cambios de nuevo.
[cs][MNO 30.04.13: Czech translation (2.1.5.0)]Aplikace nemohla uložit data, protože byla zpracovávána jiným uživatelem ve stejné době. Prosím nahrajte nová data a proveďte úpravy znovu.
[sk][PPR 01.05.13: Slovak translation (2.1.5.0)]Údaje nemohli byť uložené, nakoľko v rovnaký čas boli zmenené iným užívateľom. Prosím o zopakovanie zmeny.
[hu][LKO 14.05.13: Hungarian translations (2.1.5.0)]Az alkalmazás nem tudja menteni a változásokat, mert egy másik felhasználó egy időben módosította ezeket az adatokat. Töltse be az új adatokat, és végezze el a módosításokat újra.
[ro][CLU 29.04.13: Romanian translation (2.1.5.0)]Aplicatia nu a putut salva datele schimbate pentru ca  alta persoana a schimbat aceleasi date in acelasi timp. Va rugam sa incarcati date noi si sa va faceti schimbarile din nou.
[bg][IDO 09.05.13: Bulgarian translation (2.1.5.0)]Програмата не може да запомни променените данни, защото друг потребител е променил данните по същото време. Моля заредете новите данни и направете промените отново.
[hr][DBE 01.12.13: Croatian translation]Aplikacija ne može spremiti promijenjene podatke zato što je druga osoba u isto vrijeme promijenila iste podatke.
[sr][EVM 09.11.13: Remains in English]The application could not save the changed data because an other person changed the same data to the same time. Please load the new data and make your changes again.
[ru][EDU 02.09.14: Russian translation (2.2.7.0)]Программа не смогла сохранить измененные данные, потому что другой человек изменил те же данные в то же время. Пожалуйста, загрузите новые данные и внесите необходимые изменения еще раз.
[pl][EVM 01.12.13: Remains in English]The application could not save the changed data because an other person changed the same data to the same time. Please load the new data and make your changes again.
[az][FKA 04.06.14: Azeri translation (2.2.7.0)]Proqram dəyişiklik edilmiş məlumatı yaddaşda saxlaya bilmədi, çünki başqa bir şəxs eyni məlumatlarda dəyişiklik edib. Xahiş olunur, yeni məlumatları yükləyin və yenidən dəyişiklik edin.
[tr][EVM 01.10.13: Remains in English (2.2.7.0)]The application could not save the changed data because an other person changed the same data to the same time. Please load the new data and make your changes again.
[nl][EVM 11.09.15: Remains in English (2.5.x)]The application could not save the changed data because an other person changed the same data to the same time. Please load the new data and make your changes again.
