order.warning.already.sent.to.sap:
[de][EVM 02.07.12: German translation]Dieser Auftrag wurde bereits an SAP übermittelt. Alle Änderungen müssen in beiden Systemen manuell nachgezogen werden.
[en][JJI 03.05.12: English translation]You are correcting an order which was already sent to SAP. Correction must be done manually in both systems
[fr][LPR 02.07.12: French translation]Vous corrigez une commande qui a déjà envoyée à SAP. Corrections doivent être faites dans les deux systèmes
[it][EVM 30.05.12: Italian translation]Stai correggendo un ordine gia trasmesso a SAP. Correzioni da effettuarsi manualmente in entrambi i sistemi.
[es][EVM 21.11.12: Spanish translation (2.1.0.5)]Está corrigiendo un pedido que ya fue transmitido a SAP. La corrección debe efectuarse manualmente en ambos sistemas.
[cs][MNO 30.04.13: Czech translation (2.1.5.0)]Opravujete Objednávku, která byla již odeslána do SAP. Změny musí být provedeny manuálně v obou systémech
[sk][PPR 01.05.13: Slovak translation (2.1.5.0)]Táto objednávka už bola do SAPu prenesená. Všetky zmeny musia byť v oboch systémoch manuálne dokončené.
[hu][LKO 14.05.13: Hungarian translations (2.1.5.0)]Olyan megrendelést javított, amely már el lett küldve az SAP-ba. A javítást kézzel kell elvégeznie mindkét rendszerben.
[ro][CLU 29.04.13: Romanian translation (2.1.5.0)]Corectati o comanda care a fost deja trimisa in SAP. Corectarea trebuie facuta manual in ambele sisteme.
[bg][IDO 09.05.13: Bulgarian translation (2.1.5.0)]Променяте поръчка изпратена към SAP. Промените трябва да се направят ръчно в двете системи.
[hr][DBE 28.11.13: Croatian translation (2.2.0.8)]Ispravljate narudžbu koja je već poslana u SAP. Ispravak mora biti napravljen ručno u oba sistema.
[sr][EVM 09.11.13: Remains in English]You are correcting an order which was already sent to SAP. Correction must be done manually in both systems
[ru][EDU 02.09.14: Russian translation (2.2.7.0)]Вы изменяете заказ, который уже отправлен в САП. Изменения должны быть сделаны вручную в двух системах.
[pl][EVM 28.11.13: Remains in English]You are correcting an order which was already sent to SAP. Correction must be done manually in both systems
[az][FKA 04.06.14: Azeri translation (2.2.7.0)]Siz artıq SAR-a göndərilmiş sifarişdə düzəliş edirsiniz. Düzəliş hər iki sistemdə manual qaydada aparılmalıdır.
[tr][EVM 01.10.13: Remains in English (2.2.7.0)]You are correcting an order which was already sent to SAP. Correction must be done manually in both systems
[nl][EVM 11.09.15: Remains in English (2.5.x)]You are correcting an order which was already sent to SAP. Correction must be done manually in both systems
