orderdetail.message.delete.dispatched:
[de][EVM 02.07.12: German translation]Der Auftrag ist bereits auf einen LKW disponiert. Bitte LKW zuerst ausplanen um Auftrag zu löschen.
[en][JJI 03.05.12: English translation]The order has already been dispatched to a truck, please cancel the dispatching in order to delete the order
[fr][LPR 02.07.12: French translation]La commande a déjà été mise à disposition à un camion. Veuillez déplanifier la commande du  camion afin de pouvoir supprimer la commande.
[it][EVM 17.05.12: Italian translation]L'ordine è gia stato inviato ad un veicolo, si prega di cancellare l'invio per poter annullare l'ordine.
[es][EVM 21.11.12: Spanish translation (2.1.0.5)]El Pedido ya ha sido asignado a un camión, por favor cancele la asignación para poder eliminar el Pedido.
[cs][MNO 30.04.13: Czech translation (2.1.5.0)]S objednávku již disponuje vozidlo, prosím zrušte disponování pokud chcete objednávku smazat.
[sk][PPR 01.05.13: Slovak translation (2.1.5.0)]S objednávkou už disponuje jeden ťahač.  Prosím najprv zrušiť plánovanie ťahača a následne objednávku vymažte.
[hu][LKO 14.05.13: Hungarian translations (2.1.5.0)]A rendelést már elküldték teherautóra, törölje a rendelés feladását, hogy törölni tudja a rendelést.
[ro][CLU 29.04.13: Romanian translation (2.1.5.0)]Comanda a fost deja dispecerizata unui camion. Va rugam sa anulati dispecerizarea pentru a sterge comanda.
[bg][IDO 09.05.13: Bulgarian translation (2.1.5.0)]Поръчката е вече изпратена към камион, моля отменете експедицията, за да се изтрие поръчката
[hr][DBE 28.11.13: Croatian translation (2.2.0.8)]Narudžba je poslana kamionu, molimo poništite naredbu ukoliko želite obrisati narudžbu.
[sr][EVM 09.11.13: Remains in English]The order has already been dispatched to a truck, please cancel the dispatching in order to delete the order
[ru][EDU 02.09.14: Russian translation (2.2.7.0)]На заказ уже назначено ТС. Пожалуйста, отмените назначение для удаления заказа.
[pl][EVM 28.11.13: Remains in English]The order has already been dispatched to a truck, please cancel the dispatching in order to delete the order
[az][FKA 04.06.14: Azeri translation (2.2.7.0)]Sifariş artıq yük maşınına verilib, Xahiş olunur, sifarişi ləğv etmək üçün göndərişi dayandırın.
[tr][EVM 01.10.13: Remains in English (2.2.7.0)]The order has already been dispatched to a truck, please cancel the dispatching in order to delete the order
[nl][EVM 11.09.15: Remains in English (2.5.x)]The order has already been dispatched to a truck, please cancel the dispatching in order to delete the order
orderdetail.message.delete.transmitted:
[de][EVM 02.07.12: German translation]Der Auftrag wurde schon an das EVU übermittelt. Es ist nötig auch den übertragenen Auftrag zu stornieren!
[en][JJI 03.05.12: English translation]The order was already transmitted to the rail company. It is necessary to cancel the transmitted order too!
[fr][LPR 02.07.12: French translation]L'ordre a déjà été mis à disposition de l'entreprise ferroviaire. Il est également nécessaire d'annuler cet ordre transmis.
[it][EVM 15.06.12: Italian translation]L'ordine è già stato trasmesso alla società ferroviarie. È necessario annullare l'ordine trasmesso troppo!
[es][EVM 21.11.12: Spanish translation (2.1.0.5)]El Pedido ya fue transmitido a la compañía de tren. Es necesario cancelar también la transmisión.
[cs][MNO 30.04.13: Czech translation (2.1.5.0)]Objednávka byla již odeslána železničnímu přepravci. Je nutné stornovat i přenesenou objednávku!
[sk][PPR 01.05.13: Slovak translation (2.1.5.0)]Objednávka už bola prenesená na železničnú spoločnosť. Taktiež je potrebné prenesenú objednávku stornovať!
[hu][LKO 14.05.13: Hungarian translations (2.1.5.0)]A rendelés továbbítva lett a vasút társaságnk. Törölje a feladást, hogy törölni tudja a rendelést.
[ro][CLU 29.04.13: Romanian translation (2.1.5.0)]Comanda a fost deja trimisa companiei feroviare. Este necesar sa anulati si comanda transmisa!
[bg][IDO 09.05.13: Bulgarian translation (2.1.5.0)]Поръчката беше предадена вече към ЖП компанията. Необходимо е да откажете предадената поръчка също!
[hr][DBE 28.11.13: Croatian translation (2.2.0.8)]Narudžbe je već proslijeđena u željeznicku tvrtku. Potrebno je također poništiti poslanu narudžbu!
[sr][EVM 09.11.13: Remains in English]The order was already transmitted to the rail company. It is necessary to cancel the transmitted order too!
[ru][EDU 02.09.14: Russian translation (2.2.7.0)]Заказ уже отправлен жд компании. Необходимо отменить переданный заказ!
[pl][EVM 28.11.13: Remains in English]The order was already transmitted to the rail company. It is necessary to cancel the transmitted order too!
[az][FKA 04.06.14: Azeri translation (2.2.7.0)]Sifariş  artıq dəmir yolu şirkətinə verilib. Verilmiş sifariş belə, ləğv edilməlidir!
[tr][EVM 01.10.13: Remains in English (2.2.7.0)]The order was already transmitted to the rail company. It is necessary to cancel the transmitted order too!
[nl][EVM 11.09.15: Remains in English (2.5.x)]The order was already transmitted to the rail company. It is necessary to cancel the transmitted order too!
orderdetail.message.delete.special:
[de][EVM 02.07.12: German translation]Die Löschung hat eine Aktualisierung der Reporting Tabelle zur Folge. Bitte prüfen ob SAP Auftrag angepasst werden muss..
[en][JJI 03.05.12: English translation]Reporting table (order final) will be adjusted if order is deleted. Please verify if SAP order needs to be adjusted as well.
[fr][JJF 04.05.12: French translation]L'annulation de la commande a engendré une actualisation.  Veuillez vérifier si la commande SAP doit également être ajustée
[it][EVM 15.06.12: Italian translation]La tabella di reporting è stata aggiornata. PF controllare se anche l'ordine SAP necessita di una correzione.
[es][EVM 21.11.12: Spanish translation (2.1.0.5)]La tabla de Informes (final de Pedido) será ajustada si se elimina el Pedido. Por favor verifique si el Pedido debe ser ajustado también en SAP.
[cs][MNO 30.04.13: Czech translation (2.1.5.0)]Vymazání má za následek aktualizaci reportingové tabulky. Prosím prověřte, zda musí být SAP objednávka také upravená.
[sk][PPR 01.05.13: Slovak translation (2.1.5.0)]Vymazanie má za následok aktualizáciu reportingovej tabuľky. Prosím preverte, či SAP objednávka musí byť taktiež upravená.
[hu][LKO 14.05.13: Hungarian translations (2.1.5.0)]Törlés után aktualizálva lett a riport tábla. Ellenőrizze, hogy az SAP munkát nem-e kell kiigazítani.
[ro][CLU 29.04.13: Romanian translation (2.1.5.0)]Tabelul de raportare (finalizare comanda) va fi ajustat daca se sterge comanda. Va rugam sa verificati daca si comanda in SAP trebuie sa fie ajustata.
[bg][IDO 09.05.13: Bulgarian translation (2.1.5.0)]Таблицата за отчети (крайна поръчка) ще бъде коригирана ако поръчка е изтрита. Моля проверете дали SAP поръчката трябва да бъде коригирана също.
[hr][DBE 28.11.13: Croatian translation (2.2.0.8)]Izvještaj (krajnji nalog) će se prilagoditi ako se nalog izbriše. Molimo provjerite da li treba SAP naloge prilagoditi.
[sr][EVM 09.11.13: Remains in English]Reporting table (order final) will be adjusted if order is deleted. Please verify if SAP order needs to be adjusted as well.
[ru][EDU 02.09.14: Russian translation (2.2.7.0)]Таблица отчета (финал заказа) будет скорректирован, если заказ будет удален. Пожалуйста, проверьте, если SAP заказ  также нуждается в корректировке.
[pl][EVM 28.11.13: Remains in English]Reporting table (order final) will be adjusted if order is deleted. Please verify if SAP order needs to be adjusted as well.
[az][FKA 04.06.14: Azeri translation (2.2.7.0)]Sifariş ləğv olunarsa,  yekun sifariş də müvafiq şəkildə tənzimlənməlidir. Xahiş olunur, SAP sifarişində də düzəlişə ehtiyac olub-olmadığını bildirin.
[tr][EVM 01.10.13: Remains in English (2.2.7.0)]Reporting table (order final) will be adjusted if order is deleted. Please verify if SAP order needs to be adjusted as well.
