orderdetail.message.order.sendtosap:
[de][CMA 11.09.15: German translation (2.5.x)]Der Auftrag wird an SAP vor dem eigentlichen Lieferdatum geschickt!
[en][AdN 07.08.15: English translation (2.5.0)]Order is forced to be sent to SAP before the Actual Delivery Date!
[fr][ARE 11.09.15: French traorderdetail.message.order.nslation (2.5.x)]La commande sera envoyée à SAP avant la date de livraison planifiée!
[it][MAL 11.09.15: Italian translation (2.5.x)]L'invio dell'ordine a SAP è stato forzato prima dell'effettiva data di consegna!
[es][JUR 11.09.15: Spanish translation (2.5.x)]¡El pedido está obligado a ser enviado a SAP antes de la fecha de entrega real!
[cs][EVM 11.09.15: Remains in English (2.5.x)]Objednávka byla odeslána do SAP před datem dodání!
[sk][PPR 11.09.15: Slovak translation (2.5.x)]Objednávka bola odoslaná do SAP pred dátumom dodania!
[hu][VHE 11.09.15: Hungarian translation (2.5.x)]A megrendelés hamarabb fel lett küldve SAP-ba mint a tényleges teljesítési időpont.
[ro][VUN 11.09.15: Romanian translation (2.5.x)]Comanda este trimisa fortat catre SAP inainte de data livrarii!
[bg][RTO 11.09.15: Bulgarian translation (2.5.x)]Поръчката е принудително изпратена към SAP преди действителното време на доставка!
[hr][DBE 11.09.15: Croatian translation (2.5.x)]Nalog je poslan u Sap prije stvarnog datuma isporuke.
[sr][EVM 11.09.15: Remains in English (2.5.x)]Order is forced to be sent to SAP before the Actual Delivery Date!
[ru][IGO 11.09.15: Russian translation (2.5.x)]Заказ принудительно отправлен в SAP до наступления фактического времени доставки!
[pl][EVM 11.09.15: Remains in English (2.5.x)]Order is forced to be sent to SAP before the Actual Delivery Date!
[az][FKA 11.09.15: Azerbaijani translation (2.5.x)]Sifariş faktiki çatdırılma vaxtınan əvvəl SAPa göndərmək üçün məcbur edilir!
[tr][EVM 11.09.15: Remains in English (2.5.x)]Order is forced to be sent to SAP before the Actual Delivery Date!
[nl][EVM 11.09.15: Remains in English (2.5.x)]Order is forced to be sent to SAP before the Actual Delivery Date!
