orderdetail.messagebox.sendtosap.text:
[de][CMA 11.09.15: German translation (2.5.x)]Wollen sie wirklich den Auftrag vor dem geplanten Liefertermin an SAP senden?
[en][AdN 07.08.15: English translation (2.5.0)]Do you really want to force the order to be sent to SAP before the Actual Delivery Date?
[fr][ARE 11.09.15: French translation (2.5.x)]Voulez vous vraiment forcer l'envoi de la commande vers SAP avant la date de livraison planifiée?
[it][MAL 11.09.15: Italian translation (2.5.x)]Vuoi veramente forzare l'invio dell'ordine a SAP prima dell'effettiva data di consegna?
[es][JUR 11.09.15: Spanish translation (2.5.x)]¿Realmente desea forzar el envío a SAP del pedido antes de la fecha de entrega real?
[cs][EVM 11.09.15: Remains in English (2.5.x)]Opravdu chcete poslat objednávku do SAP před datem dodání?
[sk][PPR 11.09.15: Slovak translation (2.5.x)]Naozaj chcete odoslať objednávku do SAP ešte pred dátumom dodania?
[hu][VHE 11.09.15: Hungarian translation (2.5.x)]Biztos fel akarja küldeni a megrendelést SAP-ba az aktuális teljesítési időpont előtt?
[ro][VUN 11.09.15: Romanian translation (2.5.x)]Confirmati trimiterea fortata a comenzii catre SAP inainte de data livrarii?
[bg][RTO 11.09.15: Bulgarian translation (2.5.x)]Наистина ли искате да изпратите поръчката към SAP преди действителното време на доставка?
[hr][DBE 11.09.15: Croatian translation (2.5.x)]Da li stvarno želite da nalog bude poslan u Sap prije stvarnog datuma isporuke?
[sr][EVM 11.09.15: Remains in English (2.5.x)]Do you really want to force the order to be sent to SAP before the Actual Delivery Date?
[ru][IGO 11.09.15: Russian translation (2.5.x)]Вы действительно хотите отправить заказ в SAP до наступления фактического времени доставки?
[pl][EVM 11.09.15: Remains in English (2.5.x)]Do you really want to force the order to be sent to SAP before the Actual Delivery Date?
[az][FKA 11.09.15: Azerbaijani translation (2.5.x)]Siz, həqiqətən, faktiki çatdırılması vaxtınan əvvəl sifarişi SAPa göndərmək istəyirsiniz?
[tr][EVM 11.09.15: Remains in English (2.5.x)]Do you really want to force the order to be sent to SAP before the Actual Delivery Date?
