orderdetail.messagebox.setholdbackon.repair.order.text:
[de][NHI 05.07.12: German translation]Wollen Sie wirklich den automatischen Rückfahrauftrag verhindern?
[en][JJF 03.05.12: English translation (2.0.0.8)]Do you really want to prevent automatic return order creation?
[fr][LPR 02.07.12: French translation]Souhaitez-vous vraiment empêcher la création de commande retour automatique?
[it][EVM 15.06.12: Italian translation]Sei sicuro di voler impedire la creazione d'ordine di ritorno automatico?
[es][EVM 21.11.12: Spanish translation (2.1.0.5)]¿Quiere realmente evitar la generación automática de Pedidos de retorno?
[cs][MNO 30.04.13: Czech translation (2.1.5.0)]Chcete opravdu zabránit automatickému odeslání objednávky?
[sk][PPR 01.05.13: Slovak translation (2.1.5.0)]Chcete naozaj zabrániť automatickému odosielaniu objednávok?
[hu][LKO 14.05.13: Hungarian translations (2.1.5.0)]Valóban meg akarja akarja előzni, hogy automatikusan visszatérjen a rendelés készítéshez?
[ro][CLU 29.04.13: Romanian translation (2.1.5.0)]Chiar vreti  sa evitati generarea automata a Comenzii Retur?
[bg][IDO 09.05.13: Bulgarian translation (2.1.5.0)]Искате ли наистина да забраните автоматичното създаване на връщане на поръчки?
[hr][DBE 28.11.13: Croatian translation (2.2.0.8)]Želite li zaista spriječiti kreiranje narudžbe za povrat ?
[sr][EVM 09.11.13: Remains in English]Do you really want to prevent automatic return order creation?
[ru][EDU 02.09.14: Russian translation (2.2.7.0)]Вы действительно хотите предотвратить автоматическое создание заказа на возврат?
[pl][EVM 28.11.13: Remains in English]Do you really want to prevent automatic return order creation?
[az][FKA 04.06.14: Azeri translation (2.2.7.0)]Sifarişi avtomatik geri qaytarma funksiyasını həqiqətənmi dayandırmaq istəirsiniz?
[tr][EVM 01.10.13: Remains in English (2.2.7.0)]Do you really want to prevent automatic return order creation?
[nl][EVM 11.09.15: Remains in English (2.5.x)]Do you really want to prevent automatic return order creation?
orderdetail.messagebox.setholdbackoff.repair.order.text:
[de][NHI 05.07.12: German translation]Wollen Sie wirklich den automatischen Rückfahrauftrag aktivieren?
[en][JJF 03.05.12: English translation (2.0.0.8)]Do you really want to enable automatic return order creation?
[fr][LPR 02.07.12: French translation]Souhaitez-vous vraiment permettre la création de commande automatique?
[it][EVM 15.06.12: Italian translation]Sei sicuro di voler consentire la creazione d'ordine di ritorno automatico?
[es][EVM 21.11.12: Spanish translation (2.1.0.5)]¿Quiere realmente habilitar la generación automática de Pedidos de retorno?
[cs][MNO 30.04.13: Czech translation (2.1.5.0)]Chcete opravdu použít automatické odesílání objednávek?
[sk][PPR 01.05.13: Slovak translation (2.1.5.0)]Chcete naozaj aktivovať automatickému odosielanie objednávok?
[hu][LKO 14.05.13: Hungarian translations (2.1.5.0)]Valóban engedélyezni akarja, hogy automatikusan vissza lépjen a rendelés készítéshez?
[ro][CLU 29.04.13: Romanian translation (2.1.5.0)]Chiar vreti  sa activati generarea automata a Comenzii Retur?
[bg][IDO 09.05.13: Bulgarian translation (2.1.5.0)]Искате ли наистина да разрешите автоматичното създаване на връщане на поръчки?
[hr][DBE 28.11.13: Croatian translation (2.2.0.8)]Želite li zaista omogućiti automatsko kreiranje narudžbe za povrat?
[sr][EVM 09.11.13: Remains in English]Do you really want to enable automatic return order creation?
[ru][EDU 02.09.14: Russian translation (2.2.7.0)]Вы действительно хотите включить автоматическое создание заказа на возврат?
[pl][EVM 28.11.13: Remains in English]Do you really want to enable automatic return order creation?
[az][FKA 04.06.14: Azeri translation (2.2.7.0)]Sifarişi avtomatik geri qaytarma funksiyasını həqiqətənmi aktivləşdirmək istəirsiniz?
[tr][EVM 01.10.13: Remains in English (2.2.7.0)]Do you really want to enable automatic return order creation?
[nl][EVM 11.09.15: Remains in English (2.5.x)]Do you really want to enable automatic return order creation?
orderdetail.messagebox.specialdelete.text:
[de][EVM 02.07.12: German translation]Soll der Auftrag wirklich gelöscht werden? (Die Reportingtabelle wird nach dem Löschen neu geschrieben)
[en][JJI 03.05.12: English translation]Do you really want to delete the order? (Order final table will be updated)
[fr][LPR 02.07.12: French translation]Voulez vous vraiment supprimer la commande?
[it][EVM 22.05.12: Italian translation]L'ordine deve essere veramente eliminato? (La tabella sarà aggiornata).
[es][EVM 21.11.12: Spanish translation (2.1.0.5)]¿Quiere realmente eliminar el Pedido? (la tabla: final de Pedido, será actualizada).
[cs][MNO 30.04.13: Czech translation (2.1.5.0)]Opravdu chcete vymazat objednávku? (Seznam objednávek bude aktualizován)
[sk][PPR 01.05.13: Slovak translation (2.1.5.0)]Ma byť objednávka naozaj vymazaná? (Tabuľka rertingu bude po uložení aktualizované)
[hu][LKO 14.05.13: Hungarian translations (2.1.5.0)]Biztos törölni akarja a rendelést? (Rendelési táblázat frissítve lesz)
[ro][CLU 29.04.13: Romanian translation (2.1.5.0)]Chiar vreti sa stergeti comanda?(Tabelul final cu cu comenzi va fi actualizat)
[bg][IDO 09.05.13: Bulgarian translation (2.1.5.0)]Искате ли наистина да изтриете поръчката?(Финалната таблица на поръчката ще бъде обновена)
[hr][DBE 28.11.13: Croatian translation (2.2.0.8)]Želite li zaista obrisati narudžbu? (Krajnja narudžba će biti ažurirana)
[sr][EVM 09.11.13: Remains in English]Do you really want to delete the order? (Order final table will be updated)
[ru][EDU 02.09.14: Russian translation (2.2.7.0)]Вы действительно хотите удалить заказ? (Заказ в финальной таблице будет обновлен)
[pl][EVM 28.11.13: Remains in English]Do you really want to delete the order? (Order final table will be updated)
[az][FKA 04.06.14: Azeri translation (2.2.7.0)]Sifarişi həqiqətənmi silmək istəyirsiniz?  (Yekun sifariş cədvəli yenilənəcək)
[tr][EVM 01.10.13: Remains in English (2.2.7.0)]Do you really want to delete the order? (Order final table will be updated)
[nl][EVM 11.09.15: Remains in English (2.5.x)]Do you really want to delete the order? (Order final table will be updated)
orderdetail.messagebox.specialdeleteclosed.text:
[de][EVM 02.07.12: German translation]Der Auftrag ist bereits an SAP übermittelt. Änderungen an diesem Auftrag müssen manuell in SAP nachgeführt um Inkonsistenzen zu vermeiden.
[en][JJI 03.05.12: English translation]The order is already submitted to SAP. Changes must be done manually in SAP to avoid inconsistencies.
[fr][JJF 04.05.12: French translation]La commande est déjà transmise à SAP. Les changements doivent être faits manuellement sur SAP pour éviter les erreurs.
[it][EVM 24.05.12: Italian translation]L'ordine è gia stato trasmesso al SAP. I cambiamenti devo essere inseriti manualmente per evitare icongruenze.
[es][EVM 21.11.12: Spanish translation (2.1.0.5)]El Pedido ya ha sido transmitido a SAP. Los cambios deben realizarse manualmente en SAP para evitar inconsistencias.
[cs][MNO 30.04.13: Czech translation (2.1.5.0)]Objednávka již byla přenesená do SAPu. Změny musí být provedeny manuálně v SAP aby bylo zabráněno nekonzistenci dat.
[sk][PPR 01.05.13: Slovak translation (2.1.5.0)]Objednávka je už prenesená do SAPu. Zmeny v objednávke z dôvodu vylúčenia nekonzistencie musia byť vykonané v SAPe manuálne.
[hu][LKO 14.05.13: Hungarian translations (2.1.5.0)]A rendelés át lett küldve az SAP-ba. A változásokat manuálisan kell végrehalytania az SAP-ban a problémák elkerülése érdekében.
[ro][CLU 29.04.13: Romanian translation (2.1.5.0)]Comanda este deja inregistrata in SAP. Schimabarile trebuie facute manual in SAP pentru a evita inconsistentele
[bg][IDO 09.05.13: Bulgarian translation (2.1.5.0)]Поръчката е вече пусната към SAP. Промени трябва да се правят ръчно в SAP, за да се избегнат несъответствия.
[hr][DBE 28.11.13: Croatian translation (2.2.0.8)]Narudžba je već prenesena u SAP. Promjene moraju biti napravljene automatski u SAPu kako bi se  izbjegle nedosljednosti.
[sr][EVM 09.11.13: Remains in English]The order is already submitted to SAP. Changes must be done manually in SAP to avoid inconsistencies.
[ru][EDU 02.09.14: Russian translation (2.2.7.0)]Заказ уже отправлен в Сап. Изменения должны быть сделаны вручную в Сап, чтобы избежать несоответствий.
[pl][EVM 28.11.13: Remains in English]The order is already submitted to SAP. Changes must be done manually in SAP to avoid inconsistencies.
[az][FKA 04.06.14: Azeri translation (2.2.7.0)]Sifariş artıq SAP-a təqdim edilib. Uyğunsuzluq olmaması üçün, SAP-da manual qaydada dəyişikliklər edilməlidir.
[tr][EVM 01.10.13: Remains in English (2.2.7.0)]The order is already submitted to SAP. Changes must be done manually in SAP to avoid inconsistencies.
[nl][EVM 11.09.15: Remains in English (2.5.x)]The order is already submitted to SAP. Changes must be done manually in SAP to avoid inconsistencies.
orderdetail.messagebox.specialupdatespi.text:
[de][JTI 06.12.12: German translation (2.1.0.6)]Die Bestellung ist bereits im SAP. Änderungen welche nicht nur Logon bestreffen, müssen manuell in SAP durchgeführt werden, um Inkonsistenzen zu vermeiden. Ausnahme: Gutschriften werden automatisch an SAP gesenet. Hierfür sind keine weiteren Schritte erforderlich.
[en][AdN 14.11.12: English translation (2.1.0.5)]The order is already submitted to SAP. Changes which are not just 'LOGON-only' but commercially relevant must be done manually in SAP to avoid inconsistencies. Exception: Credit Notes are automatically sent to SAP, no additional steps necessary.
[fr][LPR 04.12.12: French translation (2.1.0.5)]La commande a déjà été transmise à SAP. Les corrections qui ne sont pas "juste dans Logon" mais reliées à la vente doivent être corrigées manuellement dans SAP afin d'éviter des incohérences. Exeption: les notes de crédit sont envoyées automatiquement à SAP, aucune étape supplémentaire nécessaire.
[it][MAL 21.11.12: Italian translation: (2.1.0.5)]L'ordine è già stato inviato a SAP. Le modifiche che non sono solo in Logon ma commercialmente rilevanti devono essere fatte manualmente in SAP per evitare inconsistenze. Eccezione: le note credito sono automaticamente inviate a SAP, non sono necessarie ulteriori operazioni
[es][EVM 21.11.12: Spanish translation (2.1.0.5)]El pedido ya se ha enviado a SAP. Cambios que no sean 'sólo LOGON' pero comercialmente relevantes deberán hacerse manualmnete en SAP para evitar inconsistencias. Excepción: las Notas de crédito son enviadas automáticamente a SAP, sin necesidad de pasos adicionales.
[cs][MNO 30.04.13: Czech translation (2.1.5.0)]Objednávka již byla přenesená do SAPu. Změny musí být provedeny manuálně v SAP aby bylo zabráněno nekonzistenci dat. Vyjímka: Dobropisy se posílají do SAP automaticky - zde nejsou potřebné žádné další kroky.
[sk][PPR 01.05.13: Slovak translation (2.1.5.0)]Objednávka je už v SAPe. Zmeny, ktoré sa netýkajú len LOGONu, musia byť manuálne vykonané v SAPe, z dôvodu vylúčenia nekonzistencie. Výnimka: Dobropisy budú automaticky odoslané do SAPu. K tomutu nie sú potrebné žiadne ďalšie kroky.
[hu][LKO 14.05.13: Hungarian translations (2.1.5.0)]A rendelés át lett küldve az SAP-ba. Azokat a változásokat, amelyek nem "Csak LOGON" manuálisan kell az SAP-ban megváltoztatni a problémák elkerülése érdekében. Kivéve: Kredit negjegyzések, ezek automatikusan feltöltődnek az SAP-ba.
[ro][CLU 29.04.13: Romanian translation (2.1.5.0)]Comanda a fost deja inregistrata in SAP. Schimbarile care nu sunt"Doar LOGON", dar si comercial relevante trebuie sa fie facute manual in SAP pentru a evita inconsistentele. Exceptie: Notele de Credit sunt trimise automat in SAP, nu sunt necesari pasi aditionali.
[bg][IDO 09.05.13: Bulgarian translation (2.1.5.0)]Поръчката е вече подадена към SAP. Промени, които не са просто 'LOGON-единствено', но търговско свързани трябва да бъдат правени ръчно в SAP, за да се избегнат несъответствия. Изключение: Кредитни известия се изпращат автоматично към SAP, без необходимост от допълнителни стъпки.
[hr][DBE 01.12.13: Croatian translation]Narudžba je već prenesena u SAP. Promjene koje se ne odnose samo na "LOGON", ali su komercijalno relevantne
[sr][EVM 09.11.13: Remains in English]The order is already submitted to SAP. Changes which are not just 'LOGON-only' but commercially relevant must be done manually in SAP to avoid inconsistencies. Exception: Credit Notes are automatically sent to SAP, no additional steps necessary.
[ru][EDU 02.09.14: Russian translation (2.2.7.0)]Заказ уже отправлен в Сап. Изменения, требуемые не только для "Логон", но еще и коммерчески релевантны, должны быть сделаны вручную в Сап, чтобы избежать несоответствия. Исключение: Credit Notes автоматически отправляются в Сап, дополнительные шаги не требуются.
[pl][EVM 01.12.13: Remains in English]The order is already submitted to SAP. Changes which are not just 'LOGON-only' but commercially relevant must be done manually in SAP to avoid inconsistencies. Exception: Credit Notes are automatically sent to SAP, no additional steps necessary.
[az][FKA 04.06.14: Azeri translation (2.2.7.0)]Sifariş artıq SAP-a təqdim edilib. Uyğunsuzluq olmaması üçün,  təkcə qeydiyyatla əlaqəli olmayan, həm də kommersiya baxımından əhəmiyyət daşıyan dəyişikliklər SAP-da manual qaydada yerinə yetirilməlidir. İstisna: Kredit nota avtomatik olaraq SAP-a göndərilir, əlavə tədbir görməyə ehtiyac yoxdur .
[tr][EVM 01.10.13: Remains in English (2.2.7.0)]The order is already submitted to SAP. Changes which are not just 'LOGON-only' but commercially relevant must be done manually in SAP to avoid inconsistencies. Exception: Credit Notes are automatically sent to SAP, no additional steps necessary.
[nl][EVM 11.09.15: Remains in English (2.5.x)]The order is already submitted to SAP. Changes which are not just 'LOGON-only' but commercially relevant must be done manually in SAP to avoid inconsistencies. Exception: Credit Notes are automatically sent to SAP, no additional steps necessary.
