[hu][LKO 14.05.13: Hungarian translations (2.1.5.0)]A rendelés át lett küldve az SAP-ba. A változásokat manuálisan kell végrehalytania az SAP-ban a problémák elkerülése érdekében.
[ro][CLU 29.04.13: Romanian translation (2.1.5.0)]Comanda este deja inregistrata in SAP. Schimabarile trebuie facute manual in SAP pentru a evita inconsistentele
[bg][IDO 09.05.13: Bulgarian translation (2.1.5.0)]Поръчката е вече подадена към SAP. Промени трябва да бъдат направени ръчно в SAP, за да се избегнат несъответствия.
[hr][DBE 28.11.13: Croatian translation (2.2.0.8)]Narudžba je već prenesena u SAP. Promjene moraju biti napravljene ručno u SAPu kako bi se izbjegle nedosljednosti.
[sr][EVM 09.11.13: Remains in English]The order is already submitted to SAP. Changes must be done manually in SAP to avoid inconsistencies.
[ru][EDU 02.09.14: Russian translation (2.2.7.0)]Заказ уже отправлен в Сап. Изменения должны быть сделаны вручную в Сап, чтобы избежать несоответствий.
[pl][EVM 28.11.13: Remains in English]The order is already submitted to SAP. Changes must be done manually in SAP to avoid inconsistencies.
