parallel.error.container_assigned_to_order:
[de][EVM 02.07.12: German translation]Der Container hat einen offenen Kundenauftrag für welchen die Stellzeit noch nicht erreicht ist.  Bitte überprüfen sie die eingegebene Container oder kontaktieren Sie den verantwortlichen Disponenten.
[en][EVM 03.05.12: English translation (2.0.0.8)]The container has an open order for which the oparating time has not been reached. Please check the entered container or the responsible dispatcher.
[fr][JJF 04.05.12: French translation]Le container a une commande ouverte pour un client dont la durée n'est pas atteinte. Veuillez vérifier les containers ou contactez les diponents.
[it][EVM 16.05.12: Italian translation]Il container ha un ordine pendente non ancora terminato.  Verificare il container o prendere contatto col disponente
[es][EVM 21.11.12: Spanish translation (2.1.0.5)]El contenedor tiene un pedido abierto para el cual el tiempo operativo no se ha alcanzado. Por favor, revise el contenedor o contacte con el expedidor responsable.
[cs][MNO 30.04.13: Czech translation (2.1.5.0)]Pro kontejner je otevřená objednávka, která nemůže být dosažena v pracovních hodinách. Prosím prověřte zadaný kontejner nebo kontaktujte dispečera.
[sk][PPR 01.05.13: Slovak translation (2.1.5.0)]Pre kontajner je otvorená objednávka, ktorá nemôže byť realizovaná v pracovných hodinách. Prosím preverte zadaný kontajner alebo kontaktujte dispečera.
[hu][LKO 14.05.13: Hungarian translations (2.1.5.0)]A konténer egy nyitott megrendelésben szerepel, aminek még nem járt le az ideje. Ellenőrizze a konténert, vagy a felelős diszpécsert.
[ro][CLU 29.04.13: Romanian translation (2.1.5.0)]Containerul are o comanda in asteptare pentru care timpul de operare nu a fost atins. Va rugam sa verificati containerul introdus sau dispecerul responsabil.
[bg][IDO 09.05.13: Bulgarian translation (2.1.5.0)]Контейнерът има отворена поръчка, за която операционното време не е достигнато. Моля проверете въведения контейнер или отговорния диспечер.
[hr][DBE 01.12.13: Croatian translation]Kontejner ima otvoreni nalog  za koji nije dostignuto operativo vrijeme.
[sr][EVM 09.11.13: Remains in English]The container has an open order for which the oparating time has not been reached. Please check the entered container or the responsible dispatcher.
[ru][EDU 02.09.14: Russian translation (2.2.7.0)]Контейнер имеет открытый заказ, на которое не было назначено время работы. Пожалуйста, проверьте введенный контейнер или ответственного диспетчера.
[pl][EVM 01.12.13: Remains in English]The container has an open order for which the oparating time has not been reached. Please check the entered container or the responsible dispatcher.
[az][FKA 04.06.14: Azeri translation (2.2.7.0)]Konteyner üzrə açıq sifariş üçün iş vaxtı yerinə yetirilməmişdir. Xahiş olunur, daxil edilmiş Konteyneri və ya cavabdeh dispetçeri yoxlayın.
[tr][EVM 01.10.13: Remains in English (2.2.7.0)]The container has an open order for which the oparating time has not been reached. Please check the entered container or the responsible dispatcher.
[nl][EVM 11.09.15: Remains in English (2.5.x)]The container has an open order for which the oparating time has not been reached. Please check the entered container or the responsible dispatcher.
parallel.error.material_mismatch:
[de][EVM 02.07.12: German translation]Das Material des vordisponierten Auftrags für diesen Bahnwagen ist an dieser Ladestelle nicht verfügbar. Bitte weisen Sie diesem Bahnwagen in LOGON einen anderen Auftrag zu (mit einem anderen Material) oder prüfen Sie die Einstellung in Parallel.
[en][EVM 03.05.12: English translation]The material of the pre-dispatched order for this wagon is not available at this loading point. Please assign another order/material to this wagon in LOGON or check the settings in Parallel.
[fr][LPR 02.07.12: French translation]Le matériel mis à disposition provisoirement pour ce wagon, n'est pas valable pour ce lieu de chargement. Veuillez assigner une autre commande/ matériel à ce wagon dans Logon ou vérifiez les options dans le Système Local de Chargement (SLC).
[it][EVM 21.05.12: Italian translation]Il materiale previsto su questo vagone non è disponibile al punto di carico. PF assegnare al vagone un altro materiale o controllare i dati su Parallel
[es][EVM 21.11.12: Spanish translation (2.1.0.5)]El material del pedido de pre-expedición para este vagón no está disponible en este punto de carga. Por favor, asigne otro pedido/material a este vagón en LOGON o revisa las opciones en SLE.
[cs][MNO 30.04.13: Czech translation (2.1.5.0)]Materiál v této objednávce pro tento vagón není dostupný v tomto místě nakládky. Prosím přiřaďte jinou objednávku/materiál tomuto vagónu v LOGONu nebo změňte nastavení v  Parallel.
[sk][PPR 01.05.13: Slovak translation (2.1.5.0)]Materiál v tejto objednávke pre tento vagón nie je dostupný v tomto mieste nakládky. Prosím priraďte inú objednávku/materiál tomuto vagónu v LOGONe alebo zmeňte nastavenie v  Parallel.
[hu][LKO 14.05.13: Hungarian translations (2.1.5.0)]Az anyag az újra pozicionált megrendelésben ez a vagon nem áll rendelkezésére ennél a rakodási pontnál. Jelőljön ki egy másik rendelést/anyagot erre a vagonra a LOGON-ból, vagy ellenőrizze a paralell beállításokat.
[ro][CLU 29.04.13: Romanian translation (2.1.5.0)]Materialul comenzii de pre-expeditie pentru acest vagon nu este disponibil in acest punct de incarcare. Va rugam sa desemnati o alta comanda/un alt material acestui vagon in LOGON sau verificati optiunile in SLE
[bg][IDO 09.05.13: Bulgarian translation (2.1.5.0)]Материалът на предварително диспечираната поръчка за този вагон не е достъпна на това товарище. Моля задайте друга поръчка/материал към този вагон в LOGON или проверете настройките в Schenk.G1999
[hr][DBE 01.12.13: Croatian translation]Materijal preddisponiranog naloga za ovaj vagon nije dostupan na ovoj utovarnoj točki.
[sr][EVM 09.11.13: Remains in English]The material of the pre-dispatched order for this wagon is not available at this loading point. Please assign another order/material to this wagon in LOGON or check the settings in Parallel.
[ru][EDU 02.09.14: Russian translation (2.2.7.0)]Материал предварительного заказа для выбранного вагона не доступен на данном пункте отгрузки. Пожалуйста, выберите другой заказ/материал для вагона в Логон или проверьте параметры настройки.
[pl][EVM 01.12.13: Remains in English]The material of the pre-dispatched order for this wagon is not available at this loading point. Please assign another order/material to this wagon in LOGON or check the settings in Parallel.
[az][FKA 04.06.14: Azeri translation (2.2.7.0)]Bu vaqon üçün əvvəlcədən göndərilmiş sifariş materialı  bu yükləmə məntəqəsində mövcud deyil. Xahiş olunur, bu vaqona başqa bir sifariş/material təyin edəsiniz, ya da Paraleldəki parametrləri yoxlayasınız.
[tr][EVM 01.10.13: Remains in English (2.2.7.0)]The material of the pre-dispatched order for this wagon is not available at this loading point. Please assign another order/material to this wagon in LOGON or check the settings in Parallel.
[nl][EVM 11.09.15: Remains in English (2.5.x)]The material of the pre-dispatched order for this wagon is not available at this loading point. Please assign another order/material to this wagon in LOGON or check the settings in Parallel.
parallel.error.unknown_container:
[de][EVM 02.07.12: German translation]Die Containernummer {0} ist nicht bekannt in LOGON. Bitte überprüfen Sie die Eingabe.
[en][EVM 03.05.12: English translation]The Container number {0} is not known in LOGON. Please check your entry.
[fr][JJF 04.05.12: French translation]Le no de container n'est pas connu de Logon, svp vérifiez
[it][EVM 16.05.12: Italian translation]Il numero container {0} è sconosciuto su Logon, controllare.
