[cs][MNO 30.04.13: Czech translation (2.1.5.0)]Číslo kontejneru {0} je neznáme pro LOGON. Prosím prověřte svoje zadání.
[sk][PPR 01.05.13: Slovak translation (2.1.5.0)]Číslo kontainera  {0} nie je v kmeňových dátach  LOGONu, prosím o preverenie zadania.
[hu][LKO 14.05.13: Hungarian translations (2.1.5.0)]Konténer száma {0} ismeretlen a LOGON számára, ellenőrizze.
[ro][CLU 29.04.13: Romanian translation (2.1.5.0)]Numar container {0} nu este cunoscut in LOGON. Va rugam sa verificati datele introduse.
[bg][IDO 09.05.13: Bulgarian translation (2.1.5.0)]Номерът на Контейнера {0} не е известен в LOGON. Моля проверете въведеното.
[hr][DBE 28.11.13: Croatian translation (2.2.0.8)]Broj kontejnera {0} nije poznat u LOGON-u. Molimo provjerite vaš unos.
[sr][EVM 09.11.13: Remains in English]The Container number {0} is not known in LOGON. Please check your entry.
[ru][EDU 02.09.14: Russian translation (2.2.7.0)]Контейне номером {0} is не известен LOGON. Пожалуйста, проверьте свой ввод.
[pl][EVM 28.11.13: Remains in English]The Container number {0} is not known in LOGON. Please check your entry.
[az][FKA 04.06.14: Azeri translation (2.2.7.0)]Konteynerin nömrəsi {0} LOGON-da məlum deyil. Daxil etdiyniz məlumatı yoxlayın.
[tr][EVM 01.10.13: Remains in English (2.2.7.0)]The Container number {0} is not known in LOGON. Please check your entry.
[nl][EVM 11.09.15: Remains in English (2.5.x)]The Container number {0} is not known in LOGON. Please check your entry.
parallel.error.unknown_wagon:
[de][EVM 02.07.12: German translation]Die Bahnwagennummer {0} ist nicht bekannt in LOGON. Bitte prüfen Sie ihre Eingabe.
[en][EVM 03.05.12: English translation]Wagon number {0} is not known in LOGON, please check your entry.
[fr][JJF 04.05.12: French translation]Le no de wagon n'est pas connu de Logon, svp vérifiez
[it][EVM 24.05.12: Italian translation]Numero Falso {0} è sconosciuto su Logon, controllare.
[es][EVM 21.11.12: Spanish translation (2.1.0.5)]LOGON no reconoce el número {0} del vagón. Por favor, revise la entrada introducida.
[cs][MNO 30.04.13: Czech translation (2.1.5.0)]Číslo vagónu  {0} není v kmenových datech  LOGON, prosím prověřte zadání.
[sk][PPR 01.05.13: Slovak translation (2.1.5.0)]Číslo vagónu  {0} nie je v kmeňových dátach  LOGONu, prosím o preverenie zadania.
[hu][LKO 14.05.13: Hungarian translations (2.1.5.0)]Vagon szám {0} ismeretlen a LOGON számára, ellenőrizze.
[ro][CLU 29.04.13: Romanian translation (2.1.5.0)]Numar vagon {0} este necunoscut in LOGON. Va rugam sa verificati datele introduse.
[bg][IDO 09.05.13: Bulgarian translation (2.1.5.0)]Номера на вагон {0} не е известен в LOGON, моля проверете въведеното.
[hr][DBE 28.11.13: Croatian translation (2.2.0.8)]Broj vagona {0}  je nepoznat u LOGON - u, molimo provjerite vaš ulaz.
[sr][EVM 09.11.13: Remains in English]Wagon number {0} is not known in LOGON, please check your entry.
[ru][EDU 02.09.14: Russian translation (2.2.7.0)]Номер вагона {0} неизвестен в ЛОГОН, пожалуйста, проверьте правильность введенных данных.
[pl][EVM 28.11.13: Remains in English]Wagon number {0} is not known in LOGON, please check your entry.
[az][FKA 04.06.14: Azeri translation (2.2.7.0)]Vaqonun nömrəsi {0} LOGON-da məlum deyil. Daxil etdiyniz məlumatı yoxlayın.
[tr][EVM 01.10.13: Remains in English (2.2.7.0)]Wagon number {0} is not known in LOGON, please check your entry.
[nl][EVM 11.09.15: Remains in English (2.5.x)]Wagon number {0} is not known in LOGON, please check your entry.
parallel.error.wagon_assigned_to_order:
[de][EVM 02.07.12: German translation]Der Bahnwagen hat einen offenen Kundenauftrag für welchen die Stellzeit noch nicht erreicht ist.  Bitte überprüfen sie die eingegebene Bahnwagennummer oder kontaktieren Sie den verantwortlichen Disponenten.
[en][EVM 03.05.12: English translation (2.0.0.8)]The wagon has an open order for which the operating time has not been reached. Please check the entered wagon number or contact the responsible dispatcher.
[fr][JJF 04.05.12: French translation]Le wagon a une commande ouverte pour un client dont la durée n'est pas atteinte. Veuillez vérifier les containers ou contactez les diponents.
[it][EVM 16.05.12: Italian translation]Il vagone ha un ordine del cliente ancora aperto. PF controllare il numero del container o contattare il disponente.
[es][EVM 21.11.12: Spanish translation (2.1.0.5)]El vagón tiene un pedido abierto para el cual el tiempo operativo no se ha alcanzado. Por favor, revise el contenedor o contacte con el expedidor responsable.
[cs][MNO 30.04.13: Czech translation (2.1.5.0)]Pro vagón je otevřená objednávka, která nemůže být dosažena v pracovních hodinách. Prosím prověřte zadaný vagón nebo kontaktujte dispečera.
[sk][PPR 01.05.13: Slovak translation (2.1.5.0)]Pre vagón je otvorená objednávka, ktorá nemôže byť realizovaná v pracovných hodinách. Prosím preverte zadané číslo vagóna alebo kontaktujte dispečera.
[hu][LKO 14.05.13: Hungarian translations (2.1.5.0)]A vagonnak nyitott megrendelése van, aminek még nem érte el a működési idejének a végét. Ellenőrizze a kocsizámot, vagy lépjen kapcsolatba a felelős diszpécserrel.
[ro][CLU 29.04.13: Romanian translation (2.1.5.0)]Vagonul are o comanda in asteptare pentru care timpul de operare nu a fost atins. Va rugam sa verificati numarul vagonului introdus sau contactati dispecerul responsabil.
[bg][IDO 09.05.13: Bulgarian translation (2.1.5.0)]Вагонът има отворена поръчка, за която операционното време не е достигнато. Моля проверете въведения номер на вагон или се свържете с отговорния диспечер.
[hr][DBE 01.12.13: Croatian translation]Vagon ima otvoren nalog za koji operativno vrijeme nije dostignuto.
[sr][EVM 09.11.13: Remains in English]The wagon has an open order for which the operating time has not been reached. Please check the entered wagon number or contact the responsible dispatcher.
[ru][EDU 02.09.14: Russian translation (2.2.7.0)]Для выбранного вагона есть открытый заказ с истекшим сроком доставки. Пожалуйста,проверьте номер введенного вагона или свяжитесь с ответственным диспетчером.
[pl][EVM 01.12.13: Remains in English]The wagon has an open order for which the operating time has not been reached. Please check the entered wagon number or contact the responsible dispatcher.
[az][FKA 04.06.14: Azeri translation (2.2.7.0)]Vaqon üzrə açıq sifariş üçün iş vaxtı yerinə yetirilməmişdir. Xahiş olunur, daxil edilmiş vaqonun nömrəsini yoxlayın və ya cavabdeh dispetçerlə əlaqə saxlayın.
[tr][EVM 01.10.13: Remains in English (2.2.7.0)]The wagon has an open order for which the operating time has not been reached. Please check the entered wagon number or contact the responsible dispatcher.
[nl][EVM 11.09.15: Remains in English (2.5.x)]The wagon has an open order for which the operating time has not been reached. Please check the entered wagon number or contact the responsible dispatcher.
parallel.error.wagon_assigned_to_order_other_plant:
[de][EVM 02.07.12: German translation]Der Bahnwagen hat einen offenen Kundenauftrag und der Standard-Rückfahrort in den Stammdaten entspricht nicht diesem Zielort. Bitte überprüfen sie die eingegebene Bahnwagennummer oder kontaktieren Sie den verantwortlichen Disponenten.
[en][EVM 03.05.12: English translation (2.0.0.8)]The wagon has an open order and the standard return place doesn't correspond to this destination. Please check the entered wagon number or contact the responsible dispatcher.
[fr][JJF 04.05.12: French translation]Le wagon a une commande ouverte pour un client dont la durée n'est pas atteinte. Les données ne correspondent pas au lieu de livraison. Veuillez vérifier les containers ou contactez les diponents.
[it][EVM 24.05.12: Italian translation]Il vagone ha un ordine del cliente ancora aperto, il luogo di ritorno nei dati base non corrisponde al luogo immesso. PF controllare il nr. vagone o contattare il diponente.
[es][EVM 21.11.12: Spanish translation (2.1.0.5)]El vagón tiene un pedido abierto y el lugar de retorno estándar no se corresponde con este destino. Por favor, revise el número de vagón introducido o contacte con el expedidor responsable.
[cs][MNO 30.04.13: Czech translation (2.1.5.0)]Vagón má otevřenou objednávku a standardní místo návratu nekoresponduje s touto destinací.  Prosím prověřte zadané číslo vagónu nebo kontaktujte odpovědného dispečera.
[sk][PPR 01.05.13: Slovak translation (2.1.5.0)]Vagón má otvorenú objednávku a štandardné miesto návratu nekorešponduje s touto destináciou. Prosím preverte zadané číslo vagóna alebo kontaktujte dispečera.
[hu][LKO 14.05.13: Hungarian translations (2.1.5.0)]A vagonnak nyitott megrendelése van, és a standard visszatérési hely nem felel meg ennek a helynek. Ellenőrizze a kocsizámot, vagy lépjen kapcsolatba a felelős diszpécserrel.
[ro][CLU 29.04.13: Romanian translation (2.1.5.0)]Vagonul are o comanda in asteptare si locul de retur standard nu corespunde acestei destinatii. Va rugam sa verificati numarul vagonului introdus sau contactati dispecerul responsabil.
[bg][IDO 09.05.13: Bulgarian translation (2.1.5.0)]Вагонът има отворена поръчка и стандартното място за връщане не отговаря на дестинацията. Моля проверете въведения номер на вагон или се свържете с отговорния диспечер.
[hr][DBE 01.12.13: Croatian translation]Vagon ima otvoren nalog  i standardno povratno mjesto ne odgovara toj destinaciji.
[sr][EVM 09.11.13: Remains in English]The wagon has an open order and the standard return place doesn't correspond to this destination. Please check the entered wagon number or contact the responsible dispatcher.
[ru][EDU 02.09.14: Russian translation (2.2.7.0)]Для выбранного вагона есть открытый заказ и  особые условия возврата на место назначения. Пожалуйста,проверьте номер введенного вагона или свяжитесь с ответственным диспетчером..
[pl][EVM 01.12.13: Remains in English]The wagon has an open order and the standard return place doesn't correspond to this destination. Please check the entered wagon number or contact the responsible dispatcher.
[az][FKA 04.06.14: Azeri translation (2.2.7.0)]Vaqon üzrə açıq sifariş var və standart geri qaytarma yeri bu təyinat nöqtəsinə uyğun gəlmir. Xahiş olunur, daxil edilmiş vaqonun nömrəsini yoxlayın və ya cavabdeh dispetçerlə əlaqə saxlayın.
[tr][EVM 01.10.13: Remains in English (2.2.7.0)]The wagon has an open order and the standard return place doesn't correspond to this destination. Please check the entered wagon number or contact the responsible dispatcher.
[nl][EVM 11.09.15: Remains in English (2.5.x)]The wagon has an open order and the standard return place doesn't correspond to this destination. Please check the entered wagon number or contact the responsible dispatcher.
parallel.error.wagon_assigned_to_return_order:
[de][EVM 02.07.12: German translation]Der Bahnwagen ist gemäss Auftrag zu einem anderen Zielort unterwegs.  Bitte überprüfen sie die eingegebene Bahnwagennummer oder kontaktieren Sie den verantwortlichen Disponenten.
[en][EVM 03.05.12: English translation (2.0.0.8)]The wagon is under an order to another destination on the road. Please check the entered wagon number or contact the responsible dispatcher.
[fr][JJF 04.05.12: French translation]Le wagon est déjà en route pour une autre distination.  Veuillez vérifier le numéro du wagon ou contactez les disponents.
[it][EVM 22.05.12: Italian translation]Secondo l'ordine il vagone ha gia una destinazione assegnata. PF controllare il nr. vagone o contattare il diponente.
[es][EVM 21.11.12: Spanish translation (2.1.0.5)]El vagón está en el curso de un pedido que tiene otro destino por carretera. Por favor, revise el número de vagón introducido o contacte con el expedidor responsable.
[cs][MNO 30.04.13: Czech translation (2.1.5.0)]Vůz je v příkazu do jiného místa určení na silnici. Prosím zkontrolujte zadané číslo železničního vagónu nebo se obraťte na příslušného dispečera.
[sk][PPR 01.05.13: Slovak translation (2.1.5.0)]Vozeň je podľa príkazu z objednávky na ceste do iného miesta určenia. Prosím skontrolujte zadané číslo železničného vagónu alebo sa obraťte na príslušného dispečera.
[hu][LKO 14.05.13: Hungarian translations (2.1.5.0)]A vagon egy rendelés alatt más helyen van. Ellenőrizze a vagon számot, vagy keresse fel a felelős diszpécsert.
[ro][CLU 29.04.13: Romanian translation (2.1.5.0)]Acest vagon este intr-o alta comanda in desfasurare catre o alta destinatie. Va rugam sa verificati numarul vagonului introdus sau contactati dispecerul responsabil.
[bg][IDO 09.05.13: Bulgarian translation (2.1.5.0)]Вагонът е по поръчка за друга дестинация по маршрута. Моля проверете въведения номер на вагона или се свържете с отговорния диспечер.
[hr][DBE 01.12.13: Croatian translation]Vagon je pod određenim nalogom za neku dugu destinaciju na cesti.
[sr][EVM 09.11.13: Remains in English]The wagon is under an order to another destination on the road. Please check the entered wagon number or contact the responsible dispatcher.
[ru][EDU 02.09.14: Russian translation (2.2.7.0)]Вагон используется в другом заказе. Пожалуйста,проверьте номер введенного вагона или свяжитесь с ответственным диспетчером.
[pl][EVM 01.12.13: Remains in English]The wagon is under an order to another destination on the road. Please check the entered wagon number or contact the responsible dispatcher.
[az][FKA 04.06.14: Azeri translation (2.2.7.0)]Vaqon başqa bir təyinat nöqtəsi istiqamətində sifarişi yerinə yetirir. Xahiş olunur, daxil edilmiş vaqonun nömrəsini yoxlayın və ya cavabdeh dispetçerlə əlaqə saxlayın..
[tr][EVM 01.10.13: Remains in English (2.2.7.0)]The wagon is under an order to another destination on the road. Please check the entered wagon number or contact the responsible dispatcher.
[nl][EVM 11.09.15: Remains in English (2.5.x)]The wagon is under an order to another destination on the road. Please check the entered wagon number or contact the responsible dispatcher.
parallel.error.wagon_loaded:
[de][EVM 02.07.12: German translation]Der Bahnwagen ist bereits beladen.
[en][EVM 03.05.12: English translation]Wagon is already loaded.
[fr][JJF 04.05.12: French translation]Wagon déjà chargé
[it][EVM 24.05.12: Italian translation]Il vagone è gia stato caricato
[es][EVM 21.11.12: Spanish translation (2.1.0.5)]El vagón está cargado.
[cs][MNO 30.04.13: Czech translation (2.1.5.0)]Vaje jej již naložen.
[sk][PPR 01.05.13: Slovak translation (2.1.5.0)]Vagón je už naložený.
[hu][LKO 14.05.13: Hungarian translations (2.1.5.0)]A vagon megtöltve.
[ro][CLU 29.04.13: Romanian translation (2.1.5.0)]Vagonul este deja incarcat.
[bg][IDO 09.05.13: Bulgarian translation (2.1.5.0)]Вагонът е вече натоварен.
[hr][DBE 28.11.13: Croatian translation (2.2.0.8)]Vagon je već natovaren.
[sr][EVM 09.11.13: Remains in English]Wagon is already loaded.
[ru][EDU 02.09.14: Russian translation (2.2.7.0)]Вагон погружен
[pl][EVM 28.11.13: Remains in English]Wagon is already loaded.
[az][FKA 04.06.14: Azeri translation (2.2.7.0)]Vaqon artıq yüklənilib.
