[nl][EVM 11.09.15: Remains in English (2.5.x)]Wagon is already loaded.
parallel.warning.container_overload:
[de][EVM 02.07.12: German translation]Achtung: Gefahr von Überfüllung! Es besteht eine Tarabweichung von {0} tons. Mindestens einer der Container ist nicht leer. Das Ladegewicht für den/die entsprechenden Container muss in Parallel/Fenics/WeWas/Schenck/Hodim vor dem Verlad um die entsprechende Menge reduziert werden. Nach dem Verlad bitte beim entsprecheden Container die Nettomenge in LOGON um die entsprechende Rückmenge ergänzen.
[en][EVM 03.05.12: English translation (2.0.0.8)]Caution: Overloaded wagon! This creat a tare of {0} tons. At least one container is not empty. The loaded weight of the container must be recorded in Parallel/Fenics/WeWas/Schenck/Hodim before the next loading for a right tare. After loading please enter the net weight of the container in Logon.
[fr][LPR 02.07.12: French translation]Attention: Danger wagon trop chargé! Ce qui engendre une tare {0} tonnes. Au moins l'un des container n'est pas vide. Le poids de chargement du container doit être noté dans le Système Local de Chargement (SLC) avant le prochain chargement pour avoir la tare juste.Après le chargement veuillez entrer le poids net du container dans LOGON.
[it][EVM 16.05.12: Italian translation]Attenzione, sovraccarico! Considerare una tara di {0} ton. Uno dei container non è vuoto. Prima del carico stabilito, diminuire sul Parallel/Fenics/WeWas/Schenck/Hodim la cifra riportata. Dopo il carico vi preghiamo di correggere il peso netto su Logon.
[es][EVM 21.11.12: Spanish translation (2.1.0.5)]¡Atención: vagón con exceso de carga! Esto creará una tara de {0} tons. Al menos un contenedor no está vacío.  Para una tara correcta, el peso del contenedor cargado debe ser registrado en SLE antes de la siguiente carga. Por favor, después de la carga introduzca el peso neto del contenedor en LOGON.
[cs][MNO 30.04.13: Czech translation (2.1.5.0)]Varování: Přeložený vagón! This creat a tare of {0} tons. At least one container is not empty. The loaded weight of the container must be recorded in Parallel/Fenics/WeWas/Schenck/Hodim before the next loading for a right tare. After loading please enter the net weight of the container in Logon.
[sk][PPR 01.05.13: Slovak translation (2.1.5.0)]Varovanie: Preložený vagón! Vzniká preloženie v tara hmotnosti {0} tons. Min. jeden kontainer nie je prázdny. Naložené množstvo pre príslušný kontainer, musí byť parelelne zmenšený na množstvo ako tomu bolo pred nakládkou.  Po nakládke u príslušného kontaineru netto množstvo v LOGONe a  príslušné vrátené množstvo je potrebné dokončiť.
[hu][LKO 14.05.13: Hungarian translations (2.1.5.0)]Figyelem: Túlsúlyos vagon! Súly létrehozva {0} tonna tárasúllyal. Egalább egy konténer nem üres. A konténer rakott súlyát fel kell jegyezni párhozamosan a következő rakodás előtt a helyes tára súllyal. Rakodás után írja be a nettó súlyát a konténernek a LOGON-ba.
[ro][CLU 29.04.13: Romanian translation (2.1.5.0)]Atentie: vagon supraincarcat! Aceasta creaza o tarra de {0} tone. Cel putin un container nu este gol. Greutatea incarcata a containerului trebuie sa fie inregistrata in SLE inainte de urmatoarea incarcare cu o tarra corecta. Dupa incarcare va rugam sa introduceti greutatea netto a containerului in LOGON.
[bg][IDO 09.05.13: Bulgarian translation (2.1.5.0)]Внимание: Претоварен вагон! Това прави тара от {0} тона. Поне един контейнер не е празен. Натовареното тегло на контейнера трябва да бъде записано паралелно преди следващото товарене за правилна тара. След товаренето моля въведете нетното тегло на контейнера в Logon.
[hr][DBE 01.12.13: Croatian translation]Oprez: Prenatovaren vagon! Kreiran je za taru od {0} tona. Najmanje jedan kontejner je prazan.
[sr][EVM 09.11.13: Remains in English]Caution: Overloaded wagon! This creat a tare of {0} tons. At least one container is not empty. The loaded weight of the container must be recorded in Parallel/Fenics/WeWas/Schenck/Hodim before the next loading for a right tare. After loading please enter the net weight of the container in Logon.
[ru][EDU 02.09.14: Russian translation (2.2.7.0)]Внимание: Перегруженный вагон! Создана тара {0} тонн. По крайней мере, один контейнер не пустой. Максимальная разрешенная масса контейнера должны быть записаны в Parallel / FENICS / WeWas / Шенк / Hodim до следующей загрузки для правильной тары. После загрузки введите вес нетто контейнера в Logon.
[pl][EVM 01.12.13: Remains in English]Caution: Overloaded wagon! This creat a tare of {0} tons. At least one container is not empty. The loaded weight of the container must be recorded in Parallel/Fenics/WeWas/Schenck/Hodim before the next loading for a right tare. After loading please enter the net weight of the container in Logon.
[az][FKA 04.06.14: Azeri translation (2.2.7.0)]Diqqət: Vaqon həddən artıq yüklənilib!  {0} tonluq tara yaranıb. Ən az bir konteyner boş deyil. Növbəti yükləmədən əvvəl konteynerin yüklə çəkisi Paralel/Fenics/WeWas/Schenck/Hodim-də qeyd edilməlidir.  YÜkləmədən sonra, xahiş olunur, Logon-da Konteynerin xalis çəkisini daxil edin.
[tr][EVM 01.10.13: Remains in English (2.2.7.0)]Caution: Overloaded wagon! This creat a tare of {0} tons. At least one container is not empty. The loaded weight of the container must be recorded in Parallel/Fenics/WeWas/Schenck/Hodim before the next loading for a right tare. After loading please enter the net weight of the container in Logon.
[nl][EVM 11.09.15: Remains in English (2.5.x)]Caution: Overloaded wagon! This creat a tare of {0} tons. At least one container is not empty. The loaded weight of the container must be recorded in Parallel/Fenics/WeWas/Schenck/Hodim before the next loading for a right tare. After loading please enter the net weight of the container in Logon.
