pickup.errors.palletproblem:
[de][EVM 02.07.12: German translation]Fehlende Konfiguration für Palettenverrechnung. Auftrag kann nur angelegt werden, falls die Anzahl der Rückpaletten gleich der Anzahl der mitgenommen Paletten ist.
[en][EVM 03.05.12: English translation]Some background data is missing for adding pallet charges to the order. The order can only be saved if the number of returned pallets is equal to the number of ordered pallets.
[fr][JJF 04.05.12: French translation]configuration manquante pour facturation palettes. L'ordre ne peut seulement etre enregistre si le nombre de palettes en retour est identique au nombre de palettes livrees.
[it][EVM 22.05.12: Italian translation]Mancano dati per aggiungere le bancali all'ordine. L'ordine potrà essere salvato solo se le bancali ordinate e quelle caricate sono uguali.
[es][EVM 21.11.12: Spanish translation (2.1.0.5)]Faltan algunos datos de origen para añadir cargos por palés al pedido. El pedido sólo se guardará si el número de palés devueltos es igual al número de palés pedidos.
[cs][MNO 30.04.13: Czech translation (2.1.5.0)]Chybějí některé údaje pro fakturaci palet. Objednávka může být uložená pouze pokud se rovná počet palet objednaných a vrácených.
[sk][PPR 01.05.13: Slovak translation (2.1.5.0)]Chýbajú niektoré údaje pre fakturáciu paliet. Objednávka môže byť uložená len ak sa počet vrátených paliet rovná objednaným paletám.
[hu][LKO 14.05.13: Hungarian translations (2.1.5.0)]Néhány háttéradat hiányzik a rendelésben szereplő raklapok díjához. A rendelés csak akkor menthető, ha a csere raklapok száma megegyezik a kiadott raklapok számával.
[ro][CLU 29.04.13: Romanian translation (2.1.5.0)]Lipsa date originale pentru adaugarea incarcaturii de paleti comenzii. Comanda poate doar fi salvata daca numarul paletilor returnati este egal cu numarul paletilor comandati.
[bg][IDO 09.05.13: Bulgarian translation (2.1.5.0)]Липсва необходима информация за добавяне на такси палета към поръчката. Поръчката може единствено да бъде записана ако броя на върнатите палета е равен на броя на поръчаните палета.
[hr][DBE 01.12.13: Croatian translation]Neki pozadinski podaci nedostaju za popunjavanje paleta na nalog.
[sr][EVM 09.11.13: Remains in English]Some background data is missing for adding pallet charges to the order. The order can only be saved if the number of returned pallets is equal to the number of ordered pallets.
[ru][EDU 02.09.14: Russian translation (2.2.7.0)]Некоторые исходые данные потеряны для добавления поддонов в заказ. Заказ может быть сохранен только если кол-во возвращенных поддонов равно кол-ву заказанных поддонов.
[pl][EVM 01.12.13: Remains in English]Some background data is missing for adding pallet charges to the order. The order can only be saved if the number of returned pallets is equal to the number of ordered pallets.
[az][FKA 04.06.14: Azeri translation (2.2.7.0)]Sifarişə yük plitələrinin xərclərini əlavə edərkən bir sıra məlumatların ötürüldüyü aşkar edildi. Sifariş ancaq o zaman yaddaşda saxlanıla bilər ki, geri qaytarılmış yük plitələrinin sayı sifariş olunmuş plitələrin sayına bərabər olsun.
[tr][EVM 01.10.13: Remains in English (2.2.7.0)]Some background data is missing for adding pallet charges to the order. The order can only be saved if the number of returned pallets is equal to the number of ordered pallets.
[nl][EVM 11.09.15: Remains in English (2.5.x)]Some background data is missing for adding pallet charges to the order. The order can only be saved if the number of returned pallets is equal to the number of ordered pallets.
pickup.errors.freedelivery.impossible:
[de][EVM 02.07.12: German translation]Für Gratislieferung muss Rechnungsempfänger (Bill To) gleich dem Auftraggeber (Sold To) sein.
[en][EVM 03.05.12: English translation]Free of charge delivery is only possible in case the Bill to partner is the same as Sold to partner!
[fr][DSU 13.09.12: French translation]La livraison gratuiten'est possible que si le partenaire débiteur est le même que le partenaire donneur d'ordre.
[it][EVM 15.06.12: Italian translation]Le forniture gratuite sono possibili solo se il Destinatario fattura corrisponde al Committente.
[es][EVM 21.11.12: Spanish translation (2.1.0.5)]¡El envío gratuito sólo es posible en caso de que el Facturar a sea el mismo que el Vendido a!
[cs][MNO 30.04.13: Czech translation (2.1.5.0)]Dodávka bez úplaty je možná pouze v případě, kdy plátce je stejný jako odběratel!
[sk][PPR 01.05.13: Slovak translation (2.1.5.0)]Dodávka za darmo je možná len ak je príjemca faktúry ten istý ako zadávateľ.
[hu][LKO 14.05.13: Hungarian translations (2.1.5.0)]Ingyenes szállítás csak akkor lehetséges, ha a Bill to partner ugyan az mint a Sold to partner!
[ro][CLU 29.04.13: Romanian translation (2.1.5.0)]Livrarea gratuita este posibila numai in cazul in care Factura partener este aceeasi cu Vandut partener
[bg][IDO 09.05.13: Bulgarian translation (2.1.5.0)]Безплатна доставка е възможна единствено в случай, че пратньора, на когото е фактурирана е същия като този, на когото е продадена.
[hr][DBE 11.12.13: Croatian translation]Donacija je moguća samo ako je primatelj računa i platitelj računa.
[sr][EVM 09.11.13: Remains in English]Free of charge delivery is only possible in case the Bill to partner is the same as Sold to partner!
[ru][EDU 02.09.14: Russian translation (2.2.7.0)]Бесплатная поставка возможна только в случае если Плательщик и Получатель одно лицо!
[pl][EVM 28.11.13: Remains in English]Free of charge delivery is only possible in case the Bill to partner is the same as Sold to partner!
[az][FKA 04.06.14: Azeri translation (2.2.7.0)]Pulsuz təslim ancaq o zaman mümkündür ki, faktura üzrə tərəfdaş Satış üzrə tərəfdaşla eyni olsun!
[tr][EVM 01.10.13: Remains in English (2.2.7.0)]Free of charge delivery is only possible in case the Bill to partner is the same as Sold to partner!
[nl][EVM 11.09.15: Remains in English (2.5.x)]Free of charge delivery is only possible in case the Bill to partner is the same as Sold to partner!
pickup.errors.quantity.restriction:
[de][JTI 05.07.12: German translation]Die verfügbare Menge ({0}) ist geringer als die bestellte für '{1}'. Bitte die Bestellmenge reduzieren.
[en][EVM 03.05.12: English translation (2.0.0.8)]The open quantity ({0}) is smaller than the ordered quantity for '{1}'. Please reduce the ordered quantity.
