[cs][MNO 30.04.13: Czech translation (2.1.5.0)]Zpoždění. Vagón ještě nepřijel.
[sk][PPR 01.05.13: Slovak translation (2.1.5.0)]Meškanie. Vozne / vozy ešte neodišli.
[hu][LKO 14.05.13: Hungarian translations (2.1.5.0)]Késé. A vagon még nem indult el.
[ro][CLU 29.04.13: Romanian translation (2.1.5.0)]Intarziere. Vagonul inca nu a plecat
[bg][IDO 09.05.13: Bulgarian translation (2.1.5.0)]Закъснение. Вагонът не е отпътувал.
[hr][DBE 28.11.13: Croatian translation (2.2.0.8)]Kašnjenje. Vagon još nije krenuo.
