[de][EVM 02.07.12: German translation]Fahrauftrag nicht übermittelt. Nächste stellzeit benutzen!
[en][EVM 03.05.12: English translation]Order not submitted (SBB). Use next manipulating time!
[fr][JJF 04.05.12: French translation]Commande n'a pas été soumise
[it][EVM 22.05.12: Italian translation]Ordine di circolazione non ancora trasmesso.
[es][EVM 21.11.12: Spanish translation (2.1.0.5)]Pedido no enviado (Compañía de tren). ¡Utilice la siguiente hora modificable!
[cs][MNO 30.04.13: Czech translation (2.1.5.0)]Objednávka nebyla doručena. Použijte následující manipulační čas!
[sk][PPR 01.05.13: Slovak translation (2.1.5.0)]Objednávka nedoručená. Použite nasledujúci čas nastavenia!
[hu][LKO 14.05.13: Hungarian translations (2.1.5.0)]A rendelés nem lett leadva. Adja le mégegyszer.
[ro][CLU 29.04.13: Romanian translation (2.1.5.0)]Comanda nu a fost transmisa (compania feroviara). Folositi urmatoarea ora modificabila!
[bg][IDO 09.05.13: Bulgarian translation (2.1.5.0)]Поръчката не е предадена.
[hr][DBE 28.11.13: Croatian translation (2.2.0.8)]Nalog nije podnesen (SBB). Koristi sljedeće manipulativno vrijeme.
[sr][EVM 09.11.13: Remains in English]Order not submitted (SBB). Use next manipulating time!
[ru][EDU 02.09.14: Russian translation (2.2.7.0)]Заказ не затребован (SBB). Используйте следующее время обработки!
[pl][EVM 28.11.13: Remains in English]Order not submitted (SBB). Use next manipulating time!
[az][FKA 04.06.14: Azeri translation (2.2.7.0)]Sifariş təqdim edilməyib. Növbəti vaxtdan istifadə edin!
[tr][EVM 01.10.13: Remains in English (2.2.7.0)]Order not submitted (SBB). Use next manipulating time!
