raildispo.errors.weightTransmitted:
[de][EVM 02.07.12: German translation]Der Auftrag wurde schon an das EVU übermittelt. Bitte passen sie auch den übetragenen Auftrag an!
[en][EVM 03.05.12: English translation]The order was already transmitted to the rail company. Plese modify the transmitted order, too!
[fr][LPR 02.07.12: French translation]la commande a déjà été transmise aux chemins de fer. Adaptez aussi la commande transmise.
[it][EVM 01.06.12: Italian translation]Ordine gia trasmesso alla società ferroviarie. PF modificare l'ordine trasmesso.
[es][EVM 21.11.12: Spanish translation (2.1.0.5)]El pedido ha sido transmitido a la empresa de ffcc. ¡Por favor, modifique también el pedido transmitido!
[cs][MNO 30.04.13: Czech translation (2.1.5.0)]Objednávka již byla doručena železniční společnosti. Prosím upravte  také odeslanou objednávku!
[sk][PPR 01.05.13: Slovak translation (2.1.5.0)]Objednávky už bola doručená železničnej spoločnosti. Prosím upravte aj doručenú objednávku!
[hu][LKO 14.05.13: Hungarian translations (2.1.5.0)]A megrendelés már el lett küldve a vasúttársaságnak. Kérem módosítsa az elküldött megrendelést is.
[ro][CLU 29.04.13: Romanian translation (2.1.5.0)]Comanda a fost deja transmisa companiei feroviare. Va rugam sa modificati si comanda transmisa!
[bg][IDO 09.05.13: Bulgarian translation (2.1.5.0)]Поръчката е вече предадени на
[hr][DBE 28.11.13: Croatian translation (2.2.0.8)]Nalog je već prenesen željezničkoj kompaniji. Molim ispravite također prijenos naloga!
[sr][EVM 09.11.13: Remains in English]The order was already transmitted to the rail company. Plese modify the transmitted order, too!
[ru][EDU 02.09.14: Russian translation (2.2.7.0)]Заказ был уже передан ЖД компании. Пожалуйста, измените передаваемые заказ!
[pl][EVM 28.11.13: Remains in English]The order was already transmitted to the rail company. Plese modify the transmitted order, too!
[az][FKA 04.06.14: Azeri translation (2.2.7.0)]Sifariş artıq dəmir yolu şirkətinə verilib. Xahiş olunur, verilmiş sifarişi də dəyişin!
[tr][EVM 01.10.13: Remains in English (2.2.7.0)]The order was already transmitted to the rail company. Plese modify the transmitted order, too!
[nl][EVM 11.09.15: Remains in English (2.5.x)]The order was already transmitted to the rail company. Plese modify the transmitted order, too!
raildispo.errors.orderTransmitted:
[de][EVM 02.07.12: German translation]Der Auftrag wurde schon an das EVU übermittelt. Bitte stornieren sie auch den übertragenen Auftrag!
[en][EVM 03.05.12: English translation]The order was already transmitted to the rail company. Plese cancel the transmitted order, too!
[fr][LPR 02.07.12: French translation]L'ordre à déjà été transmisà la compagnie ferroviaire. Veuillez également annuler l'ordre transmis!
[it][EVM 01.06.12: Italian translation]Ordine gia trasmesso alla società ferroviarie. PF cancellare l'ordine trasmesso.
[es][EVM 21.11.12: Spanish translation (2.1.0.5)]El pedido ha sido transmitido a la empresa de ffcc. ¡Por favor, cancele también el pedido transmitido!
[cs][MNO 30.04.13: Czech translation (2.1.5.0)]Objednávka již byla doručena železniční společnosti. Prosím smažte   také odeslanou objednávku!
[sk][PPR 01.05.13: Slovak translation (2.1.5.0)]Objednávky už bola doručená železničnej spoločnosti. Prosím zrušte doručenú objednávku!
[hu][LKO 14.05.13: Hungarian translations (2.1.5.0)]A megrendelés már el lett küldve a vasúttársaságnak. Kérem törölje az elküldött megrendelést is.
[ro][CLU 29.04.13: Romanian translation (2.1.5.0)]Comanda a fost deja transmisa companiei feroviare. Va rugam sa anulati si comanda transmisa!
[bg][IDO 09.05.13: Bulgarian translation (2.1.5.0)]Заявката е вече предадена на
[hr][DBE 28.11.13: Croatian translation (2.2.0.8)]Nalog je već prenesen željezničkoj kompaniji. Molim poništite također prijenos naloga!
[sr][EVM 09.11.13: Remains in English]The order was already transmitted to the rail company. Plese cancel the transmitted order, too!
[ru][EDU 02.09.14: Russian translation (2.2.7.0)]Заказ уже отправлен жд компании. Пожалуйста, отмените переданный заказ!
[pl][EVM 28.11.13: Remains in English]The order was already transmitted to the rail company. Plese cancel the transmitted order, too!
[az][FKA 04.06.14: Azeri translation (2.2.7.0)]Sifariş artıq dəmir yolu şirkətinə verilib. Xahiş olunur, verilmiş sifarişi də ləğv edin!
[tr][EVM 01.10.13: Remains in English (2.2.7.0)]The order was already transmitted to the rail company. Plese cancel the transmitted order, too!
[nl][EVM 11.09.15: Remains in English (2.5.x)]The order was already transmitted to the rail company. Plese cancel the transmitted order, too!
