[de][EVM 02.07.12: German translation]Die Restmenge aus dem letzten Auftrag ist zu Gross, beladen nicht möglich!
[en][EVM 03.05.12: English translation (2.0.0.8)]The remaining quantity of the last order is too large, impossible to load!
[fr][LPR 02.07.12: French translation]La quantité en retour de la dernière commande est trop grande, impossible de charger
[it][EVM 01.06.12: Italian translation]Il resto dell'ultima fornitura è troppo grande, carico non possibile
[es][EVM 21.11.12: Spanish translation (2.1.0.5)]La cantidad pendiente del último pedido es demasiado grande, ¡imposible cargar!
[cs][MNO 30.04.13: Czech translation (2.1.5.0)]Zůstatkové množství v minulé objednávce je příliš velké, není možné naložit!
[sk][PPR 01.05.13: Slovak translation (2.1.5.0)]Zostatkové množstvo poslednej objednávky je príliš veľké, nemožné naložiť!
[hu][LKO 14.05.13: Hungarian translations (2.1.5.0)]A hátralévő mennyiség túl nagy, nem lehetséges a töltés.
[ro][CLU 29.04.13: Romanian translation (2.1.5.0)]Cantitatea ramasa a ultimei comenzi este prea mare, imposibil de incarcat!
[bg][IDO 09.05.13: Bulgarian translation (2.1.5.0)]Останалото количество от последната поръчка е твърде голямо , невъзможно е зареждане!
[hr][DBE 28.11.13: Croatian translation (2.2.0.8)]Preostale količine posljednjeg naloga su prevelike, nemoguće ukrcati!
[sr][EVM 09.11.13: Remains in English]The remaining quantity of the last order is too large, impossible to load!
[ru][EDU 02.09.14: Russian translation (2.2.7.0)]Остаток превышает допустимые нормы. Загрузка невозможна!
[pl][EVM 28.11.13: Remains in English]The remaining quantity of the last order is too large, impossible to load!
[az][FKA 04.06.14: Azeri translation (2.2.7.0)]Son sifarişin qalan miqdarı çox böyüukdür, yükləmək mümkün deyil!
