wagon.error.format.wheelset.month:
[de][EVM 02.07.12: German translation]Falsches Format im Feld "Radsatz Jahr". Der Wert muss im Format yyyy[.mm] eingegeben werden.
[en][EVM 03.05.12: English translation]Field "Wheel set year" has wrong month format. Value should be Year.Month (e.g. 2020.01).
[fr][JJF 04.05.12: French translation]Mauvais format de mois dans le champ "Wheel set year". La valeur doit être Année.Mois (yyyy.mm)
[it][EVM 03.05.12: Italian translation]Campo "Set ruote veicoli" ha un formato data sbagliato: Prima anno poi mese (es. 2020.01).
[es][EVM 21.11.12: Spanish translation (2.1.0.5)]Formato de mes erróneo en campo "año juego ruedas". El valor debe ser Mes.Año (p.e. 01.2020).
[cs][MNO 30.04.13: Czech translation (2.1.5.0)]Chybný formát v "Dvoukolí - rok" Hodnota musí být zadána ve formátu rrrr [mm].
[sk][PPR 01.05.13: Slovak translation (2.1.5.0)]Pole "Sada kolies rok" má zlý formát mesiaca.  Hodnoty majú byť Rok.Mesiac (napr. 2020.01).
[hu][LKO 14.05.13: Hungarian translations (2.1.5.0)]Kerékszett éve mezőben rossz a hónap formája. Év.Hónap (pl.: 2020.01)
[ro][CLU 29.04.13: Romanian translation (2.1.5.0)]Campul "an set roti" are format luna gresit. Valoarea ar trebui sa fie An.Luna (Ex. 2020.21)
[bg][IDO 09.05.13: Bulgarian translation (2.1.5.0)]Полето "година на колела" е с грешен месечен формат. Стойност трябва да е Година.Месец (например 2020,01).
[hr][DBE 28.11.13: Croatian translation (2.2.0.8)]Polje " Wheel set year" ima krivi mjesčni format. Vrijednost bi trebala biti Godina.Mjesec (e.g.2020.01)
[sr][EVM 09.11.13: Remains in English]Field "Wheel set year" has wrong month format. Value should be Year.Month (e.g. 2020.01).
[ru][EDU 02.09.14: Russian translation (2.2.7.0)]Поле "Wheel set year"  имеет неправильный формат месяца. Значение должно быть Год.Месяц (например 2020.01).
[pl][EVM 28.11.13: Remains in English]Field "Wheel set year" has wrong month format. Value should be Year.Month (e.g. 2020.01).
[az][FKA 04.06.14: Azeri translation (2.2.7.0)]Çarxın istehsal ilində ay formatı yanlışdır. Göstərici İl,Ay  (məs. 2020.01) olmalıdır.
[tr][EVM 01.10.13: Remains in English (2.2.7.0)]Field "Wheel set year" has wrong month format. Value should be Year.Month (e.g. 2020.01).
[nl][EVM 11.09.15: Remains in English (2.5.x)]Field "Wheel set year" has wrong month format. Value should be Year.Month (e.g. 2020.01).
