wagondetail.error.createspecialorder.missingdefaultplant:
[de][EVM 02.07.12: German translation]Eisenbahn-Stammdaten sind unvollständig gepflegt. Bitte kontaktieren Sie einen System Administrator oder Helpdesk.
[en][EVM 03.05.12: English translation]Rail master data is incomplete. Please contact a system administrator or helpdesk.
[fr][LPR 02.07.12: French translation]Les données principales ferroviaires sont incomplètes. Veuillez contacter l'administrateur système.
[it][EVM 15.06.12: Italian translation]Dati base ferrovia è incompleta. PF contatti un amministratore di sistema o helpdesk.
[es][EVM 21.11.12: Spanish translation (2.1.0.5)]Datos maestros de ferrocarril incompletos. Por favor, contacte con el adminitrador del sistema o con el departamento técnico.
[cs][MNO 30.04.13: Czech translation (2.1.5.0)]Drážní kmenová data nejsou kompletní. Prosím kontaktujte administrátora nebi Helpdesk.
[sk][PPR 01.05.13: Slovak translation (2.1.5.0)]Kmeňové dáta železnice nekompletné. Prosím kontaktujte systémového administrátora, alebo helpdesk.
[hu][LKO 14.05.13: Hungarian translations (2.1.5.0)]Vasúti törzsadatok hiányosak. Lépjen kapcsolatba a rendszergazával, vagy az ügyfélszolgálattal.
[ro][CLU 29.04.13: Romanian translation (2.1.5.0)]Baza de date feroviara este incompleta. Va rugam contactati administratorul de sistem sau helpdesk.
[bg][IDO 09.05.13: Bulgarian translation (2.1.5.0)]ЖП основните данни са непълни. Моля, свържете се със системния администратор или хелпдеск.
[hr][DBE 28.11.13: Croatian translation (2.2.0.8)]Baza podataka željeznice je nepotpuna. Molimo kontaktirajte sistemskog administratora ili helpdesk.
[sr][EVM 09.11.13: Remains in English]Rail master data is incomplete. Please contact a system administrator or helpdesk.
[ru][EDU 02.09.14: Russian translation (2.2.7.0)]Неполная информация в мастер данных по жд. Пожалуйста, свяжитесь с системным администратором или службой технической поддержки
[pl][EVM 28.11.13: Remains in English]Rail master data is incomplete. Please contact a system administrator or helpdesk.
[az][FKA 04.06.14: Azeri translation (2.2.7.0)]Qatara dair əsas məlumatlar tam deyil. Xahiş olunur, sistem inzibatçısına və ya yardım bürosuna müraciət edin.
[tr][EVM 01.10.13: Remains in English (2.2.7.0)]Rail master data is incomplete. Please contact a system administrator or helpdesk.
[nl][EVM 11.09.15: Remains in English (2.5.x)]Rail master data is incomplete. Please contact a system administrator or helpdesk.
