warning.exceeded:
[de][EVM 27.08.12: German translation]Der Feldwert von "{0}" muss kleiner sein als  {1}.
[en][EVM 27.08.12: English translation]Field "{0}" value is too big, it must be less than {1}. Please correct it before saving.
[fr][JJF 27.08.12: French translation]La valeur du champ "{0}" est trop grande, elle doit être inférieure {1}. Veuillez corriger avant d'enregister.
[it][EVM 27.08.12: Italian translation]Valore campo "{0}" troppo grande, deve essere inferiore a {1}. PF correggiere prima di salvare.
[es][EVM 21.11.12: Spanish translation (2.1.0.5)]Valor del campo "{0}" demasiado largo, debe ser inferior a {1}. Por favor, corríjalo antes de guardar.
[cs][MNO 30.04.13: Czech translation (2.1.5.0)]Hodnota pole "{0}" je příliš vysoká, musí být nižší než {1}. Prosím opravte zadání před uložením.
[sk][PPR 01.05.13: Slovak translation (2.1.5.0)]Hodnota v poli "{0}" je príliš veľká, musí byť menšia ako {1}. Prosím opravte pred uložením.
[hu][LKO 14.05.13: Hungarian translations (2.1.5.0)]{0} mező mérete túl nagy, kisebbnek kell lenni mint {1}. Javítsa mentés előtt.
[ro][CLU 29.04.13: Romanian translation (2.1.5.0)]Valorile din campul "{0}" sunt prea mari. Va rugam corectati inainte de salvare. {1}
[bg][IDO 09.05.13: Bulgarian translation (2.1.5.0)]Полето "{0}" има твърде голяма стойност, трябва да е по-малка от  {1}. Моля, поправете я преди да запишете.
[hr][DBE 28.11.13: Croatian translation (2.2.0.8)]Vrijednost polja "{0}" je prevelika, mora biti manja od {1}.  Molimo ispravite prije spremanja.
[sr][EVM 09.11.13: Remains in English]Field "{0}" value is too big, it must be less than {1}. Please correct it before saving.
[ru][EDU 02.09.14: Russian translation (2.2.7.0)]Объем поля "{0}" слишком большой и должен быть включать в себя меньше чем {1} знаков. Пожалуйста, исправьте перед сохранением.
[pl][EVM 28.11.13: Remains in English]Field "{0}" value is too big, it must be less than {1}. Please correct it before saving.
[az][FKA 04.06.14: Azeri translation (2.2.7.0)]{0} qrafasında yer alan məlumatlar çoxdur, bu, {1}-dən az olmalıdır. Xahiş olunur, yaddaşda saxlamazdan əvvəl düzəliş edin.
[tr][EVM 01.10.13: Remains in English (2.2.7.0)]Field "{0}" value is too big, it must be less than {1}. Please correct it before saving.
