webbestellung.restrictionnotknown:
[de][CMA 18.11.15: German translation (2.6.1.2)]Der Auftrag konnte mit den eingegebenen Werten nicht angelegt werden. Bitte kontaktieren Sie unser Auftragsmanagement zur Klärung Ihrer Anfrage. Vielen Dank.
[en][EVM 11.09.15: English translation (2.5.x)]It is not possible to create the order according to the specified settings. Please contact your local support Hotline!
[fr][ARE 11.09.15: French translation (2.5.x)]Il n'est pas possible de créer la commande selon les indications. Veuillez contacter notre Hotline!
[it][MAL 11.09.15: Italian translation (2.5.x)]Non è possibile creare l'ordine in base alle impostazioni specificate. Si prega di contattare vostra assistenza locale!
[es][JUR 11.09.15: Spanish translation (2.5.x)]No es posible crear el pedido con los parámetros especificados. ¡Por favor, contacte con su línea de atención al cliente!
[cs][MNO 11.09.15: Czech translation (2.5.x)]Není možné vytvořit objednávku podle specifického zadání. Prosím kontaktujte CRH Hotline!
[sk][PPR 11.09.15: Slovak translation (2.5.x)]Nie je možné vytvoriť objednávku podľa zadaných nastavení. Prosím kontaktujte linku CRH!
[hu][VHE 11.09.15: Hungarian translation (2.5.x)]Információ: A megrendelés létrehozása hétvégére nem lehetséges. Kérjük lépjen kapcsolatba a fuvarszervező kollégánkkal hétvégi megrendelésével kapcsolatban. Köszönjük!
[ro][VUN 11.09.15: Romanian translation (2.5.x)]Nu este posibila crearea comenzii in concordanta cu setarile specificate. Va rugam contactati HelpDesk-ul local.
[bg][RTO 11.09.15: Bulgarian translation (2.5.x)]Не е възможно да се създаде заявка според определените настройки. Моля свържете се с местната гореща телефонна линия!
[hr][DBE 11.09.15: Croatian translation (2.5.x)]Nije moguće kreirati narudžbu prema određenim postavkama. Molimo kontaktirajte vaš HolcimHotline!
[sr][EVM 13.08.12: Remains in English (2.0.10.0)]It is not possible to create the order according to the specified settings. Please contact your Holcim Hotline!
[ru][EDU 13.08.12: Russian translation (2.0.10.0)]Невозможно создать заказ согласно установленным параметрам настройки. Пожалуйста, свяжитесь со службой горячей линии "LH"
[pl][EVM 13.08.12: Remains in English (2.0.10.0)]It is not possible to create the order according to the specified settings. Please contact your Holcim Hotline!
[az][FKA 11.09.15: Azeri translation (2.5.x)]Müəyyən edilmiş parametrlərə əsasən sifariş yaratmaq mümkün deyil. Xahiş olunur, Zavodun qaynar xəttinə müraciət edin!
[tr][EVM 13.08.12: Remains in English (2.0.10.0)]It is not possible to create the order according to the specified settings. Please contact your Holcim Hotline!
[nl][EVM 11.09.15: Remains in English (2.5.x)]It is not possible to create the order according to the specified settings. Please contact your local support Hotline!
webbestellung.columns.alt.firstitem:
[de][EVM 02.07.12: German translation]Die erste Position bestimmt die weiteren Materialien welche möglich sind.
[en][EVM 03.05.12: English translation]The first item defines what further materials can be ordered.
[fr][JJF 04.05.12: French translation]la premiere position definit les autres materiaux possibles.
[it][EVM 05.06.12: Italian translation]La prima posizione definisce quali altri articoli possono essere ordinati
[es][EVM 21.11.12: Spanish translation (2.1.0.5)]El primer artículo define qué materiales pueden ser pedidos después.
[cs][MNO 30.04.13: Czech translation (2.1.5.0)]První položka definuje jaké materiály se budou objednávat.
[sk][PPR 01.05.13: Slovak translation (2.1.5.0)]Prvá položka určuje aké materiály sa budú dať objednať.
[hu][LKO 14.05.13: Hungarian translations (2.1.5.0)]Az első tétel határozza meg, hogy milyen további anyagokat leget rendelni
[ro][CLU 29.04.13: Romanian translation (2.1.5.0)]Primul articol defineste care materiale ulterioare pot fi comandate
[bg][IDO 09.05.13: Bulgarian translation (2.1.5.0)]Първият елемент определя какви допълнителни материали може да се поръчат.
[hr][DBE 28.11.13: Croatian translation (2.2.0.8)]Prva stavka definira koji daljnji materijali mogu biti naručeni.
[sr][EVM 09.11.13: Remains in English]The first item defines what further materials can be ordered.
[ru][EDU 02.09.14: Russian translation (2.2.7.0)]Первый пункт определяет возможность дальнейшего выбора в заказе.
[pl][EVM 28.11.13: Remains in English]The first item defines what further materials can be ordered.
[az][FKA 04.06.14: Azeri translation (2.2.7.0)]İlk bənddə sifariş oluna biləcək materiallar göstərilir.
[tr][EVM 01.10.13: Remains in English (2.2.7.0)]The first item defines what further materials can be ordered.
[nl][ARE 11.09.15: Dutch translation (2.5.x)]Het eerste item bepaald welke materialen er verder kunnen besteld worden
webbestellung.columns.alt.pickuptype:
[de][AdN 01.01.12: German translation (2.0.0.8)]Wählen Sie Abholung im Fall keine Lieferung erforderlich ist, und die Gegenstände können von der Versandstelle abgeholt werden.
[en][EVM 03.05.12: English translation]Select pickup in case no delivery is needed, and the items can be picked up from the shipping point.
[fr][JJF 04.05.12: French translation]Selectionner enlèvement si aucune livraison est necessaire et le matériel peut être enlevé auprès du point de chargement.
[it][EVM 17.05.12: Italian translation]In caso di mancata consegna, seleziona f.partenza, si potrà così ritirare direttamente.
[es][EVM 21.11.12: Spanish translation (2.1.0.5)]Elija Pick-up en caso de no ser necesaria la entrega, y los artículos puedan ser recogidos en el Punto de Expedición.
[cs][MNO 30.04.13: Czech translation (2.1.5.0)]Vyberte místo vyzvednutí v případě, že není potřebná dodávka a položky mohou být vyzvednuty v místě nakládky.
[sk][PPR 01.05.13: Slovak translation (2.1.5.0)]Vyberte miesto vyzdvihnutia v prípade ak nie je potrebné doručenie a položky môžu byť vyzdvihnuté z prepravného miesta.
[hu][LKO 14.05.13: Hungarian translations (2.1.5.0)]Ennél a rakodásnál nem szükséges szállíátst választani, az eszközöket fel tudja venni a szállítási pontnál.
[ro][CLU 29.04.13: Romanian translation (2.1.5.0)]Selectati Pick-up in cazul in care nu este necesara livrarea, iar articolele pot fi ridicate de la Punctul de Expeditie
[bg][IDO 09.05.13: Bulgarian translation (2.1.5.0)]Изберете взимане,  в случай че не е необходима доставка и Обект/Дестинацияите могат да се съберат от крайните точка на доставка.
[hr][DBE 28.11.13: Croatian translation (2.2.0.8)]Odaberite preuzimam u slučaju da nije potrebna dostava, i stavke mogu biti preuzete sa mjesta isporuke.
[sr][EVM 09.11.13: Remains in English]Select pickup in case no delivery is needed, and the items can be picked up from the shipping point.
[ru][EDU 02.09.14: Russian translation (2.2.7.0)]Выберите самовывоз в случае, если доставка не нужна и заказ будет выполнен своим транспортом с места отгрузки.
[pl][EVM 28.11.13: Remains in English]Select pickup in case no delivery is needed, and the items can be picked up from the shipping point.
[az][FKA 04.06.14: Azeri translation (2.2.7.0)]Heç bir təslimə ehtiyac yoxdursa, təhvil alma seçilir.
[tr][EVM 01.10.13: Remains in English (2.2.7.0)]Select pickup in case no delivery is needed, and the items can be picked up from the shipping point.
[nl][ARE 11.09.15: Dutch translation (2.5.x)]Kies afhaling indien levering niet nodig is
