[sk][PPR 01.05.13: Slovak translation (2.1.5.0)]Dodávka zadarmo je možná len v prípade ak príjemca faktúry je ten istý ako zadávateľ objednávky!
[hu][LKO 14.05.13: Hungarian translations (2.1.5.0)]Ingyenes szállítás csak akkor lehetséges, ha a Bill to partner ugyan az mint a Sold to partner!
[ro][CLU 29.04.13: Romanian translation (2.1.5.0)]Livrarea gratuita este posibila numai in cazul in care Factura partener este aceasi cu Vandut partener
[bg][IDO 09.05.13: Bulgarian translation (2.1.5.0)]Безплатна доставка е възможна само в случай, че "Получател фактура" съвпада с "Клиент"!
[hr][DBE 28.11.13: Croatian translation (2.2.0.8)]Dostava donacije je moguća samo u slučaju kad je primatelj isti kao i kupac!
[sr][EVM 09.11.13: Remains in English]Free of charge delivery is only possible in case the Bill to partner is the same as Sold to partner!
[ru][EDU 02.09.14: Russian translation (2.2.7.0)]Бесплатная доставка возможна в случае, если получатель счета является так же плательщиком
[pl][EVM 28.11.13: Remains in English]Free of charge delivery is only possible in case the Bill to partner is the same as Sold to partner!
[az][FKA 04.06.14: Azeri translation (2.2.7.0)]Pulsuz təslim ancaq o zaman  mümkündür ki, faktura üzrə tərəfdaş satış üzrə tərəfdaşla eyni olsun!
