webbestellung.error.rail.earliest.too.late:
[de][EVM 02.07.12: German translation]Die früheste Zugsankunftzeit liegt hinter dem spätestens Lieferdatum. Rechtzeitige Lieferung nicht möglich.
[en][EVM 03.05.12: English translation]The earliest train arrival from the shipping-point to the ship-to is after the delivery-to date
[fr][LPR 02.07.12: French translation]La première arrivée  train au départ du lieu d'expédition arrivé à destination est plus tard que la date de livraison.
[it][EVM 17.05.12: Italian translation]Il primo treno che arriva è gia in ritardo alla data di consegna prevista.
[es][EVM 21.11.12: Spanish translation (2.1.0.5)]La fecha más temprana de llegada del tren desde el Punto de Expedición al destinatario es posterior a la fecha de entrega hasta.
[cs][MNO 30.04.13: Czech translation (2.1.5.0)]Nejbližší příjezd vlaku je až po termínu dodávky.
[sk][PPR 01.05.13: Slovak translation (2.1.5.0)]Najbližší príchod vlaku na vykládku je po dátume dodávky.
[hu][LKO 14.05.13: Hungarian translations (2.1.5.0)]A legkorábbi vonat érkezése a rakodási helyről a ship-to későbbi mint a delivery-to dátum.
[ro][CLU 29.04.13: Romanian translation (2.1.5.0)]Urmatoarea posibila sosire a trenului de la Punct de Expeditie la Destinatar este ulterioara datei livrare pana la
[bg][IDO 09.05.13: Bulgarian translation (2.1.5.0)]Най-ранното пристигането на влак от мястото на доставка до Обект/Дестинацияа е след датата на доставка.
[hr][DBE 28.11.13: Croatian translation (2.2.0.8)]Najraniji dolazak vlaka od mjesta isporuke do odredišta je nakon datuma isporuke na
[sr][EVM 09.11.13: Remains in English]The earliest train arrival from the shipping-point to the ship-to is after the delivery-to date
[ru][EDU 02.09.14: Russian translation (2.2.7.0)]Самое раннее прибытие поезда с пункта отгрузки до грузополучателя после даты "доставка к"
[pl][EVM 28.11.13: Remains in English]The earliest train arrival from the shipping-point to the ship-to is after the delivery-to date
[az][FKA 05.09.14: Azeri translation (2.2.7.0)]Göndəriş məntəqəsindən Göndəriş ünvanına qatarın ən tez gəlib çatması tarixinə təslimdən sonra baş verməlidir
[tr][EVM 01.10.13: Remains in English (2.2.7.0)]The earliest train arrival from the shipping-point to the ship-to is after the delivery-to date
[nl][ARE 11.09.15: Dutch translation (2.5.x)]De eerstvolgende trein vanuit het shipping-point naar de ship-to komt later toe dan de gevraagde leveringsdatum
webbestellung.error.railordernotpossibledelto:
[de][CMA 13.08.12: German translation (2.0.10.0)]Ihre Bestellung kann für das ausgewählte Lieferdatum nicht automatisch angelegt werden. Bitte passen Sie das Lieferdatum an oder kontaktieren Sie unser Auftragsmanagement!
[en][EVM 11.09.15: English translation (2.5.x)]Not possible to create automatically the order for the selected delivery to date. Please contact your local support Hotline!
[fr][MLA 13.08.12: French translation (2.0.10.0)]Votre commande ne peut être créée automatiquement pour la date selectionnée. Veuillez ajuster la date de livraison ou contacter notre centre logistique.
[it][MAL 11.09.15: Italian translation (2.5.x)]Non è possibile creare automaticamente l'ordine per la data di consegna selezionata. Si prega di contattare la Linea Diretta della vostra assistenza locale!
[es][JUR 11.09.15: Spanish translation (2.5.x)]Imposible crear el pedido automáticamente para la fecha de entrega hasta (eliminar "hasta") seleccionada. ¡Por favor, ajuste (sustituir "ajuste" por "corrija") la fecha o contacte con su línea de atención al cliente!
[cs][MNO 11.09.15: Czech translation (2.5.x)]Není možné založit objednávku pro tento typ materiálu, protože část dat chybí. Prosím kontaktujte CRH Hotline!
[sk][PPR 11.09.15: Slovak translation (2.5.x)]Nie je možné automaticky vytvoriť objednávku pre vybraný dátum dodávky. Prosím kontaktujte linku CRH!
[hu][VHE 11.09.15: Hungarian translation (2.5.x)]Nem lehetséges a megrendelés automatikus létrehozása a kiválasztott szállítási dátumra. Kérjük lépjen kapcsolatba kollégánkkal!
[ro][VUN 11.09.15: Romanian translation (2.5.x)]Nu se poate plasa comanda automat pentru data de livrare specificata. Va rugam sa contactati responsabilul local.
[bg][RTO 11.09.15: Bulgarian translation (2.5.x)]Не е възможно да се създаде автоматично заявка за избраната доставка до дата. Моля свържете се с местната гореща телефонна линия!
[hr][DBE 11.09.15: Croatian translation (2.5.x)]Nije moguće automatski kreirati narudžbu za odabrane datume dostave. Molio kontaktirajte Holcim Hotline!
[sr][EVM 13.08.12: Remains in English (2.0.10.0)]Not possible to create automatically the order for the selected delivery to date. Please contact your Holcim Hotline!
[ru][EDU 13.08.12: Russian translation (2.0.10.0)]Невозможно автоматически создать заказ для выбранной поставки. Пожалуйста, свяжитесь со службой горячей линии "LH"
[pl][EVM 13.08.12: Remains in English (2.0.10.0)]Not possible to create automatically the order for the selected delivery to date. Please contact your Holcim Hotline!
[az][FKA 11.09.15: Azeri translation (2.5.x)]Seçilmiş təslim üçün avtomatik sifariş yaratmaq mümkün deyil. Xahiş olunur, Zavodun qaynar xəttinə müraciət edin!
[tr][EVM 13.08.12: Remains in English (2.0.10.0)]Not possible to create automatically the order for the selected delivery to date. Please contact your Holcim Hotline!
[nl][EVM 11.09.15: Remains in English (2.5.x)]Not possible to create automatically the order for the selected delivery to date. Please contact your local support Hotline!
webbestellung.error.invalid.distance:
[de][CMA 18.11.15: German translation (2.6.1.2)]Der Auftrag kann leider nicht angelegt werden, da noch nicht alle Hintergrunddaten gepflegt sind. Bitte kontaktieren Sie unser Auftragsmanagement!
[en][EVM 11.09.15: English translation (2.5.x)]Unfortunately the order could not be created as some background data is missing, please contact your local support Hotline!
[fr][MLA 13.08.12: French translation (2.0.10.0)]Impossible de créer la commande car la distance du transport n'a pu etre définie. Veuillez contacter notre Hotline!
[it][MAL 11.09.15: Italian translation (2.5.x)]Sfortunatamente l'ordine non può essere creato a causa di alcuni dati mancanti. Si prega di contattare la Linea Diretta della vostra assistenza locale!
[es][JUR 11.09.15: Spanish translation (2.5.x)]No se pudo crear el pedido por falta de configuración en el sistema. ¡Por favor, contacte con su línea de atención al cliente!
[cs][MNO 11.09.15: Czech translation (2.5.x)]Objednávka nemůže být bohužel vytvořena z důvodu chybějících dat, prosím kontaktujte CRH Hotline!
[sk][PPR 11.09.15: Slovak translation (2.5.x)]Objednávka sa žiaľ nedá vytvoriť nakoľko chýbajú nejaké základné údaje, prosím kontaktujte linku CRH!
[hu][VHE 11.09.15: Hungarian translation (2.5.x)]Sajnos a megrendelést nem lehet létrehozni, néhány háttérbeállítás hiányzik. Kérjük lépjen kapcsolatba kollégánkkal!
[ro][VUN 11.09.15: Romanian translation (2.5.x)]Nu este posibila crearea unei comenzi pentru acest material deoarece lipsesc informatii. Va rugam sa contactati responsabilul local.
[bg][RTO 11.09.15: Bulgarian translation (2.5.x)]За съжаление заявката не може да бъде създадена, тъй като някои необходими данни липсват. Моля свържете се с местната гореща телефонна линия!
[hr][DBE 11.09.15: Croatian translation (2.5.x)]Nažalost narudžbu nije moguće kreirati jer nedostaju neki pozadincki podaci, molimo kontaktirajte Holcim Hotline!
[sr][EVM 13.08.12: Remains in English (2.0.10.0)]Unfortunately the order could not be created as some background data is missing, please contact your Holcim Hotline!
[ru][EDU 13.08.12: Russian translation (2.0.10.0)]К сожалению заказ не может быть создан из-за отсутствия некоторых исходных данных. Пожалуйста, свяжитесь со службой горячей линии "LH"
[pl][EVM 13.08.12: Remains in English (2.0.10.0)]Unfortunately the order could not be created as some background data is missing, please contact your Holcim Hotline!
[az][FKA 11.09.15: Azeri translation (2.5.x)]Təəssüf ki, bəzi ümumi məlumatlar olmadığından, sifarişi yaratmaq mümkün deyil. Xahiş olunur, Zavodun qaynar xəttinə müraciət edin!
[tr][EVM 13.08.12: Remains in English (2.0.10.0)]Unfortunately the order could not be created as some background data is missing, please contact your Holcim Hotline!
[nl][EVM 11.09.15: Remains in English (2.5.x)]Unfortunately the order could not be created as some background data is missing, please contact your local support Hotline!
webbestellung.error.invalid.duration:
[de][EVM 02.07.12: German translation]Transportzeit für Versandstelle und Lieferort konnte nicht ermittelt werden .
[en][EVM 03.05.12: English translation]Unable to calculate transport duration. Please check the coordinates of the Ship-to and the selected Shipping Point
[fr][LPR 02.07.12: French translation]Impossible de calculer le temps de transport. Veuillez vérifier les coordonnées de la destination et le lieu de livraison prévu (carte de disposition)
[it][EVM 22.05.12: Italian translation]Durata tragitto non calcolabile. Controllare coordinate Punto di spedizione fino al Destinatario su scheda disposizione
[es][EVM 21.11.12: Spanish translation (2.1.0.5)]Imposible calcular la duración del transporte. Por favor, revise las coordenadas del destinatario y del Punto de Expedición seleccionado.
[cs][MNO 30.04.13: Czech translation (2.1.5.0)]Není možné spočítat dobu trvání přepravy. Prosím prověřte souřadnice tohoto příjemce mat. a zvoleného místa nakládky
[sk][PPR 01.05.13: Slovak translation (2.1.5.0)]Nepodarilo sa vypočítať čas prepravy. Prosím skontrolujte koordináty miesta nakládky a miesta dodávky.
[hu][LKO 14.05.13: Hungarian translations (2.1.5.0)]Nem lehet kiszámítani a szállítás idejét. Ellenőrizze a Ship-to, és a kiválasztott felrakó koordinátáit.
[ro][CLU 29.04.13: Romanian translation (2.1.5.0)]Nu se poate calcula durata transport. Va rugam sa verificati coordonate Destinatar si Punct de Expeditie selectat.
[bg][IDO 09.05.13: Bulgarian translation (2.1.5.0)]Не може да се изчисли продължителността на  транспорта. Моля, проверете на координатите наполучателя и избраната точка за Доставка
[hr][DBE 28.11.13: Croatian translation (2.2.0.8)]Nije moguće izračunati vrijeme trajanja prijevoza. Molimo provjerite koordinate odredišta i odabranog mjesta isporuke
[sr][EVM 09.11.13: Remains in English]Unable to calculate transport duration. Please check the coordinates of the Ship-to and the selected Shipping Point
[ru][EDU 02.09.14: Russian translation (2.2.7.0)]Невозможно расчитать продолжительность доставки. Пожалуйста, проверьте координаты грузополучателя и выбранного пункта отгрузки.
[pl][EVM 28.11.13: Remains in English]Unable to calculate transport duration. Please check the coordinates of the Ship-to and the selected Shipping Point
[az][FKA 04.06.14: Azeri translation (2.2.7.0)]Daşıma müddətini hesablamaq mümkün deyil. Xahiş olunur, Göndəriş ünvanının və seçilmiş Göndəriş məntəqəsinin koordinatlarını yoxlayın
[tr][EVM 01.10.13: Remains in English (2.2.7.0)]Unable to calculate transport duration. Please check the coordinates of the Ship-to and the selected Shipping Point
[nl][ARE 11.09.15: Dutch translation (2.5.x)]Onmogelijk om de duur van het transport te berekenen. gelieve de coordinaten van het shipping-point en de ship-to te controleren.
