webbestellung.error.leadtimeForWebdelivery:
[de][CMA 18.11.15: German translation (2.6.1.2)]Ihr Lieferant benötigt einige bestimmte Vorlaufzeit um ihre Bestellung zu bearbeiten. Das früheste Auslieferungsdatum und Zeit ist am: {0} um {1}. In dringenden Fällen kontaktieren Sie bitte unsere Logistikabteilung um die Möglichkeit einer früheren Auslieferung abzuklären.
[en][EVM 11.09.15: English translation (2.5.x)]Your Supplying Company needs a certain lead time to handle your order. The earliest date/time for delivery is: {0} on {1}. In urgent cases please contact our logistics department to check for an earlier delivery.
[fr][ARE 11.09.15: French translation (2.5.x)]Un certain délai est nécessaire afin de traiter votre commande. La premiere livraison possible est le ( date/heure) : {0} sur {1}. En cas d'urgence veuillez contacter notre département logistique afin d'organiser une livraison plus rapide.
[it][MAL 11.09.15: Italian translation (2.5.x)]La vostra società fornitrice ha bisogno di un certo tempo di esecuzione per gestire il vostro ordine. La prima data/ora per la consegna è: {0} di {1}. In caso di urgenza si prega di contattare il nostro ufficio logistica per verificare una consegna più rapida.
[es][JUR 11.09.15: Spanish translation (2.5.x)]Holcim (sustituir "Holcim" por "La compañia de suministro") necesita un cierto margen de tiempo para procesar su pedido. La fecha/hora más temprana para el envío es: {0} el {1}. En casos de envíos urgentes, por favor, contacte con nuestro departamento de logística para verificar la viabilidad de una entrega más temprana.
[cs][MNO 11.09.15: Czech translation (2.5.x)]CRH potřebuje více času na organizaci Vaší objednávky. Nejbližší možný Datum/Čas pro dodávku je {0} v {1}. V případě urgentních případů prosím kontaktujte logistické oddělení pro dřívější dodání.
[sk][PPR 11.09.15: Slovak translation (2.5.x)]CRH potrebuje určitý čas na realizáciu Vašej objednávky. Najskorší dátum/čas dodávky je: {0} z {1}. V súrnych prípadoch kontaktujte oddelenie logistiky pre skoršiu dodávku.
[hu][VHE 11.09.15: Hungarian translation (2.5.x)]CRH Magyarország Kft-nek szüksége van egy rövid átmeneti időre a megrendelésének feldolgozásához. A legkorábbi lehetséges rendelési időpont: {0} {1}. Sürgős megrendelés esetén kérem lépjen kapcsolatba fuvarszervező kollégánkkal!
[ro][VUN 11.09.15: Romanian translation (2.5.x)]Furnizorul are nevoie de o marja de timp pentru a procesa comanda dumneavoastra. Cea mai devereme livrare se poate face la ora {0} ziua {1}. Pentru cazuri urgente, va rugam sa contactati Dispeceratul local.
[bg][RTO 11.09.15: Bulgarian translation (2.5.x)]Доставчикът се нуждае от определено време да обработи вашата поръчка. Най-ранната дата / час за доставка е: {0} от {1}. При спешни случаи, моля, свържете се с нашия отдел логистика, за да проверите за по-ранна доставка.
[hr][DBE 11.09.15: Croatian translation (2.5.x)]Holcim treba određeno vrijeme kako bi obradio vašu narudžbu. Najraniji datum/vrijeme za dostavu je: {0} na {1}.
[sr][EVM 13.08.12: Remains in English (2.0.10.0)]Holcim needs a certain lead time to handle your order. The earliest date/time for delivery is: {0} on {1}. In urgent cases please contact our logistics department to check for an earlier delivery.
[ru][EDU 13.08.12: Russian translation (2.0.10.0)]Необходимо точное время для выполнения заказа. Самая ранняя дата/время доставки с {0} по {1}. В случае срочной доставки, свяжитесь со службой логистики для уточнения возможных дат/времени.
[pl][EVM 13.08.12: Remains in English (2.0.10.0)]Holcim needs a certain lead time to handle your order. The earliest date/time for delivery is: {0} on {1}. In urgent cases please contact our logistics department to check for an earlier delivery.
[az][FKA 11.09.15: Azeri translation (2.5.x)]Zavod tərəfindən sizin sifarişinizin yerinə yetirilməsi üçün müəyyən vaxt lazımdır. Ən tez təslim tarixi/vaxtı : {0} {1}. Təcili hallarda erkən təslim üçün xahiş olunur, logistika departamentinə müraciət edin.
[tr][EVM 13.08.12: Remains in English (2.0.10.0)]Holcim needs a certain lead time to handle your order. The earliest date/time for delivery is: {0} on {1}. In urgent cases please contact our logistics department to check for an earlier delivery.
[nl][EVM 11.09.15: Remains in English (2.5.x)]Your Supplying Company needs a certain lead time to handle your order. The earliest date/time for delivery is: {0} on {1}. In urgent cases please contact our logistics department to check for an earlier delivery.
webbestellung.error.material.not.available.in.salesarea:
[de][CMA 26.06.15: German translation (2.4.0)]Nicht alle zur Kundenauftrag hinzugefügten Materialien sind im Verkaufsbereich '{0}' verfügbar! Es ist nicht möglich, den Kundenauftrag zu speichern.
[en][AdN 24.06.15: English translation (2.4.0)]Not all materials added to the customer order are available in the sales area '{0}'! Not possible to save the customer order.
[fr][ARE 26.06.15: French translation (2.4.0)]Certains articles ajoutés à la commande du clients ne sont pas disponnibles pour la région de vente '{0}'! Impossible de sauvegarder la commande client.
[it][MAL 26.06.15: Italian translation (2.4.0)]Non tutti i materiali aggiunti all'ordine del cliente sono disponibili nella sales area '{0}'! Non è possibile salvare l'ordine del cliente
[es][EVM 26.06.15: Spanish translation (2.4.0)]¡No todos los materiales añadidos al Pedido Cliente están disponibles en el Área de Ventas '{0}'! No es posible crear el Pedido Cliente.
[cs][EVM 26.06.15: Remains in English (2.4.0)]Not all materials added to the customer order are available in the sales area '{0}'! Not possible to save the customer order.
[sk][PPR 26.06.15: Slovak translation (2.4.0)]Nie všetky druhy materiálu v zákazníckej objednávke sú k dispozícii pre oblasť predaja '{0}'! Nie je možné uložiť zákaznícku objednávku.
[hu][VHE 26.06.15: Hungarian translation (2.4.0)]Nem minden anyag elérhető a vevő értékesítési körzetében '{0}'! Nem lehetséges a megrendelés mentése.
[ro][VUN 26.06.15: Romanian translation (2.4.0)]Nu este posibila salvarea comenzii. Materialele selectate nu sunt disponibile pe Arie Vanzari.
[bg][RTO 26.06.15: Bulgarian translation (2.4.0)]Не всички материали добавени на клиента са налични за този регион '{0}'!Не е възможно поръчката да бъде запазена.
[hr][DBE 26.06.15: Croatian translation (2.4.0)]Svi materijali dodani narudžbi kupca nisu dostupni prodajnom području '{0}'! Nije moguće spremiti narudžbu kupca.
[sr][EVM 26.06.15: Remains in English (2.4.0)]Not all materials added to the customer order are available in the sales area '{0}'! Not possible to save the customer order.
[ru][EDU 26.06.15: Russian translation (2.4.0)]Не все материалы, добавленные заказ Клиента, доступны для области продаж '{0}'! Невозможно сохранить заказ Клиента.
[pl][EVM 26.06.15: Remains in English (2.4.0)]Not all materials added to the customer order are available in the sales area '{0}'! Not possible to save the customer order.
[az][FKA 26.06.15: Azeri translation (2.4.0)]Not all materials added to the customer order are available in the sales area '{0}'! Not possible to save the customer order.
[tr][EVM 26.06.15: Remains in English (2.4.0)]Not all materials added to the customer order are available in the sales area '{0}'! Not possible to save the customer order.
[nl][EVM 11.09.15: Remains in English (2.5.x)]Not all materials added to the customer order are available in the sales area '{0}'! Not possible to save the customer order.
webbestellung.error.missing.shippingpoint:
[de][CMA 18.11.15: German translation (2.6.1.2)]Es ist nicht möglich den Auftrag für dieses Material anzulegen (Packstücktyp des Materials nicht definiert). Bitte kontaktieren Sie unser Auftragsmanagement!
[en][EVM 11.09.15: English translation (2.5.x)]Not possible to create order for this material, as some background data is missing. Please contact your local support Hotline!
[fr][ARE 11.09.15: French translation (2.5.x)]Impossible de créer une commande pour ce matériel. Veuillez contacter notre Hotline
[it][MAL 11.09.15: Italian translation (2.5.x)]Non è possibile creare l'ordine per questo materiale a causa di alcuni dati mancanti. Si prega di contattare la Linea Diretta della vostra assistenza locale!
[es][JUR 11.09.15: Spanish translation (2.5.x)]Imposible crear un pedido para este material por falta de configuración en el sistema (Punto de Expedición no definido). ¡Por favor, contacte con su línea de atención al cliente!
[cs][MNO 11.09.15: Czech translation (2.5.x)]Není možné založit objednávku pro tento typ materiálu, protože část dat chybí. Prosím kontaktujte CRH Hotline!
[sk][PPR 11.09.15: Slovak translation (2.5.x)]Nie je možné vytvoriť objednávku pre tento materiál, nakoľko chýbajú nejaké základné údaje. Prosím kontaktujte linku CRH!
[hu][VHE 11.09.15: Hungarian translation (2.5.x)]Nem lehetséges megrendelés létrehozása erre a termékre. Kérjük lépjen kapcsolatba kollégánkkal.
[ro][VUN 11.09.15: Romanian translation (2.5.x)]Nu este posibila crearea unei comenzi pentru acest material deoarece lipsesc informatii. Va rugam sa contactati responsabilul local.
[bg][RTO 11.09.15: Bulgarian translation (2.5.x)]Не е възможно да се създаде заявка за този материал, тъй като някои необходими данните липсват. Моля свържете се с местната гореща телефонна линия!
[hr][DBE 13.08.12: Croatian translation (2.0.10.0)]Nije moguće kreirati ponudu za ovaj materijal, jer neki pozadnski podaci nedostaju.
[sr][EVM 13.08.12: Remains in English (2.0.10.0)]Not possible to create order for this material, as some background data is missing. Please contact your Holcim Hotline!
[ru][EDU 13.08.12: Russian translation (2.0.10.0)]Невозможно создать заказ для данного материала из-за отсутствия некоторых исходных данных. Пожалуйста, свяжитесь со службой горячей линии "Холсим"
[pl][EVM 13.08.12: Remains in English (2.0.10.0)]Not possible to create order for this material, as some background data is missing. Please contact your Holcim Hotline!
[az][FKA 11.09.15: Azeri translation (2.5.x)]Bəzi ümumi məlumatlar olmadığından, bu material üçün sifarişi yaratmaq mümkün deyil. Xahiş olunur, Zavodun qaynar xəttinə müraciət edin!
[tr][EVM 13.08.12: Remains in English (2.0.10.0)]Not possible to create order for this material, as some background data is missing. Please contact your Holcim Hotline!
[nl][EVM 11.09.15: Remains in English (2.5.x)]Not possible to create order for this material, as some background data is missing. Please contact your local support Hotline!
webbestellung.error.multiorder.with.service:
[de][NHI 22.08.12: German translation (2.0.0.8)]Es kann keine Bestellung mit einem Service erstellt werden, wenn erwartet wird, dass mehr als eine Bestellung erstellt werden wird.
[en][EVM 03.05.12: English translation (2.0.0.8)]Cannot create order with service(s) if more than one order is supposed to be created.
[fr][LPR 02.07.12: French translation]Impossible de créer commande avec service(s) si plus d'une commande est supposée être créée.
[it][EVM 06.06.12: Italian translation]Non è possibile creare un ordine con solo servizio(i) se più di un ordine dovrebbe essere creato.
[es][EVM 21.11.12: Spanish translation (2.1.0.5)]Imposible crear pedido con servicio(s) si supuestamente más de un pedido va a ser creado.
[cs][MNO 30.04.13: Czech translation (2.1.5.0)]Není možné založit objednávku se servisním materiálem, pokud se předpokládá vytvoření více než jedné objednávky.
[sk][PPR 01.05.13: Slovak translation (2.1.5.0)]Nedá sa vytvoriť servisná objednávka(y) ak sa má vytvoriť viac ako jedná objednávka.
[hu][LKO 14.05.13: Hungarian translations (2.1.5.0)]Nem lehet létrehozni a rendelést szolgáltatással(okkal) ha több mint egy rendelést hoz létre.
[ro][CLU 29.04.13: Romanian translation (2.1.5.0)]Nu se poate crea o comanda cu serviciu(ile) daca mai mult de o comanda se presupune ca ar trebui create
[bg][IDO 09.05.13: Bulgarian translation (2.1.5.0)]Не може да се създаде заявка с услуга (и), ако повече от една поръчка е трябвало да бъде създадена.
[hr][DBE 28.11.13: Croatian translation (2.2.0.8)]Nije moguće kreirati ponudu sa uslugom/uslugama ako se namjerava kreirati više od jedne ponude.
[sr][EVM 09.11.13: Remains in English]Cannot create order with service(s) if more than one order is supposed to be created.
[ru][EDU 02.09.14: Russian translation (2.2.7.0)]Невозможно создать заказ для услуг, если требуется создание больше одного заказа.
[pl][EVM 28.11.13: Remains in English]Cannot create order with service(s) if more than one order is supposed to be created.
[az][FKA 04.06.14: Azeri translation (2.2.7.0)]Bir neçə sifarişin yaradılacağı nəzərdə tutulursa, xidmət sifarişi yaratmaq mümkün deyil.
[tr][EVM 01.10.13: Remains in English (2.2.7.0)]Cannot create order with service(s) if more than one order is supposed to be created.
[nl][ARE 11.09.15: Dutch translation (2.5.x)]Onmogelijk een bestelling met 'service items' aan te maken indien meerdere bestellingen moeten worden aangemaakt
