[hr][DBE 11.09.15: Croatian translation (2.5.x)]Nije moguće odrediti datum dostave. Molimo kontaktirajte vaš Holcim Hotline!
[sr][EVM 13.08.12: Remains in English (2.0.10.0)]Not possible to determine delivery date. Please contact your Holcim Hotline!
[ru][EDU 13.08.12: Russian translation (2.0.10.0)]Невозможно определить дату доставки. Пожалуйста, свяжитесь со службой горячей линии "LH".
[pl][EVM 13.08.12: Remains in English (2.0.10.0)]Not possible to determine delivery date. Please contact your Holcim Hotline!
