[hr][DBE 28.11.13: Croatian translation (2.2.0.8)]Mjesto utovara odabranog materijala se ne poklapa sa mjestom utovara prve stavke na narudžbi.
[sr][EVM 09.11.13: Remains in English]The shipping point of the selected material is not corresponding to the shipping point of the first order item.
[ru][EDU 02.09.14: Russian translation (2.2.7.0)]Место погрузки выбранного материала не соответствует месту погрузки в заказе
[pl][EVM 28.11.13: Remains in English]The shipping point of the selected material is not corresponding to the shipping point of the first order item.
[az][FKA 04.06.14: Azeri translation (2.2.7.0)]Seçilmiş materialın Göndəriş məntəqəsi sifarişin ilk bəndinin  Göndəriş məntəqəsinə uyğun gəlmir.
[tr][EVM 01.10.13: Remains in English (2.2.7.0)]The shipping point of the selected material is not corresponding to the shipping point of the first order item.
[nl][ARE 11.09.15: Dutch translation (2.5.x)]Het expeditiepunt voor alle items van het order dient identiek te zijn
webbestellung.error.alreadyselected:
[de][EVM 02.07.12: German translation]Das gewählte Material existiert bereits als Auftragsposition. Bitte direkt Auftragsposition anpassen.
[en][EVM 03.05.12: English translation]The selected material is already added to the order. Please adjust the ordered quantity in case you want to order more!
[fr][JJF 04.05.12: French translation]le materiel selectionne existe deja comme position de commande. Veuillez changer directement la position de commande.
[it][EVM 05.06.12: Italian translation]L'articolo è gia presente nell'ordine, correggi la quantità se ne vuoi di più.
[es][EVM 21.11.12: Spanish translation (2.1.0.5)]El material seleccionado ya ha sido añadido al pedido. Por favor, ajuste la cantidad si lo que quiere es pedir más.
[cs][MNO 30.04.13: Czech translation (2.1.5.0)]Zvolený materiál byl již do objednávky přidán. Prosím změňte množství, pokud chcete objednat více.
[sk][PPR 01.05.13: Slovak translation (2.1.5.0)]Vybraný materiál už je pridaný k objednávke. Prosím upravte objednané množstvo ak chcete objednať viac!
[hu][LKO 14.05.13: Hungarian translations (2.1.5.0)]A kiválasztott anyag már szerepel a megrendelésben. Ha szeretne többet rendelni, akkor módosítsa a rendelt mennyiséget.
[ro][CLU 29.04.13: Romanian translation (2.1.5.0)]Materialul selectat este deja adaugat comenzii. Va rugam sa modificati cantitatea comandata in cazul in care doriti sa comandati mai mult!
[bg][IDO 09.05.13: Bulgarian translation (2.1.5.0)]Избраният материал е вече добавен към поръчката. Моля коригирайте поръчаното количество в случай, че желаете да поръчате повече!
[hr][DBE 28.11.13: Croatian translation (2.2.0.8)]Odabrani materijal je već dodan u narudžbu. Molimo prilagodite naručenu količinu u slučaju da želite naručiti više!
[sr][EVM 09.11.13: Remains in English]The selected material is already added to the order. Please adjust the ordered quantity in case you want to order more!
[ru][EDU 02.09.14: Russian translation (2.2.7.0)]Выбранный материал уже добавлен в заказ. Пожалуйста, подтвердите установленное количество в заказе
[pl][EVM 28.11.13: Remains in English]The selected material is already added to the order. Please adjust the ordered quantity in case you want to order more!
[az][FKA 04.06.14: Azeri translation (2.2.7.0)]Seçilmiş material artıq sifarişə əlavə edilib. Xahiş olunur, daha çox sifariş etmək istəyirsinizsə, sifariş miqdarını təzələyin!
[tr][EVM 01.10.13: Remains in English (2.2.7.0)]The selected material is already added to the order. Please adjust the ordered quantity in case you want to order more!
[nl][ARE 11.09.15: Dutch translation (2.5.x)]Het geselecteerde materiaal is reeds toegevoegd aan het order. Gelieve de hoeveelheid aan te passen indien u meer wenst
webbestellung.error.quantity.restriction:
[de][CMA 18.11.15: German translation (2.6.1.2)]Die verfügbare Menge ({0}) ist geringer als die bestellte für '{1}'. Bitte die Bestellmenge reduzieren oder Kontakt mit unserem Auftragscenter aufnehmen!
[en][EVM 11.09.15: English translation (2.5.x)]The open quantity ({0}) is smaller than the ordered quantity for '{1}'. Please reduce the ordered quantity or contact your local support Hotline!
[fr][ARE 11.09.15: French translation (2.5.x)]La quantité ouverte ({0}) est plus petite que la quantité commandée '{1}'. Veuillez réduire la quantité commandée ou contacter notre centre logistique!
[it][MAL 11.09.15: Italian translation (2.5.x)]La quantità aperta ({0}) è inferiore alla quantità ordinata per '{1}'. Si prega di ridurre la quantità ordinata o contattare la Linea Diretta della vostra assistenza locale!
[es][JUR 11.09.15: Spanish translation (2.5.x)]La cantidad abierta ({0}) es menor que la cantidad pedida para '{1}'. ¡Por favor, reduzca la cantidad pedida o contacte con su línea de atención al cliente!
[cs][MNO 11.09.15: Czech translation (2.5.x)]Otevřené množství ve smlouvě ({0}) je menší než objednáné množství pro '{1}'. Prosím snižte množství nebo kontaktujte Váš CRH Hotline!
[sk][PPR 11.09.15: Slovak translation (2.5.x)]Dostupné množstvo ({0}) je menšie ako objednané pre '{1}'. Prosím znížte objednané množstvo, alebo kontaktujte linku CRH!
[hu][VHE 11.09.15: Hungarian translation (2.5.x)]A megrendelhető mennyiség ({0}) kevesebb mint a megrendelt mennyiség '{1}'. Kérjük csökkentse a megrendelt mennyiséget, vagy lépjen kapcsolatba értékesítő kollégánkkal!
[ro][VUN 11.09.15: Romanian translation (2.5.x)]Cantitatea disponibila ({0}) este mai mica decat cantitatea comandata '{1}'. Va rog sa reduceti cantitatea comandata sau sa contactati responsabilul local.
[bg][RTO 13.08.12: Bulgarian translation (2.0.10.0)]Отвореното количество ({0}) е по-малко от поръчаното количество за '{1}'. Моля намалете поръчаното количество или се свържете с Холсим Гореща линя!
[hr][DBE 13.08.12: Croatian translation (2.0.10.0)]Otvorena količina ({0}) je manja od naručene količine '{1}'. Molimo smanjite naručenu količinu
[sr][EVM 13.08.12: Remains in English (2.0.10.0)]The open quantity ({0}) is smaller than the ordered quantity for '{1}'. Please reduce the ordered quantity or contact your Holcim Hotline!
[ru][EDU 13.08.12: Russian translation (2.0.10.0)]Фактическое количество ({0}) меньше количетва в заказе '{1}'. Пожалуйста, количество в заказе или свяжитесь со службой горячей линии "LH"
[pl][EVM 13.08.12: Remains in English (2.0.10.0)]The open quantity ({0}) is smaller than the ordered quantity for '{1}'. Please reduce the ordered quantity or contact your Holcim Hotline!
[az][FKA 11.09.15: Azeri translation (2.5.x)]Açıq miqdar ({0}) {1}' üçün sifariş olunmuş miqdardan azdır. Xahiş olunur, sifariş miqdarını azaldın, ya da Zavodun qaynar xəttinə müraciət edin!
[tr][EVM 13.08.12: Remains in English (2.0.10.0)]The open quantity ({0}) is smaller than the ordered quantity for '{1}'. Please reduce the ordered quantity or contact your Holcim Hotline!
[nl][EVM 11.09.15: Remains in English (2.5.x)]The open quantity ({0}) is smaller than the ordered quantity for '{1}'. Please reduce the ordered quantity or contact your local support Hotline!
webbestellung.information.additem:
[de][EVM 02.07.12: German translation]Zusäztliche Auftragspositionen nur für Sack Bestellungen möglich
[en][EVM 03.05.12: English translation]Add new order item. Only possible for bag orders.
[fr][JJF 04.05.12: French translation]positions de commande additionelles seulement possibles pour commandes de sacs.
[it][EVM 03.05.12: Italian translation]Aggiunta di nuove posizioni possibile solo per i sacchi.
[es][EVM 21.11.12: Spanish translation (2.1.0.5)]Añadir nuevos artículos sólo será posible si son de tipo saco.
[cs][MNO 30.04.13: Czech translation (2.1.5.0)]Přidat novou položku do Objednávky. Možné pouze pro balené materiály.
[sk][PPR 01.05.13: Slovak translation (2.1.5.0)]Pridaj novú položku objednávky. Možné pre objednávky baleného materiálu.
[hu][LKO 14.05.13: Hungarian translations (2.1.5.0)]Új rendelési elem hozzáadása.Csak zsákos rendelés lehetséges.
[ro][CLU 29.04.13: Romanian translation (2.1.5.0)]Adaugati un nou element in comanda. Posibil numai pentru comenzi saci
[bg][IDO 09.05.13: Bulgarian translation (2.1.5.0)]Добави нов елемент на поръчката. Възможно само за поръчки за опакован цимент.
[hr][DBE 28.11.13: Croatian translation (2.2.0.8)]Dodaj novu stavku na narudžbu. Moguće je samo za narudžbu za uvrećani materijal.
[sr][EVM 09.11.13: Remains in English]Add new order item. Only possible for bag orders.
[ru][EDU 02.09.14: Russian translation (2.2.7.0)]Добавить новую строчку заказа. Возможно только для тары.
[pl][EVM 28.11.13: Remains in English]Add new order item. Only possible for bag orders.
[az][FKA 04.06.14: Azeri translation (2.2.7.0)]Yeni sifariş bəndini əlavə edin. Ancaq kisə sifarişləri üçün mümkündür.
[tr][EVM 01.10.13: Remains in English (2.2.7.0)]Add new order item. Only possible for bag orders.
[nl][ARE 11.09.15: Dutch translation (2.5.x)]Item toevoegen enkel mogelijk voor orders zakgoed
webbestellung.information.item.deliverytype.delivery:
[de][CMA 18.11.15: German translation (2.6.1.2)]Die Bestellung wird durch ihren Lieferanten geliefert (Abholung nicht möglich)
[en][EVM 11.09.15: English translation (2.5.x)]Delivery is required, the order will be delivered by your Supplying Company.
[fr][ARE 11.09.15: French translation (2.5.x)]La commande sera livrée par nos soins, enlèvement impossible.
[it][MAL 11.09.15: Italian translation (2.5.x)]Informazioni di consegna obbligatorie, l'ordine sarà consegnato dalla vostra Società Fornitrice.
[es][JUR 11.09.15: Spanish translation (2.5.x)]El pedido será entregado en destino(pick-up no posible). La traducción sería: "Entrega requerida, su compañía de suministro entregará el pedido."
[cs][MNO 11.09.15: Czech translation (2.5.x)]Dodávka je vyžadována, objednávka bude dodána CRH.
[sk][PPR 11.09.15: Slovak translation (2.5.x)]Dodávka je nutná, objednávka bude dodaná CRH.
[hu][VHE 11.09.15: Hungarian translation (2.5.x)]Szállítás szükséges, a megrendelést a CRH fogja szállítani.
[ro][VUN 11.09.15: Romanian translation (2.5.x)]Livrarea este necesara. Comanda va fi livrata de catre furnizor.
[bg][RTO 13.08.12: Bulgarian translation (2.0.10.0)]Доставка е задължителна, доставката ще бъде доставена от Холсим.
[hr][DBE 11.09.15: Croatian translation (2.5.x)]Dostava je tražena, narudžba će biti isporučena od strane Holcima.
[sr][EVM 13.08.12: Remains in English (2.0.10.0)]Delivery is required, the order will be delivered by Holcim.
[ru][EDU 13.08.12: Russian translation (2.0.10.0)]Доставка требуется, заказ будет выполнен транспортом Поставщика
[pl][EVM 13.08.12: Remains in English (2.0.10.0)]Delivery is required, the order will be delivered by Holcim.
[az][FKA 11.09.15: Azeri translation (2.5.x)]Təslim tələb olunur, sifariş təcizat kompaniyasi tərəfindən təslim ediləcək.
[tr][EVM 13.08.12: Remains in English (2.0.10.0)]Delivery is required, the order will be delivered by Holcim.
[nl][EVM 11.09.15: Remains in English (2.5.x)]Delivery is required, the order will be delivered by your Supplying Company.
webbestellung.information.notchangeablepickup:
[de][EVM 02.07.12: German translation]Liefertyp kann nicht geändert werden, da die erste Auftragsposition diesen Liefertyp verlangt.
[en][EVM 03.05.12: English translation]Not possible to change the delivery from pickup in case the first item requires this kind of delivery.
[fr][JJF 04.05.12: French translation]type de livraison ne peut pas être changé, car la premiere position de cette commande determine ce type de livraison.
[it][EVM 16.05.12: Italian translation]Non è possibile ritirare a causa del modo di consegna del primo articolo dell'ordine.
[es][EVM 21.11.12: Spanish translation (2.1.0.5)]El tipo de entrega no puede ser modificado porque el primer artículo del pedido requiere de este tipo de entrega.
[cs][MNO 30.04.13: Czech translation (2.1.5.0)]Není možné změnit dodávku z "Vlastní odvoz" v případě, že první položka vyžaduje tento typ dodávky.
[sk][PPR 01.05.13: Slovak translation (2.1.5.0)]Nedá sa zmeniť typ dodávky v prípade, že prvá položka vyžaduje tento spôsob dodania.
[hu][LKO 14.05.13: Hungarian translations (2.1.5.0)]Szállítás típusa nem változtatható meg, mert az első rendű tétel megkövetelei az ilyen fajta szállítást.
[ro][CLU 29.04.13: Romanian translation (2.1.5.0)]Nu este posibila schimbarea livrarii de la pick-up in cazul in care primul articol cere acest tip de livrare.
[bg][IDO 09.05.13: Bulgarian translation (2.1.5.0)]Не възможно да се променя доставката от трансфер в случай, че първият артикул изисква този вид доставка.
[hr][DBE 28.11.13: Croatian translation (2.2.0.8)]Nije moguće izmijeniti formu sa CPT na FCA u slučaju da prva stavka zahtijeva tu vrstu otpreme.
[sr][EVM 09.11.13: Remains in English]Not possible to change the delivery from pickup in case the first item requires this kind of delivery.
[ru][EDU 02.09.14: Russian translation (2.2.7.0)]Невозможно изменить вид доставки, если изначально заказе создан для самовывоза.
[pl][EVM 28.11.13: Remains in English]Not possible to change the delivery from pickup in case the first item requires this kind of delivery.
[az][FKA 04.06.14: Azeri translation (2.2.7.0)]Sifarişin birinci bəndi təslimin bu formasını tələb edirsə, təslimi dəyişmək mümkün deyil.
[tr][EVM 01.10.13: Remains in English (2.2.7.0)]Not possible to change the delivery from pickup in case the first item requires this kind of delivery.
[nl][ARE 11.09.15: Dutch translation (2.5.x)]Het leveringstype kan niet worden veranderd.  Het eerste item bepaald het leveringstype
webbestellung.information.item.deliverytype.pickup:
[de][AdN 01.01.12: German translation (2.0.0.8)]Abholung ist möglich.
[en][EVM 03.05.12: English translation]Delivery is not required, the order can be picked up at the shipping point.
[fr][JJF 04.05.12: French translation]Enlèvement possible
[it][EVM 17.05.12: Italian translation]Ritiro autorizzato.
[es][EVM 21.11.12: Spanish translation (2.1.0.5)]Recogida permitida.
[cs][MNO 30.04.13: Czech translation (2.1.5.0)]Dodávka není vyžadována, objednávka může být vyzvednuta v místě nakládky.
[sk][PPR 01.05.13: Slovak translation (2.1.5.0)]Dodávka nie je požadovaná, objednávka sa môže vyzdvihnúť na mieste nakládky.
[hu][LKO 14.05.13: Hungarian translations (2.1.5.0)]Szállítás nem kötelező, a rendelést át lehet venni a kiadó helyen.
[ro][CLU 29.04.13: Romanian translation (2.1.5.0)]Livrare nu este ceruta. Comanda poate fi ridicata de Punctul de Expeditie.
[bg][IDO 09.05.13: Bulgarian translation (2.1.5.0)]Доставка не е задължителна, поръчката може да бъде взета от точката за изпращане.
[hr][DBE 28.11.13: Croatian translation (2.2.0.8)]Dostava nije potrebna, narudžba će biti preuzeta na mjestu isporuke.
[sr][EVM 09.11.13: Remains in English]Delivery is not required, the order can be picked up at the shipping point.
[ru][EDU 02.09.14: Russian translation (2.2.7.0)]Доставка не требуется, возможен самовывоз на пункте отгрузки.
[pl][EVM 28.11.13: Remains in English]Delivery is not required, the order can be picked up at the shipping point.
[az][FKA 04.06.14: Azeri translation (2.2.7.0)]Təslim tələb olunmur, sifarişi  Göndəriş məntəqəsində təhvil almaq olar.
[tr][EVM 01.10.13: Remains in English (2.2.7.0)]Delivery is not required, the order can be picked up at the shipping point.
[nl][ARE 11.09.15: Dutch translation (2.5.x)]Ophaling mogelijk
webbestellung.information.item.firstmaterial:
[de][EVM 02.07.12: German translation]Um die erste Auftragsposition zu ändern, bitte alle anderen Positionen zuerst entfernen.
[en][EVM 03.05.12: English translation]As far there are more products in this order, the first item cannot be changed anymore. You need to remove all other items to be able to change this item.
[fr][JJF 04.05.12: French translation]pour changer la premiere position de commande, veuillez d'abord eliminer toutes les autres positions
[it][EVM 06.06.12: Italian translation]Per modificare il primo articolo dell'ordine, PF eliminare prima altri articoli.
[es][EVM 21.11.12: Spanish translation (2.1.0.5)]Para cambiar el primer artículo del pedido, por favor, elimine primero el resto de artículos.
[cs][MNO 30.04.13: Czech translation (2.1.5.0)]Pokud existuje více produktů v tomto pořadí, první položku již není možné změnit. Musíte odstranit všechny ostatní položky, aby bylo možné měnit tuto položku.
[sk][PPR 01.05.13: Slovak translation (2.1.5.0)]Ak je v tejto objednávke viac produktov, prvá položka sa už nedá zmeniť. Aby ste mohli zmeniť túto položku musíte všetky ostatné položky vymazať.
[hu][LKO 14.05.13: Hungarian translations (2.1.5.0)]Ha több termék van a megrendélben, akkor az elsőrendű elemet csak akkor tudja eltávolítani, ha az összes többi elemet eltávolítja.
[ro][CLU 29.04.13: Romanian translation (2.1.5.0)]Pentru a schimba primul articol din comanda va rugam sa eliminati restul articolelor mai intai.
[bg][IDO 09.05.13: Bulgarian translation (2.1.5.0)]Докато има повече продукти в тази поръчка, първият артикул не може да бъде променян. Трябва да премахнете всички други елементи, за да можете да промените този конкретен.
[hr][DBE 01.12.13: Croatian translation]Dok je više proizvoda u narudžbi, prva stavka se ne može mijenjati.
[sr][EVM 09.11.13: Remains in English]As far there are more products in this order, the first item cannot be changed anymore. You need to remove all other items to be able to change this item.
[ru][EDU 02.09.14: Russian translation (2.2.7.0)]Первый пункт не может быть изменен, т.к. в этом заказе много продуктов.  Вы должны удалить все другие пункты, чтобы иметь возможность изменить этот пункт.
[pl][EVM 01.12.13: Remains in English]As far there are more products in this order, the first item cannot be changed anymore. You need to remove all other items to be able to change this item.
[az][FKA 04.06.14: Azeri translation (2.2.7.0)]Bu sifarişdə çox mal olarsa, birinci bəndi dəyişmək mümkün olmayacaq. Siz birinci bənddə dəyişiklik etmək üçün bütün diəgr bəndləri silməlisiniz.
[tr][EVM 01.10.13: Remains in English (2.2.7.0)]As far there are more products in this order, the first item cannot be changed anymore. You need to remove all other items to be able to change this item.
[nl][ARE 11.09.15: Dutch translation (2.5.x)]Om het eerste item van het order te veranderen,dienen de andere items in het order verwijderd te worden.
