[bg][IDO 09.05.13: Bulgarian translation (2.1.5.0)]Непознат потребител. Моля свържете се с вашия системен администратор.
[hr][DBE 28.11.13: Croatian translation (2.2.0.8)]Nepoznati korisnik. Molimo kontaktirajte svog administratora.
[sr][EVM 09.11.13: Remains in English]Unknown user.  Please contact your system administrator.
[ru][EDU 02.09.14: Russian translation (2.2.7.0)]Неизвестный пользователь. Пожалуйста, свяжитесь с Вашим системным администратором.
[pl][EVM 28.11.13: Remains in English]Unknown user.  Please contact your system administrator.
[az][FKA 04.06.14: Azeri translation (2.2.7.0)]Naməlum istifadəçi. Zəhmət olmasa inzibatçı ilə əlaqə saxlayın.
[tr][EVM 01.10.13: Remains in English (2.2.7.0)]Unknown user.  Please contact your system administrator.
[nl][EVM 11.09.15: Remains in English (2.5.x)]Unknown user.  Please contact your system administrator.
errors.login.newPassword.contactSysadm3:
[de][JTI 13.08.12: German translation (2.0.1.0)]Ihr externer Zugriff ist gesperrt. Bitte nehmen Sie mit dem Systemadministrator Kontakt auf, wenn Sie Hilfe benötigen.
[en][AdN 05.07.12: English translation (2.0.1.0)]Your external login is locked. Please contact system administrator if you need help.
[fr][JJF 22.08.12: French translation (2.0.1.0)]Votre connexion externe est verrouillée. Veuillez contacter  l'administrateur système si vous avez besoin d'aide.
[it][MAL 13.08.12: Italian translation (2.0.1.0)]Il tuo accesso esterno è bloccato. Si prega di contattare l'amministratore di sistema se avete bisogno di assistenza
[es][EVM 21.11.12: Spanish translation (2.1.0.5)]Su inicio de sesión externo está bloqueado. Por favor, contacte con el administrador del sistema si necesita ayuda.
[cs][MNO 30.04.13: Czech translation (2.1.5.0)]Vaše externí přihlášení je zablokováno. Prosím kontaktujte administrátora pokud potřebujete pomoc.
[sk][PPR 01.05.13: Slovak translation (2.1.5.0)]Vaše externé prihlasovacie heslo je uzamknuté. Prosím kontaktujte správcu systému, ak potrebujete pomoc.
[hu][LKO 14.05.13: Hungarian translations (2.1.5.0)]Külső bejelentkezés le van zárva. Lépjen kapcsolatba a rendszergazdával, ha segítségre van szüksége.
[ro][CLU 29.04.13: Romanian translation (2.1.5.0)]Inceperea sesiune externe este blocata. Va rugam sa contactati administratorul de sistem daca aveti nevoie de ajutor
[bg][IDO 09.05.13: Bulgarian translation (2.1.5.0)]Вашият външен вход е заключен. Моля свържете се със системен администратор ако имате нужда от помощ.
[hr][DBE 28.11.13: Croatian translation (2.2.0.8)]Vaša vanjska prijava je zaključana. Molim kontaktirajte svog administratora ako trebate pomoć.
[sr][EVM 09.11.13: Remains in English]Your external login is locked. Please contact system administrator if you need help.
[ru][EDU 02.09.14: Russian translation (2.2.7.0)]Ваш внешний Логин закрыт. Если Вам необходима помощь, пожалуйста, свяжитесь с системным администратором.
[pl][EVM 28.11.13: Remains in English]Your external login is locked. Please contact system administrator if you need help.
[az][FKA 04.06.14: Azeri translation (2.2.7.0)]Sizin xarici girişiniz bağlıdır. Zəhmət olmasa inzibatçı ilə əlaqə saxlayın.
[tr][EVM 01.10.13: Remains in English (2.2.7.0)]Your external login is locked. Please contact system administrator if you need help.
[nl][EVM 11.09.15: Remains in English (2.5.x)]Your external login is locked. Please contact system administrator if you need help.
info.login.newPassword.updated:
[de][JTI 13.08.12: German translation (2.0.1.0)]Ihr Kennwort wurde zurückgesetzt und per E-Mail an Ihre E-Mail-Adresse gesandt. Sollten Sie dieses in den nächsten Minuten nicht erhalten, dann überprüfen Sie bitte Ihre Spam- / Junk-Ordner.
[en][NHI 15.08.12: English translation (2.0.1.0)]Your password has been reset and sent by E-Mail to your E-Mail address. If you don't receive this in the next few minutes, then please check your spam / junk folder.
[fr][JJF 22.08.12: French translation (2.0.1.0)]Votre mot de passe a été réinitialisé et envoyé à votre adresse email. Si vous ne le recevez pas dans les prochaines minutes, veuillez vérifier votre dossier de courrier indésirable.
[it][RRI 22.08.12: Italian translation (2.0.1.0)]La tua password sarà resettata e spedita al tuo indirizzo E-mail. Se non ricevi la password nei prossimi minut, per favore controlla il tuo "spam/junk" folder
[es][EVM 21.11.12: Spanish translation (2.1.0.5)]Su contraseña ha sido restablecida y enviada por email a su dirección. Si no la recibe en  los próximos minutos, por favor, revise su bandeja de correo spam/no deseado.
[cs][MNO 30.04.13: Czech translation (2.1.5.0)]Vaše heslo bylo resetováno a zasláno e-mailem na Vaši adresu. Pokud jej neobdržíte během několika minut, prosím prověřte svůj SPAM adresář.
[sk][PPR 01.05.13: Slovak translation (2.1.5.0)]Vaše heslo bolo obnovené a poslané e-mailom na vašu e-mailovú adresu. Ak ju nedostanete v priebehu niekoľkých minút, prosím skontrolujte Váš spam / nevyžiadanú poštu.
[hu][LKO 14.05.13: Hungarian translations (2.1.5.0)]Jelszavát töröltük, és az új jelszavát elküldtük e-mailen az Ön e-mail címére. Ha nem kapja meg a levelet pár percen belül, akkor nézze meg a spam / junk mappát.
[ro][CLU 29.04.13: Romanian translation (2.1.5.0)]Parola dumneavoastra a fost resetata si trimisa prin e-mail la adresa dumneavoastra de E-mail. Daca nu o primiti in urmatoarele cateva minute, va rugam sa verificati folder spam/junk.
[bg][IDO 09.05.13: Bulgarian translation (2.1.5.0)]Вашата парола е обновена и изпратена посредством E-Mail до адреса на вашата електронна поща. Ако не го получите в следващите няколко минути, моля проверете вашето кошче / спам папка.
[hr][DBE 01.12.13: Croatian translation]Vaša lozinka je resetirana i poslana na Vašu E-mail adresu. Ako ne primite istu kroz nekoliko minuta
[sr][EVM 09.11.13: Remains in English]Your password has been reset and sent by E-Mail to your E-Mail address. If you don't receive this in the next few minutes, then please check your spam / junk folder.
[ru][EDU 02.09.14: Russian translation (2.2.7.0)]Ваш пароль был восстановлен и отправлен на электронную почту. В случае, если вы не получили письмо, пожалуйста, проверьте корзину.
[pl][EVM 01.12.13: Remains in English]Your password has been reset and sent by E-Mail to your E-Mail address. If you don't receive this in the next few minutes, then please check your spam / junk folder.
[az][FKA 04.06.14: Azeri translation (2.2.7.0)]Sizin parolunuz yeniləndi və elektron poçt ünvanınıza göndərildi. Bir neçə dəqiqə ərzində parolu almasanız, xahiş olunur, spam mesajlar qovluğunu yoxlayın.
[tr][EVM 01.10.13: Remains in English (2.2.7.0)]Your password has been reset and sent by E-Mail to your E-Mail address. If you don't receive this in the next few minutes, then please check your spam / junk folder.
[nl][EVM 11.09.15: Remains in English (2.5.x)]Your password has been reset and sent by E-Mail to your E-Mail address. If you don't receive this in the next few minutes, then please check your spam / junk folder.
