label.login.reset.extPassword.confirmation.intro:
[de][JTI 06.12.12: German translation (2.1.0.6)]In Kürze erhalten Sie eine Email mit Anweisungen, wie Sie ihr Password zu folgenden Bedingungen ändern können:
[en][AdN 14.11.12: English translation (2.1.0.5)]You should shortly receive an e-mail with instructions on how to reset your password if the following conditions apply:
[fr][LPR 21.11.12: French translation (2.1.0.5)]Dans quelques instants, vous devriez recevoir un email contenant les instructions à suivre afin de réinitialiser votre mot de passe, si les conditions suivantes s'appliquent:
[it][MAL 21.11.12 Italian translation: (2.1.0.5)]Dovresti ricevere a breve una e-mail con le istruzioni su come reimpostare la tua password se si applicano le seguenti applicazioni
[es][EVM 21.11.12: Spanish translation (2.1.0.5)]En breve recibirá un e-mail con las instrucciones para restablecer su contraseña, siempre y cuando:
[cs][MNO 30.04.13: Czech translation (2.1.5.0)]Brzy dostanete e-mail s instrukcemi, jak resetovat Vaše heslo, pokud jsou splněny následující podmínky:
[sk][PPR 01.05.13: Slovak translation (2.1.5.0)]Čoskoro by ste mali dostať e-mail s informáciami ako obnoviť vaše heslo ak platia nasledovné podmienky:
[hu][LKO 14.05.13: Hungarian translations (2.1.5.0)]Hamarosan kapni fog egy e-mailt, amiben le lesz írva, hogyan tudja törölni a jelszavát, ha az alábbi feltételek érvényesek:
[ro][CLU 29.04.13: Romanian translation (2.1.5.0)]Veti primi in curand un e-mail cu instructiuni cum sa va resetati parola daca sunt indeplinite urmatoarele conditii:
[bg][IDO 09.05.13: Bulgarian translation (2.1.5.0)]Скоро ще получите e-mail с инструкции как да обновите вашата парола ако са налице следните условия:
[hr][DBE 28.11.13: Croatian translation (2.2.0.8)]Ubrzo ćete primiti kratki E-mail sa instrukcijama kako resetirati lozinku te pratite sljedeće korake:
[sr][EVM 09.11.13: Remains in English]You should shortly receive an e-mail with instructions on how to reset your password if the following conditions apply:
[ru][EDU 02.09.14: Russian translation (2.2.7.0)]В ближайшее время вы получите e-mail с инструкциями по восстановлению пароля, если выполнены следующие условия:
[pl][EVM 28.11.13: Remains in English]You should shortly receive an e-mail with instructions on how to reset your password if the following conditions apply:
[az][FKA 04.06.14: Azeri translation (2.2.7.0)]Aşağıdakı hallarda sizə tezliklə parolun yenilənməsi qaydalarına dair e-mail gələcək:
[tr][EVM 01.10.13: Remains in English (2.2.7.0)]You should shortly receive an e-mail with instructions on how to reset your password if the following conditions apply:
[nl][EVM 11.09.15: Remains in English (2.5.x)]You should shortly receive an e-mail with instructions on how to reset your password if the following conditions apply:
