label.login.reset.extPassword.confirmation.outro:
[de][CMA 18.11.15: German translation (2.6.1.2)]Wenn Sie keine Email erhalten haben und Sie Ihr Passwort nicht zurücksetzen können, kontaktieren Sie bitte den zuständigen Helpdesk / Benutzersupport.
[en][EVM 11.09.15: English translation (2.5.x)]If you do not receive an e-mail and you cannot reset your password alone, please contact the usual helpdesk / user-support contact persons.
[fr][ARE 11.09.15: French translation (2.5.x)]Si vous ne recevez pas d'email et que vous ne pouvez pas réinitialiser votre mot de passe seul, veuillez contacter le hotline/votre centre logistique.
[it][MAL 11.09.15: Italian translation (2.5.x)]Se non ricevi un'e-mail e non riesci a reimpostare la tua password da solo, si prega di contattare l'helpdesk abituale/persona dell'assistenza tecnica
[es][JUR 11.09.15: Spanish translation (2.5.x)]Si no recibe un e-mail y no puede restablecer la contraseña por si mismo, por favor contacte con el servicio de asistencia habitual o su persona de contacto.
[cs][MNO 11.09.15: Czech translation (2.5.x)]Pokud neobdržíte e-mail a nemůžete si toto heslo obnovit sami, obraťte se na obvyklou uživatelskou podporu nebo kontaktujte CRH.
[sk][PPR 11.09.15: Slovak translation (2.5.x)]Ak nedostanete e-mail a nedokážete resetovať svoje heslo, prosím kontaktujte Vašu kontaktnú osobu z CRH
[hu][VHE 11.09.15: Hungarian translation (2.5.x)]Ha nem kap e-mailt, vagy nem tudja jelszavát megváltoztatni, kérjük lépjen kapcsolatba a logisztikai osztállyal/logisztikai csoportvezetővel.
[ro][VUN 11.09.15: Romanian translation (2.5.x)]Daca nu primiti un e-mail si nu reusiti sa va resetati parola, va rugam sa contactati responsabilul local.
[bg][RTO 13.08.12: Bulgarian translation (2.0.10.0)]Ако не получите e-mail и не можете да обновите вашата парола самостоятелно, моля свържете се с Хелпдеск / лице за контакти от Холсим
[hr][DBE 13.08.12: Croatian translation (2.0.10.0)]Ako niste primili E-mail i ako nemožete resetirati lozinku sami, molim kontaktirajte svou
[sr][EVM 13.08.12: Remains in English (2.0.10.0)]If you do not receive an e-mail and you cannot reset your password alone, please contact the usual helpdesk / user-support contact persons from Holcim.
[ru][EDU 13.08.12: Russian translation (2.0.10.0)]В случае, если вы не получили e-mail и не можете самостоятельно восстановить пароль, пожалуйста, свяжитесь со службой поддержки/контактным лицом службы поддержки LH
[pl][EVM 13.08.12: Remains in English (2.0.10.0)]If you do not receive an e-mail and you cannot reset your password alone, please contact the usual helpdesk / user-support contact persons from Holcim.
[az][FKA 11.09.15: Azeri translation (2.5.x)]Əgər e-maili almamısınızsa və parolunuzu yeniləyə bilmirsinizsə, xahiş olunur, Zavodun məlumat bürosuna/ istifadəçi dəstəyinə müraciət edin.
[tr][EVM 13.08.12: Remains in English (2.0.10.0)]If you do not receive an e-mail and you cannot reset your password alone, please contact the usual helpdesk / user-support contact persons from Holcim.
[nl][EVM 11.09.15: Remains in English (2.5.x)]If you do not receive an e-mail and you cannot reset your password alone, please contact the usual helpdesk / user-support contact persons.
